  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__university_sport_multicultural_understanding">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_integration_outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학 스포츠 기반 다문화 이해 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Multicultural understanding through university sport</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Olympism and Sport Culture Education: East Asian Approaches</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2009</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">International Journal of Human Movement Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학 스포츠 참여를 통해 국제학생과 지역학생 간 상호이해가 높아지는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학 스포츠 참여를 통해 국제학생과 지역학생 간 상호이해가 높아지는 성과임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__university_sport_multicultural_understanding</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Multicultural understanding through university sport</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대학 스포츠 참여를 통해 국제학생과 지역학생 간 상호이해가 높아지는 성과임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Multicultural understanding through university sport</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">대학 스포츠 기반 다문화 이해 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__national_fitness_certification_activity_guidance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국민체력인증 기반 신체활동 안내</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical activity guidance based on national fitness certification</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체활동량이 삶의 질과 주관적 건강에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">empirical_study</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동방법, 운동량, 횟수, 시간, 일상 실천방안을 기준으로 신체활동 프로그램 개발을 논의함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">v45 추가 인스턴스</isp:note>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">v45_batch</isp:source_identifier>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__national_fitness_certification_activity_guidance</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Physical activity guidance based on national fitness certification</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Physical activity guidance based on national fitness certification in the support_resource dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Physical activity guidance based on national fitness certification</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">국민체력인증 기반 신체활동 안내</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__mobile_health_self_management_service">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#online_remote_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__mobile_health_self_management_service</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">모바일 헬스케어 자기관리 서비스</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">mobile health self-management service</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스마트폰 앱을 통해 건강정보, 운동량, 생체정보 등을 확인하고 자가 건강관리를 지원하는 서비스</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">모바일 헬스케어 앱 이미지가 이용자의 만족, 재방문의도 및 추천의도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__mobile_healthcare_app"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__mobile_healthcare_user_satisfaction"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__health_management_continuity_via_app"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">mobile health self-management service</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">스마트폰 앱을 통해 건강정보, 운동량, 생체정보 등을 확인하고 자가 건강관리를 지원하는 서비스</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">mobile health self-management service</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">모바일 헬스케어 자기관리 서비스</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__youth_volleyball_participation_base_expansion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년배구 선수층 확대</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Expansion of youth volleyball participant base</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년배구클럽 활성화를 통해 선수층과 참여 기반이 확대되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">배구기사분석을 통한 한국 유소년배구 활성화 방안 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년배구클럽 활성화를 통한 선수층 확대가 가장 중요한 과제로 나타남.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__youth_volleyball_participation_base_expansion</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Expansion of youth volleyball participant base</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">유소년배구클럽 활성화를 통해 선수층과 참여 기반이 확대되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Expansion of youth volleyball participant base</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">유소년배구 선수층 확대</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__water_safety_problem_solving_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__water_safety_problem_solving_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수상안전 문제해결력 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">water safety problem-solving improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수상안전 상황에 적절하게 대응할 수 있는 문제해결 능력이 향상되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수상안전교육 프로그램의 효과성 검증: 창의·인성 함양을 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">실험군에서 표현력과 문제해결력이 유의하게 향상됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">water safety problem-solving improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">수상안전 상황에 적절하게 대응할 수 있는 문제해결 능력이 향상되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">water safety problem-solving improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">수상안전 문제해결력 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__school_sport_club_service_delivery_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#service_delivery_efficiency"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">학교스포츠클럽 운영 전달체계 개선</rdfs:label>
