    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Increased emotional and cognitive engagement in PE</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Self-determination Theory Approach to Understanding Engagement in Physical Education: Effects of Psychological Needs Satisfaction on Four Dimensions of Engagement</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육수업에서 즐거움, 관심, 사고, 이해와 관련된 참여 수준이 증가하는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육수업에서 즐거움, 관심, 사고, 이해와 관련된 참여 수준이 증가하는 성과임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__pe_emotional_cognitive_engagement_increase</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Increased emotional and cognitive engagement in PE</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육수업에서 즐거움, 관심, 사고, 이해와 관련된 참여 수준이 증가하는 성과임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Increased emotional and cognitive engagement in PE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육수업 정서·인지적 참여 증가</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__nutrition_quotient_dietary_self_efficacy_tool">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#measurement_tool_resource"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">영양지수·식이효능감 평가도구</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Nutrition quotient and dietary self-efficacy assessment tool</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 선수의 영양상태와 식이행동 실천 역량을 평가하는 측정 자원.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">범이론적 모델에 근거한 청소년 학생 운동선수의 식이행동변화단계에 따른 영양지수 및 식이효능감 비교</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Exercise Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">변화단계에 따라 영양지수와 식이효능감 차이를 비교함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__nutrition_quotient_dietary_self_efficacy_tool</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Nutrition quotient and dietary self-efficacy assessment tool</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">청소년 선수의 영양상태와 식이행동 실천 역량을 평가하는 측정 자원.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Nutrition quotient and dietary self-efficacy assessment tool</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">영양지수·식이효능감 평가도구</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__park_based_youth_jogging_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#spatial_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__park_based_youth_jogging_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">공원 기반 청소년 조깅 참여 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Park-based youth jogging context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년이 공원이라는 지역사회 공간에서 조깅을 수행하는 공간적 참여 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An Empirical Phenomenological Study of Youths’ Experiences Jogging in Singapore Parks</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1-16</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Six youth joggers aged 17-19 discussed experiences of jogging in Singapore parks; park jogging elicited positive experiences, reduced negative thoughts and stress, promoted well-being, sense of belonging, personal growth, and academic performance.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Park-based youth jogging context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">청소년이 공원이라는 지역사회 공간에서 조깅을 수행하는 공간적 참여 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Park-based youth jogging context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">공원 기반 청소년 조깅 참여 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__2019_revised_nuri_course">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#national_policy"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__2019_revised_nuri_course</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019 개정 누리과정</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019 revised Nuri curriculum</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">만 3~5세 유아의 놀이 중심 교육과 현장 운영을 지원하는 국가 수준의 유아교육 과정</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019 개정 누리과정 놀이운영 사례집 내 기본움직임 요소 내용분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019 개정 누리과정의 현장 지원자료인 놀이 운영사례집 5권을 분석하여 만 3~5세 유아의 기본움직임기술 요소를 검토하였다. 분석 결과 안정성 움직임, 복합 이동성 움직임, 조작적 움직임 요소가 균형 있게 포함될 필요가 있으며, 유아 신체 기본움직임 프로그램 지원과 교사 연수 필요가 제시되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_content_analysis</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:uses_policy_instrument rdf:resource="#policy_instrument__nuri_play_operation_guideline_standard"/>
    <isp:shapes_participation_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__nuri_early_childhood_play_context"/>
    <isp:has_policy_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__balanced_fundamental_movement_activity_inclusion"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">2019 revised Nuri curriculum</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">만 3~5세 유아의 놀이 중심 교육과 현장 운영을 지원하는 국가 수준의 유아교육 과정</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">2019 revised Nuri curriculum</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">2019 개정 누리과정</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__paralympic_knowledge_network_dataset">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__paralympic_knowledge_network_dataset</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패럴림픽 국제연구 지식네트워크 자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Paralympic international research knowledge network dataset</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패럴림픽 관련 국제연구 1,019편의 키워드 기반 지식구조와 연구동향을 분석한 자료.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지식 네트워크 분석을 활용한 패럴림픽 관련 국제 연구의 동향 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패럴림픽 국제연구 1,019편의 2,119개 키워드를 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:enables_participation_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__international_paralympic_research_context"/>
    <isp:conditions_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__paralympic_inclusion_research_agenda_identification"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Paralympic international research knowledge network dataset</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">패럴림픽 관련 국제연구 1,019편의 키워드 기반 지식구조와 연구동향을 분석한 자료.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Paralympic international research knowledge network dataset</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">패럴림픽 국제연구 지식네트워크 자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#is_program_supported_by_resource">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#ontology_entity"/>
