  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__golf_field_lesson_continuity_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__golf_field_lesson_continuity_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">골프 필드레슨 운동지속 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">golf field lesson exercise-continuation context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">필드레슨 참여자의 그릿이 마인드셋과 운동지속에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">필드레슨은 시간과 비용이 높게 형성되어 있어 참가자의 목표 성취와 지속 참여가 중요하게 다루어진다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:provides_delivery_context_for rdf:resource="#program__golf_field_lesson_mindset_support"/>
    <isp:conditions_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__golf_field_lesson_growth_mindset_improvement"/>
    <isp:conditions_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__golf_field_lesson_exercise_continuation_strengthening"/>
    <isp:interacts_with_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__golf_field_lesson_participants"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">golf field lesson exercise-continuation context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing golf field lesson exercise-continuation context in the participation_context dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">golf field lesson exercise-continuation context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">골프 필드레슨 운동지속 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__golf_field_lesson_participants"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__aquatic_rehabilitation_instructor_professionalism_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__aquatic_rehabilitation_instructor_professionalism_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수중재활운동 지도자 전문성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  aquatic rehabilitation instructor professionalism improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성 수중재활운동 지도자의 전문성 발달 과정에 관한 내러티브 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장기 경력 여성 수중재활운동 지도자 1명의 내러티브를 통해 물의 리듬, 직관적 안전관리, 개별화 지도전략, 멘토링 기반 전문성 형성 과정을 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outcome  aquatic rehabilitation instructor professionalism improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing outcome  aquatic rehabilitation instructor professionalism improvement in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outcome  aquatic rehabilitation instructor professionalism improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">수중재활운동 지도자 전문성 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__integrated_long_term_athlete_development_system">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#sport_policy"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__integrated_long_term_athlete_development_system</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">통합 장기 선수 발달 시스템</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">integrated long term athlete development system</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">아동기부터 성인기까지 선수 발달을 체계적으로 연계하는 국가 수준의 장기 선수발달 정책 체계</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 선진국의 장기적인 선수 발달 시스템 분석을 통한 우리나라 시스템 개선 방안 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">캐나다, 영국, 독일, 일본의 장기 선수 발달 시스템을 검토하고, 다양한 스포츠 참여 기회 제공, 통합 운영 전담기구, 지속성과 전문성 확보를 국내 개선 방안으로 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:implements_program rdf:resource="#program__multi_sport_talent_exploration_pathway"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">integrated long term athlete development system</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">아동기부터 성인기까지 선수 발달을 체계적으로 연계하는 국가 수준의 장기 선수발달 정책 체계</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">integrated long term athlete development system</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">통합 장기 선수 발달 시스템</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__special_school_asd_group_intervention_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_institution"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__special_school_asd_group_intervention_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특수학교 자폐스펙트럼 아동 집단 중재 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Special-school group intervention context for children with ASD</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특수학교 실험센터와 연계하여 자폐스펙트럼 아동에게 집단형 음악·스포츠 활동 중재를 제공하는 학교 기반 참여 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Combined Orff Music And Sports Activity To Enhances Autism Children’s Social Skills: Trials Of Intervention Effectiveness</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022 3rd Asia Sport Science Conference Abstracts</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">conference_abstract</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">107-109</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The conference abstract recruited twenty-two children with ASD and applied a 9-week Orff music combined sports game intervention three times per week. The intervention improved social skills in children with mild to moderate ASD, with better social interaction effects in the experimental group than the sports-game control group.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Special-school group intervention context for children with ASD</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">특수학교 실험센터와 연계하여 자폐스펙트럼 아동에게 집단형 음악·스포츠 활동 중재를 제공하는 학교 기반 참여 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Special-school group intervention context for children with ASD</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">특수학교 자폐스펙트럼 아동 집단 중재 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
