  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__female_students_generalized_anxiety_risk_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#mental_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__female_students_generalized_anxiety_risk_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여학생 범불안 위험 완화</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reduced generalized anxiety risk among female students</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">우리나라 여자 고등학생의 학교 체육수업 참여 정도에 따른 주관적 건강인지 및 범불안장애 수준 비교</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022년 청소년건강행태조사 자료를 활용하여 여자 고등학생의 체육수업 참여 정도가 신체활동, 좌식행동, 스마트폰 사용, 정신건강, 주관적 건강인지, 범불안장애 수준과 관련됨을 분석함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022년 청소년건강행태조사 자료를 활용하여 여자 고등학생의 체육수업 참여 정도가 신체활동, 좌식행동, 스마트폰 사용, 정신건강, 주관적 건강인지, 범불안장애 수준과 관련됨을 분석함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Reduced generalized anxiety risk among female students</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">2022년 청소년건강행태조사 자료를 활용하여 여자 고등학생의 체육수업 참여 정도가 신체활동, 좌식행동, 스마트폰 사용, 정신건강, 주관적 건강인지, 범불안장애 수준과 관련됨을 분석함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Reduced generalized anxiety risk among female students</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">여학생 범불안 위험 완화</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__school_bag_load_carriage_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_institution"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교 가방 하중 부담 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">School backpack load-carriage context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">등하교와 학교생활 과정에서 학습자료를 운반하며 가방 하중에 반복적으로 노출되는 학교 참여 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analytical parameters to check association between load carriage system and bag packs-influenced musculoskeletal complications among school going students: a scoping review</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">review_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">20-26</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The scoping review found that backpack load and load-carriage systems among school-going students were associated with lower back, shoulder, and neck pain and postural abnormalities, and recommended broader evaluation and preventive approaches.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:reflects_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__school_students_backpack_musculoskeletal_support"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__school_bag_load_carriage_context</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">School backpack load-carriage context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">등하교와 학교생활 과정에서 학습자료를 운반하며 가방 하중에 반복적으로 노출되는 학교 참여 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">School backpack load-carriage context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학교 가방 하중 부담 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__school_students_backpack_musculoskeletal_support"/>
  </rdf:Description>
