  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__community_health_equity_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#integrated_policy_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__community_health_equity_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역사회 건강형평성 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">community health equity context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">소득과 교육수준이 낮은 집단의 건강위험을 완화하기 위한 지역사회 신체활동 지원 맥락.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역사회 저소득 취약계층 주민을 위한 1년간의 운동프로그램이 대사 및 심혈관 건강 위험요인에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저소득자는 운동 및 여가활동에 경제적 제약이 있고 대사성질환 위험에 취약할 수 있다고 설명하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">community health equity context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">소득과 교육수준이 낮은 집단의 건강위험을 완화하기 위한 지역사회 신체활동 지원 맥락.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">community health equity context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">지역사회 건강형평성 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__disabled_elderly_active_aging_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#quality_of_life_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__disabled_elderly_active_aging_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애노인 액티브 에이징 지원</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Active aging support for elderly people with disabilities</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애노인의 액티브 에이징을 위한 사회심리요인 분석연구: 맥락전이모델을 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애노인의 신체활동 참여는 건강, 사회참여, 삶의 질과 관련된 액티브 에이징의 조건으로 논의되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v58 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Active aging support for elderly people with disabilities</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Active aging support for elderly people with disabilities in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Active aging support for elderly people with disabilities</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애노인 액티브 에이징 지원</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__lifelong_sport_habit_formation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_continuity"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__lifelong_sport_habit_formation</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">평생스포츠 습관 형성</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">lifelong sport habit formation</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년 생활체육 영역에서의 교육: 무엇을 어떻게 가르치고 있는가?</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년 생활체육 참여가 운동습관 형성과 평생스포츠 참여에 중요한 역할을 한다고 설명함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">lifelong sport habit formation</rdfs:label>
