    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">What Considerations are There Related to the PBL Model Using Technologies in a Physically Active Environment?</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생들이 신체활동 수행과 문제해결 과정을 동시에 경험하는 체육수업 맥락임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생들이 신체활동 수행과 문제해결 과정을 동시에 경험하는 체육수업 맥락임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__physically_active_pbl_learning_environment</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Physically active PBL learning environment</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학생들이 신체활동 수행과 문제해결 과정을 동시에 경험하는 체육수업 맥락임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Physically active PBL learning environment</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">신체활동 기반 PBL 학습환경</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__basic_psychological_needs_support_taekwondo">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#youth_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__basic_psychological_needs_support_taekwondo</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">기본심리욕구 지원 태권도 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">basic psychological needs-supportive taekwondo program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 태권도 수련생의 자율성, 유능성, 관계성 욕구 만족을 높여 라이프스킬 개발을 촉진하는 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 태권도 수련생의 기본심리욕구와 라이프스킬에 관한 구조모형 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자들은 수련생들의 기본심리욕구 만족을 위한 지도 전략을 사용해야 한다고 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__adolescent_taekwondo_trainees"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__adolescent_taekwondo_life_skill_training"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__taekwondo_life_skills_development"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__adolescent_positive_youth_development"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">basic psychological needs-supportive taekwondo program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">청소년 태권도 수련생의 자율성, 유능성, 관계성 욕구 만족을 높여 라이프스킬 개발을 촉진하는 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">basic psychological needs-supportive taekwondo program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">기본심리욕구 지원 태권도 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__adolescent_taekwondo_trainees"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__adolescent_integrated_health_management_support">
