  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__implicit_video_cue_training_material">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__implicit_video_cue_training_material</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">암묵적 영상단서 훈련자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">implicit video cue training material</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">거리, 각도, 타이밍 단서를 언어 설명 없이 시각 영상으로 제공하는 훈련 자료.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지각기술훈련이 유소년 축구선수의 의사결정능력에 미치는 효과 검증</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">암묵적 집단은 중요 단서를 언어적 설명 없이 시각적 영상 기법으로 훈련하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">implicit video cue training material</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">거리, 각도, 타이밍 단서를 언어 설명 없이 시각 영상으로 제공하는 훈련 자료.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">implicit video cue training material</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">암묵적 영상단서 훈련자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__adult_physical_activity_guideline_promotion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__adult_physical_activity_guideline_promotion</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성인 신체활동 지침 준수 촉진 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Adult physical activity guideline adherence promotion program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성인의 신체활동 지침 준수와 건강위험 감소를 지원하는 역량강화 프로그램 인스턴스</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Association between Meeting Physical Activity Guidelines and Mortality in Korean Adults: An 8-year Prospective Study</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Exercise Nutrition and Biochemistry</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_url rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.20463/jenb.2016.0054</isp:source_url>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">23-24</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This prospective study used the Korean Longitudinal Study of Ageing with 9,177 adults aged 45 years or older over an 8-year follow-up. Meeting physical activity guidelines was associated with decreased all-cause mortality risk in Korean adults.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__korean_middle_older_adults_pa_guideline_support"/>
    <isp:uses_policy_instrument rdf:resource="#policy__korean_adult_physical_activity_guideline"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__guideline_based_moderate_vigorous_physical_activity"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__national_pa_guideline_adherence_context"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__all_cause_mortality_risk_reduction_pa_guideline"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Adult physical activity guideline adherence promotion program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">성인의 신체활동 지침 준수와 건강위험 감소를 지원하는 역량강화 프로그램 인스턴스</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Adult physical activity guideline adherence promotion program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">성인 신체활동 지침 준수 촉진 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__korean_middle_older_adults_pa_guideline_support"/>
  </rdf:Description>
