    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">adapted physical activity instructors in ethics practice</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특수체육 실천 현장에서 윤리적 판단과 실천 역량이 요구되는 지도자 집단.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특수체육실천영역에 관한 윤리학적 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특수체육지도자의 윤리적 판단과 윤리교육 필요성을 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reasoner-consistency fix: removed direct target_group typing because the individual is typed as physical_education_teacher under support_resource, and support_resource is disjoint with target_group.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">adapted physical activity instructors in ethics practice</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">특수체육 실천 현장에서 윤리적 판단과 실천 역량이 요구되는 지도자 집단.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">adapted physical activity instructors in ethics practice</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">특수체육 윤리실천 지도자</skos:prefLabel>
