  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__university_athlete_social_inclusion_retirement_anxiety_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_integration_support_program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학운동선수 사회통합·은퇴불안 지원 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">University athlete social inclusion and retirement anxiety support program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회적 배제 경험을 줄이고 은퇴불안과 포기의도를 완화하기 위한 대학운동선수 지원 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학운동선수의 사회적 배제경험이 은퇴불안 및 포기의도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회적 배제 경험과 은퇴불안 및 포기의도의 관계를 분석하고 효과적 대책의 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__university_athlete_social_inclusion_retirement_anxiety_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__university_athletes_social_exclusion_risk"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__university_team_social_exclusion_context"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__retirement_anxiety_reduction"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__sport_dropout_intention_reduction"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">University athlete social inclusion and retirement anxiety support program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사회적 배제 경험을 줄이고 은퇴불안과 포기의도를 완화하기 위한 대학운동선수 지원 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">University athlete social inclusion and retirement anxiety support program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">대학운동선수 사회통합·은퇴불안 지원 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__university_athletes_social_exclusion_risk"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__elderly_people_with_disabilities">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#disabled_person"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__elderly_people_with_disabilities</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애노인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Elderly people with disabilities</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애노인의 액티브 에이징을 위한 사회심리요인 분석연구: 맥락전이모델을 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">65세 이상 등록 장애인을 대상으로 액티브 에이징을 위한 신체활동 참여과정을 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v58 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Elderly people with disabilities</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Elderly people with disabilities in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Elderly people with disabilities</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애노인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__healthy_lifestyle_habit_drug_prevention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__healthy_lifestyle_habit_drug_prevention</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 건강생활습관 형성</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">healthy lifestyle habit formation among adolescents</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교 체육 프로그램이 청소년 약물 사용 예방에 미치는 영향에 대한 문헌고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장기적인 체육 활동은 청소년이 규칙적인 운동 습관을 형성하고 건강한 생활 방식을 유지하도록 돕는다고 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_result_of_program rdf:resource="#program__school_pe_adolescent_drug_prevention"/>
    <isp:reflects_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__adolescents_drug_use_prevention_pe"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">healthy lifestyle habit formation among adolescents</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing healthy lifestyle habit formation among adolescents in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">healthy lifestyle habit formation among adolescents</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">청소년 건강생활습관 형성</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__adolescents_drug_use_prevention_pe"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__coach_caring_mastery_guidance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__coach_caring_mastery_guidance</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">케어링·숙달 분위기 지도 지침</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">coach guidance for caring and mastery climate</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자가 수행중심보다 숙달중심 분위기와 지지적 관계를 조성하도록 돕는 태권도 선수 지도 지침.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">케어링 및 동기 분위기는 태권도 선수들의 도덕행동을 예측하는가</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자들은 선수들을 지지하고 수행중심보다 숙달중심 분위기를 조성해야 한다고 제안함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v67_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <isp:conditions_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__taekwondo_prosocial_behavior_growth"/>
    <isp:conditions_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__taekwondo_antisocial_behavior_reduction"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">coach guidance for caring and mastery climate</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지도자가 수행중심보다 숙달중심 분위기와 지지적 관계를 조성하도록 돕는 태권도 선수 지도 지침.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">coach guidance for caring and mastery climate</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">케어링·숙달 분위기 지도 지침</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__golf_leisure_participation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
