  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__college_pilates_wellbeing_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학생 필라테스 웰빙 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">College Pilates well-being program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학생의 신체적 자기개념과 심리적 행복감, 생활만족도 향상을 지원하는 필라테스 기반 신체활동 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학생 필라테스 참여자의 신체적 자기개념이 생활만족도에 미치는 영향: 심리적 행복감의 매개효과를 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체적 자기개념이 생활만족도에 미치는 영향에서 심리적 행복감이 부분 매개역할을 하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__college_pilates_participants"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__home_training"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__physical_self_concept_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__life_satisfaction_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__well_being_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__college_pilates_wellbeing_program</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">College Pilates well-being program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대학생의 신체적 자기개념과 심리적 행복감, 생활만족도 향상을 지원하는 필라테스 기반 신체활동 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">College Pilates well-being program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">대학생 필라테스 웰빙 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__college_pilates_participants"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__prader_willi_strength_aerobic_complex_exercise">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#rehabilitation_sport"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__prader_willi_strength_aerobic_complex_exercise</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프래더윌리증후군 근력·유산소 복합운동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Strength and aerobic complex exercise for Prader-Willi syndrome</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Changes in body composition, blood lipid profile, and growth factor hormone in a patient with Prader–willi syndrome during 24 weeks of complex exercise: a single case study</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Exercise Nutrition &amp; Biochemistry</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">복합운동은 strength and aerobic exercises로 구성됨</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">근력운동과 유산소운동을 결합한 치료적 신체활동으로 직접 제시됨</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Strength and aerobic complex exercise for Prader-Willi syndrome</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">근력운동과 유산소운동을 결합한 치료적 신체활동으로 직접 제시됨</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Strength and aerobic complex exercise for Prader-Willi syndrome</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">프래더윌리증후군 근력·유산소 복합운동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__separate_anti_doping_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__separate_anti_doping_program</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">별도 반도핑 교육프로그램 지침</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Separate anti-doping education program guidance</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수들의 자율성과 도핑 의도의 관계에서 도핑방지 교육 경험의 조절효과</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수의 자율성과 도핑의도 관계에서 도핑방지 교육 경험이 조절효과를 보이며, 의무교육을 넘어 별도의 반도핑 프로그램 개발 필요를 제시함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수의 자율성과 도핑의도 관계에서 도핑방지 교육 경험이 조절효과를 보이며, 의무교육을 넘어 별도의 반도핑 프로그램 개발 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean Journal of Convergence Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Separate anti-doping education program guidance</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">운동선수의 자율성과 도핑의도 관계에서 도핑방지 교육 경험이 조절효과를 보이며, 의무교육을 넘어 별도의 반도핑 프로그램 개발 필요를 제시함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Separate anti-doping education program guidance</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">별도 반도핑 교육프로그램 지침</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__finswimming_business_team_athletes">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#young_adult"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__finswimming_business_team_athletes</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">실업팀 핀수영 선수</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">business-team finswimming athletes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">핀수영 선수의 영양관련 상태와 영양교육 효과</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">실업팀에 소속된 핀수영 선수 11명을 대상으로 연구를 수행하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_targeted_by rdf:resource="#program__finswimming_athlete_nutrition_education"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">business-team finswimming athletes</rdfs:label>
