  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__international_paralympic_research_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#institutional_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__international_paralympic_research_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국제 패럴림픽 연구 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">international Paralympic research context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패럴림픽 연구에서 선수, 상해, 지체장애, 경기력, 등급분류, 포함 의제가 연결되는 국제 연구 맥락.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지식 네트워크 분석을 활용한 패럴림픽 관련 국제 연구의 동향 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패럴림픽 연구 주요 키워드로 athlete, injury, physical-impairment, performance, classification 등이 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">international Paralympic research context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">패럴림픽 연구에서 선수, 상해, 지체장애, 경기력, 등급분류, 포함 의제가 연결되는 국제 연구 맥락.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">international Paralympic research context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">국제 패럴림픽 연구 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__soccer_passing_performance_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_competence_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__soccer_passing_performance_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">축구 패스 수행 지원</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Soccer passing performance support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동장 표면 유형이 신체능력 및 축구 경기력에 미치는 영향; 체계적 검토</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">축구 경기력 중 패스 능력은 인조잔디에서 더 높은 것으로 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v52 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Soccer passing performance support</rdfs:label>
