    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Use of Herbal/Traditional Products Supplementation and Doping Tests in Elite Athletes</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2010</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">International Journal of Applied Sports Sciences</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">전통제품 보충제 사용 시 선수의 도핑 위험 인식과 반도핑 의사결정 능력이 향상되는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">전통제품 보충제 사용 시 선수의 도핑 위험 인식과 반도핑 의사결정 능력이 향상되는 성과임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__supplement_doping_consciousness_improvement</isp:entity_id>
