  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__asd_children_social_skills_sport_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#disabled_person"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__asd_children_social_skills_sport_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회성 지원이 필요한 자폐스펙트럼 아동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Children with ASD requiring social skills sport support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회적 의사소통과 상호작용의 어려움을 지니며 신체활동과 음악 기반 중재를 통해 사회성 지원이 필요한 자폐스펙트럼 아동 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Combined Orff Music And Sports Activity To Enhances Autism Children’s Social Skills: Trials Of Intervention Effectiveness</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022 3rd Asia Sport Science Conference Abstracts</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">conference_abstract</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">107-109</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The conference abstract recruited twenty-two children with ASD and applied a 9-week Orff music combined sports game intervention three times per week. The intervention improved social skills in children with mild to moderate ASD, with better social interaction effects in the experimental group than the sports-game control group.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Children with ASD requiring social skills sport support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사회적 의사소통과 상호작용의 어려움을 지니며 신체활동과 음악 기반 중재를 통해 사회성 지원이 필요한 자폐스펙트럼 아동 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Children with ASD requiring social skills sport support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">사회성 지원이 필요한 자폐스펙트럼 아동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__adult_taekwondo_participation_expansion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__adult_taekwondo_participation_expansion</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성인 태권도 참여 확대</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">adult taekwondo participation expansion</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도 참여가 유소년 중심을 넘어 성인 생활체육으로 확대되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자가 인식하는 성인부 태권도 운영 활성화 방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도를 유소년만의 운동이 아니라 전 연령층에 적합한 운동으로 홍보해야 한다고 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">adult taekwondo participation expansion</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">태권도 참여가 유소년 중심을 넘어 성인 생활체육으로 확대되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">adult taekwondo participation expansion</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">성인 태권도 참여 확대</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__female_adolescent_clustered_health_behavior_intervention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__female_adolescent_clustered_health_behavior_intervention</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여자 청소년 건강위험행동 군집 맞춤 중재</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cluster-tailored health behavior intervention for female adolescents</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">우리나라 여자 청소년의 신체활동, 식이행동, 수면에 따른 건강위험행동 군집유형과 정신건강상태와의 관련성</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2017년 청소년건강행태 온라인조사 자료를 분석하여 여자 청소년의 신체활동 부족, 식이행동, 수면 부족 군집유형과 정신건강상태의 관련성을 제시함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2017년 청소년건강행태 온라인조사 자료를 분석하여 여자 청소년의 신체활동 부족, 식이행동, 수면 부족 군집유형과 정신건강상태의 관련성을 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__female_adolescents_health_risk_behavior_clusters"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__female_adolescent_health_risk_cluster_dataset"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__female_adolescent_mental_health_status_improvement"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__sedentary_diet_sleep_risk_behavior_context"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cluster-tailored health behavior intervention for female adolescents</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">2017년 청소년건강행태 온라인조사 자료를 분석하여 여자 청소년의 신체활동 부족, 식이행동, 수면 부족 군집유형과 정신건강상태의 관련성을 제시함.</rdfs:comment>
