  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__para_baseball_for_physical_disabilities">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#disability_sport"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__para_baseball_for_physical_disabilities</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인 야구</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">para baseball for people with physical disabilities</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중도지체장애인의 신체 회복, 심리적 성장, 사회적 유대에 기여하는 장애인 야구 활동</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중도지체장애인 야구선수의 적응과정 및 경험 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">야구는 중도지체장애인에게 단순한 운동 이상의 의미를 제공하며 삶의 질 향상에 기여하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">para baseball for people with physical disabilities</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">중도지체장애인의 신체 회복, 심리적 성장, 사회적 유대에 기여하는 장애인 야구 활동</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">para baseball for people with physical disabilities</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애인 야구</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
