    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Pre Service Teacher School Bullying Prevention Awareness in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Pre Service Teacher School Bullying Prevention Awareness</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">예비교사 학교폭력 유형 및 예방대책 인식 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
