  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__sport_situation_ethics_awareness">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 상황윤리 의식 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sport situation ethics awareness improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경기 상황에서 공정성, 상대 존중, 심판 판정 존중 등 스포츠윤리를 인식하고 실천하는 역량 향상</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학 엘리트스포츠 지도자의 윤리적 리더십과 스포츠 윤리의식 및 경기력의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean Journal of Convergence Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 상황윤리는 경기력에 유의한 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__sport_situation_ethics_awareness</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sport situation ethics awareness improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기 상황에서 공정성, 상대 존중, 심판 판정 존중 등 스포츠윤리를 인식하고 실천하는 역량 향상</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Sport situation ethics awareness improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠 상황윤리 의식 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__body_weight_change">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__body_weight_change</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Body Weight Change</isp:pref_label_en>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Body Weight Change</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Body Weight Change in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Body Weight Change</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__task_involving_peer_climate_antidoping_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__task_involving_peer_climate_antidoping_program</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">과제중심 또래 동기 분위기 기반 반도핑 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program  task involving peer climate antidoping program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 축구 선수가 인식하는 또래 동기 분위기와 스포츠 경쟁 성향 그리고 도핑 의도 간의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">남자 엘리트 축구선수 368명 연구에서 자아 중심 동기 분위기는 도핑 의도를 높이고, 협력 성향은 도핑 의도를 낮추는 보호 요인으로 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__elite_football_players_doping_prevention"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__partnership_orientation_strengthening"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__doping_intention_reduction_peer_climate"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">program  task involving peer climate antidoping program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing program  task involving peer climate antidoping program in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">program  task involving peer climate antidoping program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">과제중심 또래 동기 분위기 기반 반도핑 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elite_football_players_doping_prevention"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__sport_sociability_scale_elementary_students">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__sport_sociability_scale_elementary_students</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생용 스포츠 사회성 척도</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport sociability scale for elementary students</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생의 스포츠 사회성을 측정하기 위한 타당화된 설문 척도 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 사회성 척도의 다집단 요인분석과 잠재평균 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학교 3~6학년 651명을 대상으로 스포츠 사회성 척도의 구인타당도, 형태동일성, 측정동일성, 절편동일성을 검증하고 초등학생 사회성 측정 도구로 적합함을 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:supports_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__elementary_students_sport_sociability_assessment"/>
    <isp:has_resulting_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__sport_sociability_measurement_validity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sport sociability scale for elementary students</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">초등학생의 스포츠 사회성을 측정하기 위한 타당화된 설문 척도 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">sport sociability scale for elementary students</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">초등학생용 스포츠 사회성 척도</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elementary_students_sport_sociability_assessment"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__doping_test_as_fair_performance_proof">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__doping_test_as_fair_performance_proof</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑검사의 공정한 실력 증명 인식</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  doping test as fair performance proof</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 선수의 도핑검사에 대한 심리적 경험</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">K대학 엘리트 선수 150명의 개방형 설문과 의미연결망 분석에서 도핑검사는 걱정, 불안, 수치심 등 부정적 심리 경험이면서도 선수 윤리와 실력 증명의 도구로 인식됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outcome  doping test as fair performance proof</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing outcome  doping test as fair performance proof in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outcome  doping test as fair performance proof</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">도핑검사의 공정한 실력 증명 인식</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__seventeen_regions_sports_welfare_comparison">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#spatial_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__seventeen_regions_sports_welfare_comparison</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">17개 시·도 스포츠복지 비교 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sports welfare comparison context across 17 regions</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Constructing a Composite Index of Sports Welfare: Application to the 17 Major Provinces and Cities in South Korea</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">International Journal of Applied Sports Sciences</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">17개 주요 시·도에 스포츠복지 복합지수를 적용하여 지역 간 수준을 비교함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역 단위 스포츠복지 격차를 확인하는 공간적 참여 맥락임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sports welfare comparison context across 17 regions</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지역 단위 스포츠복지 격차를 확인하는 공간적 참여 맥락임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Sports welfare comparison context across 17 regions</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">17개 시·도 스포츠복지 비교 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__sixteen_week_combined_exercise_weight_management_obese_middle_aged_women">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#community_based_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__sixteen_week_combined_exercise_weight_management_obese_middle_aged_women</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중년 비만 여성 16주 복합운동·체중관리 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sixteen-week combined exercise and weight management program for middle-aged obese women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중년 비만 여성을 대상으로 16주간 저항성운동과 유산소운동을 결합하여 적용한 복합운동 및 체중관리 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">16주간의 복합운동과 체중 감량이 중년 비만 여성의 체력과 전염증성 대식세포에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중년 비만 여성을 네 집단으로 무선할당하고, 운동 집단은 16주간 중강도 저항성운동과 유산소운동을 수행하였다. 운동 집단에서 신체구성, 근력, 심폐지구력, 전염증성 대식세포 지표가 유의하게 개선되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:program_duration_weeks rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">16</isp:program_duration_weeks>
    <isp:session_frequency_per_week rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</isp:session_frequency_per_week>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__obese_middle_aged_women_combined_exercise_weight_reduction"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__combined_resistance_aerobic_exercise_obese_middle_aged_women"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__sixteen_week_combined_exercise_obese_middle_aged_women"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__obese_middle_aged_women_body_composition_improvement_combined_exercise_16w"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__obese_middle_aged_women_physical_fitness_improvement_combined_exercise_16w"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__obese_middle_aged_women_inflammation_marker_improvement_combined_exercise_16w"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sixteen-week combined exercise and weight management program for middle-aged obese women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">중년 비만 여성을 대상으로 16주간 저항성운동과 유산소운동을 결합하여 적용한 복합운동 및 체중관리 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Sixteen-week combined exercise and weight management program for middle-aged obese women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">중년 비만 여성 16주 복합운동·체중관리 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__obese_middle_aged_women_combined_exercise_weight_reduction"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__adolescent_baseball_athletes_nutrition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#adolescent"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__adolescent_baseball_athletes_nutrition</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년기 야구선수</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Adolescent baseball athletes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">영양 정보 검색 경험에 따른 청소년기 야구선수의 식습관 및 영양교육에 대한 인식</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중·고등학교 야구선수로 활동하며 영양섭취와 식습관 관리가 필요한 청소년 선수 집단임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중·고등학교 야구선수로 활동하며 영양섭취와 식습관 관리가 필요한 청소년 선수 집단임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
