  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__twelve_week_school_fitness_training_elementary_students">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#regular_participation"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__twelve_week_school_fitness_training_elementary_students</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생 12주 학교 체력훈련 정기참여 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Twelve-week regular school fitness training context for elementary school students</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생이 12주간 주 3회 체력훈련 프로그램에 정기적으로 참여한 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간의 서킷-플라이오메트릭 트레이닝이 초등학생의 신체 구성과 체력에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">S시 소재 초등학생 30명을 대상으로 12주간 주 3회, 회당 50분씩 서킷 트레이닝과 플라이오메트릭 트레이닝을 실시하였다. 체질량지수 감소, 심폐지구력, 근지구력, 유연성, 순발력 향상이 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Twelve-week regular school fitness training context for elementary school students</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">초등학생이 12주간 주 3회 체력훈련 프로그램에 정기적으로 참여한 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Twelve-week regular school fitness training context for elementary school students</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">초등학생 12주 학교 체력훈련 정기참여 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__swimming_yoga_combined_exercise">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#community_sport"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__swimming_yoga_combined_exercise</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수영·요가·복합운동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">swimming yoga and combined exercise</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수영, 요가, 유산소와 저항운동을 결합한 복합운동으로 구성된 지역사회 건강증진 활동.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역사회 저소득 취약계층 주민을 위한 1년간의 운동프로그램이 대사 및 심혈관 건강 위험요인에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동프로그램은 60분 내외의 수영, 요가, 유산소+저항운동으로 구성되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">swimming yoga and combined exercise</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">수영, 요가, 유산소와 저항운동을 결합한 복합운동으로 구성된 지역사회 건강증진 활동.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">swimming yoga and combined exercise</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">수영·요가·복합운동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__elderly_women_community_exercise_participants">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#young_old"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__elderly_women_community_exercise_participants</isp:entity_id>
