    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__adolescent_integrated_health_risk_management"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__adolescent_healthy_activity_diet_support"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">physical activity and health education program for adolescents with drug use experience</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">약물사용 위험 청소년에게 신체활동, 식습관, 정신건강을 함께 다루는 통합 건강교육 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
