  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__expression_activity_professional_learning_community">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">표현활동 전문적 학습공동체</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">professional learning community for expressive activity classes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사의 표현활동 수업 운영 경험에 관한 질적 메타분석: 남자 체육교사를 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">표현활동 수업 전문성 신장을 위해 전문적 학습공동체가 필요하다고 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__dance_teacher_collaboration_resource"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__expression_activity_teacher_expertise_improvement"/>
