  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__aquatic_rehabilitation_pool_facility">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#accessible_facility"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__aquatic_rehabilitation_pool_facility</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수중재활 풀 시설</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">aquatic rehabilitation pool facility</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">부력, 수압, 수온을 활용하여 장애인의 안전한 운동수행을 돕는 접근 가능한 시설 자원.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수중재활운동이 편측사지 중도 뇌병변장애인의 심리적 안정과 정신적 준비기에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수중재활운동의 부력, 저항, 수압, 수온 특성이 재활운동을 지원함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:supports_program rdf:resource="#program__eight_month_aqua_rehabilitation_for_brain_lesion"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">aquatic rehabilitation pool facility</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">부력, 수압, 수온을 활용하여 장애인의 안전한 운동수행을 돕는 접근 가능한 시설 자원.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">aquatic rehabilitation pool facility</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">수중재활 풀 시설</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__class_satisfaction_indicator">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_outcome"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_outcome"/>
    <isp:is_result_of_program rdf:resource="#program__video_feedback_in_pe_class"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__class_satisfaction_indicator</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Middle-school soccer class satisfaction</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">generated_from_existing_instance_iri</isp:source_identifier>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Literal metadata was automatically added from the existing ontology structure; bibliographic source values were not inferred.</isp:note>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 축구수업 만족도</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">360° Around View와 Slow Motion 영상 피드백 제공에 따라 측정된 교육적, 신체적, 심리적 수업 만족도 지표</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:outcome_indicator_name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">educational satisfaction; physical satisfaction; psychological satisfaction</isp:outcome_indicator_name>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">360도 어라운드 뷰와 슬로우 모션 테크놀로지를 활용한 피드백 제공이 중학생 축구 수업만족도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">서울 시내 3개 중학교의 토요스포츠데이 축구수업을 수강하는 2학년 남학생 90명을 대상으로 360° Around View 영상 피드백, 모바일 Slow Motion 영상 피드백, 구두 피드백 집단을 비교하였고, 교육적·신체적·심리적 수업 만족도에서 360° Around View 영상 피드백 집단의 만족도가 가장 높게 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Middle-school soccer class satisfaction</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">360° Around View와 Slow Motion 영상 피드백 제공에 따라 측정된 교육적, 신체적, 심리적 수업 만족도 지표</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Middle-school soccer class satisfaction</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">중학교 축구수업 만족도</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__world_folk_dance_comparison_activity">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#multicultural_sport"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__world_folk_dance_comparison_activity</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">세계 민속무용 비교 표현활동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">World folk dance comparison expression activity</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Bennett의 상호문화적 감수성 발달모델을 통한 초등 민속표현 제고 방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">세계 여러 나라의 민속무용을 춤춰보며 감상하고 특징을 비교할 수 있다고 제시함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">세계 민속무용 비교와 감상을 통한 다문화 스포츠·표현 활동으로 직접 제시됨</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:is_delivered_by_program rdf:resource="#program__elementary_intercultural_folk_expression_program"/>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__intercultural_sensitivity_improvement_folk_expression"/>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__cultural_difference_acceptance_improvement"/>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__multicultural_open_attitude_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">World folk dance comparison expression activity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">세계 민속무용 비교와 감상을 통한 다문화 스포츠·표현 활동으로 직접 제시됨</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">World folk dance comparison expression activity</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">세계 민속무용 비교 표현활동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__sportsmanship_emotion_habit_education_material">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__sportsmanship_emotion_habit_education_material</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">감정과 스포츠맨십 습관화 교육자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">educational material on emotion and sportsmanship habit</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠맨십 실천에서 감정과 습관의 역할을 설명하는 교육자료</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">아리스토텔레스의 체육사상(17) 감정과 스포츠맨십 실천의 인과관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠맨십의 내면화에는 경기규칙 지식뿐 아니라 감정, 습관, 자발적 실천이 중요하다고 논의하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">educational material on emotion and sportsmanship habit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">스포츠맨십 실천에서 감정과 습관의 역할을 설명하는 교육자료</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">educational material on emotion and sportsmanship habit</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">감정과 스포츠맨십 습관화 교육자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__low_income_menopause_women">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__low_income_menopause_women</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저소득층 폐경기 여성</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Low-income menopausal women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저소득층 폐경기 여성의 비만에 따른 대사적 건강상태와 신체활동 및 좌식행동과의 관련성</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">소득수준 하위 25%에 해당하는 폐경기 여성 822명의 자료가 분석되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Low-income menopausal women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Low-income menopausal women in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Low-income menopausal women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">저소득층 폐경기 여성</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__anti_doping_civil_liability_framework">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#law_regulation"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">반도핑 민사책임 법제 프레임워크</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Anti-doping civil liability framework</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑으로 인한 계약위반과 불법행위 책임을 검토하는 법제적 기준.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑의 민사법적 문제</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">전북대학교 법학연구</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2010</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑은 계약위반 및 불법행위책임 등 민사법적 책임 문제와 관련된다고 설명함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__anti_doping_civil_liability_framework</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:has_policy_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__doping_legal_responsibility_awareness"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Anti-doping civil liability framework</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">도핑으로 인한 계약위반과 불법행위 책임을 검토하는 법제적 기준.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Anti-doping civil liability framework</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">반도핑 민사책임 법제 프레임워크</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__korean_figure_skating_ltd_model">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#youth_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__korean_figure_skating_ltd_model</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국형 피겨스케이팅 LTD 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean figure skating LTD program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국내 시스템에 맞춘 장기선수발달 기반 피겨스케이팅 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스케이트 캐나다의 Long Term Development 모델 고찰을 통한 국내 피겨스케이팅 장기 선수 발달 프로그램 운영방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">각 스케이팅 단계별 훈련 목표와 개인 발달을 고려하는 LTD 모델 필요가 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__youth_figure_skating_athletes"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__figure_skating_long_term_development"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__figure_skating_coach_education_program"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__figure_skating_lifelong_participation"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__figure_skating_injury_risk_reduction"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Korean figure skating LTD program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국내 시스템에 맞춘 장기선수발달 기반 피겨스케이팅 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Korean figure skating LTD program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">한국형 피겨스케이팅 LTD 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__youth_figure_skating_athletes"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#delivers_sport_activity">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#ontology_entity"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="#ontology_entity"/>
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="#is_delivered_by_program"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">delivers sport activity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a program or delivery arrangement to the sport activity it delivers.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__doping_reflexive_modernity_education_material">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 성찰적 근대성 교육자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Doping reflexive modernity education material</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑을 공정성, 건강, 과학기술 위험의 관계에서 설명하기 위한 교육자료.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑(Doping)의 재해석: 울리히 벡의 성찰적 근대성을 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국시큐리티융합경영학회지</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">기존의 공정성·건강 담론을 넘어 도핑을 성찰적 근대성의 위험으로 이해할 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__doping_reflexive_modernity_education_material</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:supports_program rdf:resource="#program__university_student_athlete_antidoping_education_system"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Doping reflexive modernity education material</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">도핑을 공정성, 건강, 과학기술 위험의 관계에서 설명하기 위한 교육자료.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Doping reflexive modernity education material</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">도핑 성찰적 근대성 교육자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__doping_sanction_ne_bis_in_idem_guideline">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑징계 이중처벌 검토 안내자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Doping sanction ne bis in idem guideline</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 제재에서 이중처벌금지 원칙, 직업선택의 자유, 스포츠단체 자치권을 검토하는 자료.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑징계의 이중처벌에 관한 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">홍익법학</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
