    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">트랜스젠더 선수의 배제가 타당성과 일관성을 결여할 수 있음을 비판적으로 분석함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">gender identity-based sport access protection</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">성정체성 기반 스포츠 접근권 보호</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__middle_school_girls_pe_participation_leadership_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_linked_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__middle_school_girls_pe_participation_leadership_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여중생 체육수업 참여 리더십 지원 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">leadership support program for middle school girls PE participation</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 리더십 개선을 통해 여중생의 체육수업 참여도를 높이는 학교체육 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육 교사의 리더십 유형이 여중생의 수업 참여도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">교사의 리더십에 따른 교수 유형과 학생의 체육수업 변인 분석 필요를 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_school_girls_pe_participants"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__positive_reinforcement_pe_teacher_leadership"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__middle_school_girls_pe_interest_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__middle_school_girls_pe_class_attitude_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">leadership support program for middle school girls PE participation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육교사 리더십 개선을 통해 여중생의 체육수업 참여도를 높이는 학교체육 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
