  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__pe_teacher_job_commitment_difference_identification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#system_level_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__pe_teacher_job_commitment_difference_identification</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사·스포츠강사 직무몰입 차이 식별</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">identification of job commitment differences between PE teachers and sport instructors</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사와 스포츠강사의 직무몰입 수준 차이를 파악하는 조직관리 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 체육교사와 스포츠강사의 조직동일시, 직무몰입, 그리고 이직의도의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2013</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">직무몰입은 체육교사가 스포츠강사보다 높게 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">identification of job commitment differences between PE teachers and sport instructors</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육교사와 스포츠강사의 직무몰입 수준 차이를 파악하는 조직관리 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">identification of job commitment differences between PE teachers and sport instructors</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육교사·스포츠강사 직무몰입 차이 식별</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__doping_human_rights_violation_awareness">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__doping_human_rights_violation_awareness</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 인권침해 인식 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  doping human rights violation awareness</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성 해방과 도핑 - 동독스포츠 성장의 명암 -</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2008</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">동독 여성스포츠와 도핑을 역사적으로 분석하여 국가주도 엘리트스포츠 체계에서 여성선수의 도핑 노출, 인권침해, 건강 피해를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
