  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__public_water_experience_center_users">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__public_water_experience_center_users</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">공공 수상체험장 이용객</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">public water experience center users</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">공공 수상체험장 지도자 특성이 체험장신뢰 및 만족과 추천의도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2012</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2012년 대전 공공 수상체험장 이용객 368명을 분석하였고, 지도자의 호감, 전문성, 지도자 신뢰가 체험장 신뢰, 체험만족, 추천의도에 유의한 영향을 미쳤다고 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">공공 수상체험장을 이용하는 지역사회 기반 스포츠·여가 참여자 집단임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">public water experience center users</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">공공 수상체험장을 이용하는 지역사회 기반 스포츠·여가 참여자 집단임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">public water experience center users</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">공공 수상체험장 이용객</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__community_aquatic_rehabilitation_setting">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#public_institution"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__community_aquatic_rehabilitation_setting</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역사회 수중재활 환경</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">community aquatic rehabilitation setting</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인복지관 또는 지역사회 재활센터에서 제공되는 수중재활 참여 환경.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수중재활운동이 편측사지 중도 뇌병변장애인의 심리적 안정과 정신적 준비기에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인복지관 운동재활연구센터 기반 프로그램 맥락이 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">community aquatic rehabilitation setting</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">장애인복지관 또는 지역사회 재활센터에서 제공되는 수중재활 참여 환경.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">community aquatic rehabilitation setting</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">지역사회 수중재활 환경</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__youth_sports_club_anti_doping_legal_prevention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#safety_risk_management_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__youth_sports_club_anti_doping_legal_prevention</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년 스포츠클럽 반도핑 법적 예방 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">youth sports club anti-doping legal prevention program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년 선수의 도핑행위에 대한 스포츠 클럽 지도자의 형사책임</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년 스포츠클럽 지도자의 금지약물 투여 행위가 여러 법률 위반으로 이어질 수 있음을 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__underaged_sports_club_athletes_doping_risk"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__coach_criminal_liability_anti_doping_guideline"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__youth_anti_doping_legal_protection"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">youth sports club anti-doping legal prevention program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing youth sports club anti-doping legal prevention program in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">youth sports club anti-doping legal prevention program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">유소년 스포츠클럽 반도핑 법적 예방 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__underaged_sports_club_athletes_doping_risk"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__elite_athletes_anti_doping_communication">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elite_athlete"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">반도핑 커뮤니케이션 대상 엘리트 선수</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Elite athletes as anti-doping communication target</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">니클라스 루만(Niklas Luhmann)의 체계이론적 관점에서 본 반-도핑 커뮤니케이션의 한계와 과제</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">반도핑 커뮤니케이션의 대상이 선수와 지도자 개인에게 집중되어 있음을 분석함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__elite_athletes_anti_doping_communication</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Elite athletes as anti-doping communication target</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Elite athletes as anti-doping communication target in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Elite athletes as anti-doping communication target</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">반도핑 커뮤니케이션 대상 엘리트 선수</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__sport_club_team_commitment_strengthening">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_relationship_expansion"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__sport_club_team_commitment_strengthening</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">생활체육동호회 팀 몰입 강화</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Strengthened team commitment in sport clubs</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회적 가치지향을 통해 동호회 구성원의 감정적, 지속적, 규범적 팀 몰입이 강화되는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">생활체육동호회의 사회적 가치지향이 팀 몰입 및 운동지속의도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Strengthened team commitment in sport clubs</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사회적 가치지향을 통해 동호회 구성원의 감정적, 지속적, 규범적 팀 몰입이 강화되는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Strengthened team commitment in sport clubs</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">생활체육동호회 팀 몰입 강화</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__high_intensity_aerobic_dementia_factor_intervention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#medical_welfare_linked_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__high_intensity_aerobic_dementia_factor_intervention</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고강도 유산소 치매관련인자 개선 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">high-intensity aerobic dementia-related factor intervention</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유산소 운동강도의 차이가 중년 여성의 AD(Alzheimer Disease)형 치매 관련 인자 및 Estradiol에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">8주간 고강도 유산소운동이 BDNF와 E2에 긍정적인 영향을 미칠 수 있음을 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_aged_women_dementia_risk"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__dementia_prevention_aerobic_exercise"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__bdnf_estradiol_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">high-intensity aerobic dementia-related factor intervention</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing high-intensity aerobic dementia-related factor intervention in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">high-intensity aerobic dementia-related factor intervention</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">고강도 유산소 치매관련인자 개선 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_aged_women_dementia_risk"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__sport_posthumanism_discourse">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 포스트휴머니즘 담론 자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport and posthumanism discourse resource</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육·스포츠 관련 교육적 실제의 포스트휴먼적 비전 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠와 포스트휴머니즘 연구 담론을 교육적 렌즈로 읽고 전유하는 시론적 작업이라고 설명하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__sport_posthumanism_discourse</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sport and posthumanism discourse resource</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing sport and posthumanism discourse resource in the support_resource dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">sport and posthumanism discourse resource</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠 포스트휴머니즘 담론 자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__sport_online_public_opinion_space">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_mode_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__sport_online_public_opinion_space</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 온라인 여론 형성 공간</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport online public opinion space</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 이슈에 대한 의견 공유와 여론 형성이 이루어지는 온라인 참여 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 영역에서 여론 형성 양상 탐색: 스포츠 영역 온라인 커뮤니티의 기능과 한계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">온라인 커뮤니티가 스포츠 이슈 해결을 위한 실천적 움직임과 공론장으로 기능하지만 여론재판과 사적 이야기 왜곡의 위험도 함께 나타난다고 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:is_enabled_by_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__sport_online_community_deliberation_forum"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sport online public opinion space</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">스포츠 이슈에 대한 의견 공유와 여론 형성이 이루어지는 온라인 참여 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">sport online public opinion space</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠 온라인 여론 형성 공간</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__pe_teacher_job_role_clarification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__pe_teacher_job_role_clarification</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 직무역할 명료화 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PE teacher job-role clarification program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">우리나라 체육교사의 직무영역 및 직무내용 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DACUM 기법을 활용하여 중등 체육교사의 직무영역을 교육업무와 행정업무로 구분하고, 교과지도·학교체육행정 등 66개 직무내용을 도출함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DACUM 기법을 활용하여 중등 체육교사의 직무영역을 교육업무와 행정업무로 구분하고, 교과지도·학교체육행정 등 66개 직무내용을 도출함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__secondary_pe_teachers_job_analysis"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__pe_teacher_dacum_job_specification"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__pe_teacher_role_conflict_reduction"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__expanded_school_physical_education_work_context"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PE teacher job-role clarification program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">DACUM 기법을 활용하여 중등 체육교사의 직무영역을 교육업무와 행정업무로 구분하고, 교과지도·학교체육행정 등 66개 직무내용을 도출함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">PE teacher job-role clarification program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육교사 직무역할 명료화 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__secondary_pe_teachers_job_analysis"/>
  </rdf:Description>
