  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__people_with_intellectual_disability_sport">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#intellectual_disability"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__people_with_intellectual_disability_sport</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지적장애인 스포츠 참여자</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">people with intellectual disability in sport</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">전문체육, 생활체육, 학교체육을 포함한 지적장애인 스포츠 참여 대상 집단.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지적장애스포츠 조직의 변천 및 발전방향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지적장애인 전문체육지원과 생활체육을 하나의 조직에서 균형적으로 지원할 필요를 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">people with intellectual disability in sport</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전문체육, 생활체육, 학교체육을 포함한 지적장애인 스포츠 참여 대상 집단.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">people with intellectual disability in sport</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">지적장애인 스포츠 참여자</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
