  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__youth_soccer_decision_making_training">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#youth_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__youth_soccer_decision_making_training</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유소년 축구 의사결정능력 향상 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">youth soccer decision-making training program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">명제적 학습과 암묵적 학습을 활용하여 유소년 축구선수의 전술 장면 의사결정을 향상시키는 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지각기술훈련이 유소년 축구선수의 의사결정능력에 미치는 효과 검증</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">명제적 학습과 암묵적 학습 집단을 비교하여 지각기술훈련 효과를 검증하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__youth_soccer_perceptual_skill_training"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__implicit_video_cue_training_material"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__soccer_decision_time_reduction"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__soccer_decision_accuracy_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">youth soccer decision-making training program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">명제적 학습과 암묵적 학습을 활용하여 유소년 축구선수의 전술 장면 의사결정을 향상시키는 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">youth soccer decision-making training program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">유소년 축구 의사결정능력 향상 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__mci_bdnf_exercise_prescription_evidence">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__mci_bdnf_exercise_prescription_evidence</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 운동처방 BDNF 근거 자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BDNF-based evidence for MCI exercise prescription</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동 중재가 경도인지장애 노인의 뇌 유래 신경영양인자와 인지기능에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인을 대상으로 한 운동 중재가 BDNF 발현과 인지기능 개선에 기여하며, 중·고강도 유산소운동과 유산소·저항성 복합운동, 인지중재 병행의 효과를 제시함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인을 대상으로 한 운동 중재가 BDNF 발현과 인지기능 개선에 기여하며, 중·고강도 유산소운동과 유산소·저항성 복합운동, 인지중재 병행의 효과를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">BDNF-based evidence for MCI exercise prescription</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경도인지장애 노인을 대상으로 한 운동 중재가 BDNF 발현과 인지기능 개선에 기여하며, 중·고강도 유산소운동과 유산소·저항성 복합운동, 인지중재 병행의 효과를 제시함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">BDNF-based evidence for MCI exercise prescription</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">경도인지장애 운동처방 BDNF 근거 자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__pe_teacher_credibility_scale">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 공신력 측정 자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">physical education teacher credibility scale</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 공신력이 수업태도와 수업만족에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 공신력의 신뢰성, 매력성, 전문성 요인이 수업태도와 수업만족에 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__pe_teacher_credibility_scale</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">physical education teacher credibility scale</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing physical education teacher credibility scale in the support_resource dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">physical education teacher credibility scale</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육교사 공신력 측정 자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__children_24hour_movement_guideline">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__children_24hour_movement_guideline</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">아동 24시간 움직임 가이드라인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Children 24-hour movement guideline</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">아동의 신체활동, 수면, 좌식행동을 통합적으로 조정하기 위한 움직임 지침 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An Empirical Study on Variables Affecting the Regularity of Children’s Wakeup Time, Bedtime and Breakfast: Focusing on Activities Related to Sweat, Step, Sleep, and Sit</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">101-114</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The study analyzed 594 elementary school students in grades 1 to 6 and found that more weekly days of physical activity, adequate sleep duration, and fewer daily hours of electronic device use were associated with higher regularity of wakeup time, bedtime, and breakfast.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <isp:supports_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__elementary_children_movement_sleep_routine_support"/>
    <isp:supports_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__children_sweat_step_physical_activity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Children 24-hour movement guideline</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">아동의 신체활동, 수면, 좌식행동을 통합적으로 조정하기 위한 움직임 지침 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Children 24-hour movement guideline</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">아동 24시간 움직임 가이드라인</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elementary_children_movement_sleep_routine_support"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__anti_doping_social_responsibility_education">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 사회적 책임 교육</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Anti-doping social responsibility education</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑의 원인을 개인 일탈뿐 아니라 사회적 환경과 제도 맥락에서 이해하도록 하는 교육 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑의 사회적 책임에 관하여</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">KADA 도핑방지 교육자료</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑방지정책은 스포츠의 성공과 승리에 대한 집단적 열망이 커진 사회정치적 환경 속에서 탄생했다고 설명함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__anti_doping_social_responsibility_education</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__anti_doping_social_context_material"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__anti_doping_social_responsibility_awareness"/>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__college_athletes_doping_risk"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Anti-doping social responsibility education</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">도핑의 원인을 개인 일탈뿐 아니라 사회적 환경과 제도 맥락에서 이해하도록 하는 교육 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Anti-doping social responsibility education</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">도핑 사회적 책임 교육</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__college_athletes_doping_risk"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__self_management_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자기관리 수준 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Self-management improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체관리, 정신관리, 대인관리 등 개인의 목표 달성을 위한 자기조절 역량 향상</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학생들의 신체활동 참여유무에 따른 자기관리 수준 차이</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체활동 참여유무에 따른 자기관리 수준에서 통계적으로 유의한 차이가 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__self_management_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Self-management improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">신체관리, 정신관리, 대인관리 등 개인의 목표 달성을 위한 자기조절 역량 향상</rdfs:comment>
