  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__aid_exercise_intervention_review_evidence">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__aid_exercise_intervention_review_evidence</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고령화 지적장애인 운동중재 근거 고찰</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">review evidence for exercise intervention in aging intellectual disability</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고령화된 지적장애인의 성공적 노화를 위한 운동 중재의 체계적 문헌 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013~2023년 고령화된 지적장애인 운동중재 연구를 PICO 방식으로 고찰하였고, 심리운동, 승마운동, 낙상예방 복합운동, 보행운동, 건강행동 증진 프로그램에서 심리사회, 체력, 보행, 낙상, 균형, 이동성, 신체활동 수준의 긍정적 변화를 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국내외 운동중재 연구를 체계적으로 고찰하여 향후 프로그램 설계 방향을 제공하는 근거 자료임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">review evidence for exercise intervention in aging intellectual disability</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국내외 운동중재 연구를 체계적으로 고찰하여 향후 프로그램 설계 방향을 제공하는 근거 자료임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">review evidence for exercise intervention in aging intellectual disability</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">고령화 지적장애인 운동중재 근거 고찰</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__pe_three_step_assessment_recording_system">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교과 3등급제 평가기록 방식</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">three-step assessment recording system in physical education</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교과 3등급제 평가기록 방법에 대한 체육교사들의 인식</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">우수·보통·미흡 3단계로 체육교과 평가기록을 실시하는 방식에 대한 현장 인식을 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__pe_three_step_assessment_recording_system</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">three-step assessment recording system in physical education</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing three-step assessment recording system in physical education in the support_resource dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">three-step assessment recording system in physical education</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육교과 3등급제 평가기록 방식</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__video_feedback_in_pe_class">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_linked_program"/>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_school_soccer_students"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__middle_school_soccer_class"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__around_view_video_feedback"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__slow_motion_video_feedback"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__class_satisfaction_indicator"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__educational_satisfaction_improvement_around_view_feedback"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__physical_satisfaction_improvement_around_view_feedback"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__psychological_satisfaction_improvement_around_view_feedback"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__video_feedback_in_pe_class</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Video-feedback middle-school soccer class</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">generated_from_existing_instance_iri</isp:source_identifier>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Literal metadata was automatically added from the existing ontology structure; bibliographic source values were not inferred.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-07</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">영상 피드백 기반 중학교 축구수업</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 토요스포츠데이 축구수업에서 360° Around View, 모바일 Slow Motion, 구두 피드백 방식을 비교 적용한 학교 연계 스포츠 수업</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:total_sessions_count rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</isp:total_sessions_count>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">360도 어라운드 뷰와 슬로우 모션 테크놀로지를 활용한 피드백 제공이 중학생 축구 수업만족도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">서울 시내 3개 중학교의 토요스포츠데이 축구수업을 수강하는 2학년 남학생 90명을 대상으로 360° Around View 영상 피드백, 모바일 Slow Motion 영상 피드백, 구두 피드백 집단을 비교하였고, 교육적·신체적·심리적 수업 만족도에서 360° Around View 영상 피드백 집단의 만족도가 가장 높게 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Video-feedback middle-school soccer class</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">중학교 토요스포츠데이 축구수업에서 360° Around View, 모바일 Slow Motion, 구두 피드백 방식을 비교 적용한 학교 연계 스포츠 수업</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Video-feedback middle-school soccer class</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">영상 피드백 기반 중학교 축구수업</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_school_soccer_students"/>
  </rdf:Description>
