  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__taekwondo_protector_scoring_system">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#digital_device"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__taekwondo_protector_scoring_system</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도 전자호구 시스템</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Taekwondo protector scoring system</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도 겨루기에서 득점 판정의 공정성과 신뢰성을 높이기 위한 디지털 경기 장비.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도 겨루기 경기 전자호구 시스템(Protector Scoring System) 판정 신뢰성과 경기 몰입도가 관람자의 만족에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2012 런던올림픽부터 전자호구 시스템이 공식적으로 사용되었고 판정 신뢰성과 관련됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v68_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <isp:provides_delivery_context_for rdf:resource="#participation_context__taekwondo_kyorugi_competition_viewing"/>
    <isp:conditions_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__taekwondo_judgment_reliability_improvement"/>
    <isp:conditions_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__taekwondo_spectator_satisfaction_increase"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Taekwondo protector scoring system</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">태권도 겨루기에서 득점 판정의 공정성과 신뢰성을 높이기 위한 디지털 경기 장비.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Taekwondo protector scoring system</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">태권도 전자호구 시스템</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__athlete_vaccination_guideline">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__athlete_vaccination_guideline</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수 예방접종 가이드라인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Vaccination guideline for athletes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수들을 위한 예방접종 근거와 추천</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수와 지도자, 팀닥터, 가족의 건강을 고려한 예방접종 필요성과 국제대회·훈련 환경에 따른 백신 가이드라인 수립 필요를 제시함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수와 지도자, 팀닥터, 가족의 건강을 고려한 예방접종 필요성과 국제대회·훈련 환경에 따른 백신 가이드라인 수립 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Sports Medicine</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Vaccination guideline for athletes</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">운동선수와 지도자, 팀닥터, 가족의 건강을 고려한 예방접종 필요성과 국제대회·훈련 환경에 따른 백신 가이드라인 수립 필요를 제시함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Vaccination guideline for athletes</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">운동선수 예방접종 가이드라인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__orff_music_sports_games_for_asd_children">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#adapted_physical_activity"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__orff_music_sports_games_for_asd_children</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자폐스펙트럼 아동 오르프 음악 결합 스포츠게임</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Orff music combined sports games for children with ASD</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">오르프 음악 활동과 스포츠게임을 결합하여 자폐스펙트럼 아동의 운동 참여와 사회적 상호작용을 지원하는 적응형 신체활동</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Combined Orff Music And Sports Activity To Enhances Autism Children’s Social Skills: Trials Of Intervention Effectiveness</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022 3rd Asia Sport Science Conference Abstracts</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">conference_abstract</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">107-109</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The conference abstract recruited twenty-two children with ASD and applied a 9-week Orff music combined sports game intervention three times per week. The intervention improved social skills in children with mild to moderate ASD, with better social interaction effects in the experimental group than the sports-game control group.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Orff music combined sports games for children with ASD</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">오르프 음악 활동과 스포츠게임을 결합하여 자폐스펙트럼 아동의 운동 참여와 사회적 상호작용을 지원하는 적응형 신체활동</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Orff music combined sports games for children with ASD</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">자폐스펙트럼 아동 오르프 음악 결합 스포츠게임</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
