  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__child_daily_sixty_minute_mvpa">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#fitness_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__child_daily_sixty_minute_mvpa</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">아동 하루 60분 중고강도 신체활동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Daily 60-minute MVPA for children</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">아동·청소년 신체활동 권고에 해당하는 하루 60분 이상의 중고강도 신체활동</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Associations of physical activity with gut microbiota in pre-adolescent children</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_url rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.20463/pan.2021.0023</isp:source_url>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">24-25</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This study analyzed 321 children with physical activity and 16S rRNA sequencing data. Children meeting physical activity recommendations had altered gut microbiota compositions.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__child_gut_microbiota_composition_profile"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Daily 60-minute MVPA for children</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">아동·청소년 신체활동 권고에 해당하는 하루 60분 이상의 중고강도 신체활동</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Daily 60-minute MVPA for children</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">아동 하루 60분 중고강도 신체활동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__six_week_relaxation_program_older_women">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__six_week_relaxation_program_older_women</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성노인 6주 이완프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Six-week relaxation program for older women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">65세 이상 여성노인을 대상으로 6주간 실시된 이완 중심 운동 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">6주간의 이완프로그램이 여성노인의 수면장애, 정신적 스트레스 및 염증 지표에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">65세 이상 여성노인을 운동군과 대조군으로 나누고, 운동군은 6주 동안 주 3회, 회당 60분씩 이완프로그램을 실시하였다. 운동군에서 수면장애와 TNF-α가 유의하게 개선되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:program_duration_weeks rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</isp:program_duration_weeks>
    <isp:session_frequency_per_week rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</isp:session_frequency_per_week>
    <isp:session_duration_minutes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">60</isp:session_duration_minutes>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__older_women_with_sleep_disorder_65plus"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__older_women_relaxation_exercise"/>
