    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Elementary physical education expression domain context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Bennett의 상호문화적 감수성 발달모델을 통한 초등 민속표현 제고 방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2015 초등 체육과 표현영역 5-6학년 민속표현을 분석 대상으로 삼음</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교 체육 교육과정 안에서 이루어지는 표현영역 참여 맥락으로 직접 제시됨</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:provides_delivery_context_for rdf:resource="#program__elementary_intercultural_folk_expression_program"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Elementary physical education expression domain context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학교 체육 교육과정 안에서 이루어지는 표현영역 참여 맥락으로 직접 제시됨</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Elementary physical education expression domain context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">초등 체육 표현영역 수업 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__referee_stress_coping_capacity_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#mental_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__referee_stress_coping_capacity_improvement</isp:entity_id>
