  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__sport_marketer_ethics_capacity_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__sport_marketer_ethics_capacity_program</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠마케터 윤리역량 강화 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport marketer ethics capacity-building program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠마케팅 전략이 윤리적·사회적 가치에 부합하는지 검토할 수 있도록 지원하는 역량강화 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠마케팅의 윤리적,사회적 가치제고를 위한 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2010</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠와 법</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠마케팅이 상업적 도구로만 활용될 경우 윤리적·사회적 가치 문제가 발생할 수 있으며 공동체 가치와 윤리적 검토가 필요하다고 논의하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__sport_marketing_ethics_guidance"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__sport_marketing_social_value_awareness"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sport marketer ethics capacity-building program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">스포츠마케팅 전략이 윤리적·사회적 가치에 부합하는지 검토할 수 있도록 지원하는 역량강화 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">sport marketer ethics capacity-building program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠마케터 윤리역량 강화 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__high_school_elite_supplement_doping_awareness_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#safety_risk_management_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__high_school_elite_supplement_doping_awareness_program</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고교 엘리트 선수 보조물·도핑의식 교육 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">supplement and doping awareness program for high school elite athletes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">교교 엘리트 선수들의 경기력 향상을 위한 운동영향보조물 섭취형태와 도핑의식</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2008</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">일반고와 체육고 엘리트 선수 338명을 대상으로 경기력 향상을 위한 운동영양 보조물 섭취형태와 도핑의식을 조사하였고, 전체 섭취 경험은 60.9%, 체육고 선수의 도핑교육 경험은 74.6%, 일반고 선수의 도핑교육 경험은 14.9%로 나타났다고 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Korea Sport Research</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고교 엘리트 선수의 운동영양 보조물 섭취와 도핑 위험 인식을 함께 다루는 안전관리형 교육 프로그램임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__high_school_elite_athletes_general_and_sport_school"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__high_school_athlete_doping_education"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__high_school_athlete_doping_awareness_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__unintentional_doping_risk_reduction"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">supplement and doping awareness program for high school elite athletes</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">고교 엘리트 선수의 운동영양 보조물 섭취와 도핑 위험 인식을 함께 다루는 안전관리형 교육 프로그램임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">supplement and doping awareness program for high school elite athletes</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">고교 엘리트 선수 보조물·도핑의식 교육 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__high_school_elite_athletes_general_and_sport_school"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__doping_intention_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#equity_outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 의도 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑의도 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Doping intention reduction</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">doping intention reduction</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수가 금지약물 사용을 의도하거나 도핑을 관대하게 받아들이는 태도를 낮추는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">반도핑 교육과 동기 지원을 통해 도핑 의도를 낮추는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">맥락전이모델(Trans-Contextual Model: TCM)을 적용한 엘리트 선수들의 도핑의도 예측</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학 운동선수의 부정행위 수용도, 스포츠 동기화, 스포츠 완벽주의가 실패공포와 도핑 의도 및 태도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">부정행위 수용도와 코치 기준 완벽주의가 도핑 의도 및 태도에 유의한 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__doping_intention_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Doping intention reduction</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">운동선수가 금지약물 사용을 의도하거나 도핑을 관대하게 받아들이는 태도를 낮추는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Doping intention reduction</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">도핑 의도 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__korean_males_t2dm_body_composition_risk">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__korean_males_t2dm_body_composition_risk</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체성분 변화 위험이 있는 한국 남성 당뇨 고위험 집단</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean males with diabetes-related body composition risk</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ECW/ICW 비율과 제2형 당뇨 유병이 함께 분석된 19~80세 한국 남성 대상 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Association between extracellular-to-intracellular water ratio and type 2 diabetes mellitus in Korean males aged 19-80 years: analysis of KNHANES 2022-2023</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_url rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.20463/pan.2025.0017</isp:source_url>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">77-78</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The study analyzed 2,281 Korean males aged 19-80 years from KNHANES 2022-2023 and identified an association between ECW/ICW ratio and T2DM prevalence independent of age, BMI, and muscle strength.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:applies_to_gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">male</isp:applies_to_gender>
    <isp:applies_to_health_condition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">type 2 diabetes mellitus</isp:applies_to_health_condition>
    <isp:sample_size rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2281</isp:sample_size>
    <isp:is_reflected_in_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__diabetes_body_composition_profile_identification"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Korean males with diabetes-related body composition risk</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">ECW/ICW 비율과 제2형 당뇨 유병이 함께 분석된 19~80세 한국 남성 대상 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Korean males with diabetes-related body composition risk</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체성분 변화 위험이 있는 한국 남성 당뇨 고위험 집단</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__physical_education_textbook_use_reflection">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#system_level_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__physical_education_textbook_use_reflection</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교과서 활용 반성 및 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">reflection and improvement of PE textbook use</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육수업 현장에서 체육교과서 활용 방향을 반성하고 개선 필요를 식별하는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육 교사의 교과서 개발 경험에 대한 내러티브 탐구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교 현장에서 체육교과서를 활용하며 수업을 진행하는 사례가 적다고 설명하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">reflection and improvement of PE textbook use</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육수업 현장에서 체육교과서 활용 방향을 반성하고 개선 필요를 식별하는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">reflection and improvement of PE textbook use</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육교과서 활용 반성 및 개선</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__dance_sports_body_composition_improvement_obese_middle_aged_women">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__dance_sports_body_composition_improvement_obese_middle_aged_women</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">댄스스포츠 신체구성 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Body composition improvement after dance sports</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주 댄스스포츠 운동 후 비만 중년여성의 체지방과 체지방률 감소가 보고된 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간의 댄스스포츠 운동이 비만 중년여성의 신체구성 및 항산화 효소 활성에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2008</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Exercise Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 중년여성 20명을 대상으로 실험군과 통제군을 구성하고 12주간 댄스스포츠 프로그램을 적용하였다. 실험군에서 체지방과 체지방률 감소, SOD와 CAT 등 항산화 효소 활성 변화가 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Body composition improvement after dance sports</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">12주 댄스스포츠 운동 후 비만 중년여성의 체지방과 체지방률 감소가 보고된 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Body composition improvement after dance sports</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">댄스스포츠 신체구성 개선</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__singapore_youth_fitness_nutrition_monitoring">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#youth_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__singapore_youth_fitness_nutrition_monitoring</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 체력·비만·식이섭취 모니터링 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Youth fitness, obesity, and dietary intake monitoring program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fitness Index on Physical Fitness, Obesity and Dietary Intake of Youths in Singapore</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년의 체력변인, 비만 수준, 생활·식이습관을 함께 조사하여 개선 필요성을 제시함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년의 건강 관련 체력, 비만, 식이섭취를 통합적으로 점검하는 대상집단 지원 프로그램임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__singapore_youth_fitness_nutrition_monitoring"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__youth_health_related_fitness_testing"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__singapore_youth_fitness_index_assessment"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__youth_cardiorespiratory_fitness_profile_identification"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__youth_obesity_dietary_risk_identification"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__youth_physical_activity_nutrition_improvement_need_identification"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Youth fitness, obesity, and dietary intake monitoring program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">청소년의 건강 관련 체력, 비만, 식이섭취를 통합적으로 점검하는 대상집단 지원 프로그램임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Youth fitness, obesity, and dietary intake monitoring program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">청소년 체력·비만·식이섭취 모니터링 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__singapore_youth_fitness_nutrition_monitoring"/>
  </rdf:Description>
