    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing postoperative shoulder rehabilitation exercise program in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">postoperative shoulder rehabilitation exercise program</skos:prefLabel>
