    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Exercise Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">선수가 보충제 사용 전에 과학적 근거, 개인 반응, 도핑 위험, 전문가 상담 필요성을 인식하는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">선수가 보충제 사용 전에 과학적 근거, 개인 반응, 도핑 위험, 전문가 상담 필요성을 인식하는 성과임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__supplement_safety_and_doping_risk_awareness</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved awareness of supplement safety and doping risk</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선수가 보충제 사용 전에 과학적 근거, 개인 반응, 도핑 위험, 전문가 상담 필요성을 인식하는 성과임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved awareness of supplement safety and doping risk</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">보충제 안전 및 도핑위험 인식 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__agility_performance_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_competence_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__agility_performance_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">민첩성 수행 지원</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Agility performance support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동장 표면 유형이 신체능력 및 축구 경기력에 미치는 영향; 체계적 검토</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체능력 중 민첩성은 천연잔디가 인조잔디보다 높은 것으로 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v52 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Agility performance support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Agility performance support in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Agility performance support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">민첩성 수행 지원</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__brain_plasticity_based_psychological_skills_training">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__brain_plasticity_based_psychological_skills_training</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">뇌가소성 기반 심리기술훈련</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Brain plasticity-based psychological skills training</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">뇌 과학의 스포츠심리학 적용 방안 고찰: 뇌 가소성과 자기 뇌조절의 관점에서</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">뇌가소성에 따른 반복 훈련이 심리기술훈련과 부상 선수 재활훈련에 적용될 수 있다고 제시되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-15</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__neurofeedback_biofeedback_sport_psychology"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__objective_psychological_measurement_support"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__injured_athlete_psychological_rehab_support"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Brain plasticity-based psychological skills training</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Brain plasticity-based psychological skills training in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Brain plasticity-based psychological skills training</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">뇌가소성 기반 심리기술훈련</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__professional_sport_ethics_media_discourse">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#policy_exposure_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__professional_sport_ethics_media_discourse</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프로스포츠 윤리경영 미디어 담론 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">professional sport ethics management media discourse context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국내 주요 언론에 나타난 프로구단 윤리경영 담론을 텍스트마이닝으로 분석함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">텍스트 마이닝을 활용한 국내 프로구단의 윤리경영 관련 기사의 주요 키워드 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국내 주요 언론에 나타난 프로구단 윤리경영 담론을 텍스트마이닝으로 분석함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v69_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
