    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sociability improvement through jumpband class</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학교 복식 체육수업에서 점프밴드 프로그램이 사회성과 창의성 및 수업참여에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">의견 교환과 협력 기회를 통해 사회성에 영향을 미친다고 분석됨</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v66_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sociability improvement through jumpband class</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Sociability improvement through jumpband class in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
