    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 지식, 행동, 태도와 PEAS 점수를 측정하고 효과적인 반도핑 프로그램 필요성을 제시함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 엘리트 선수의 도핑 위험을 예방하기 위한 안전·윤리 기반 프로그램임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__adolescent_elite_athletes_anti_doping_support"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__performance_enhancement_attitude_scale_peas"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__anti_doping_information_channels"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__adolescent_elite_competition_anti_doping_context"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__adolescent_elite_doping_risk_awareness_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__fair_sport_environment_protection"/>
