  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__peer_cooperation_consideration_growth">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_relationship_expansion"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__peer_cooperation_consideration_growth</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">또래 협력과 배려 증진</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">peer cooperation and consideration growth</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">춤놀이와 공동 표현활동을 통해 친구와 친해지고 협력·배려를 경험하는 사회적 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생 춤놀이 수업 만족도 및 참여활동에 대한 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">춤놀이를 하면서 친구들과 더 친해지고 협동성과 배려가 나타남.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v67_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">peer cooperation and consideration growth</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">춤놀이와 공동 표현활동을 통해 친구와 친해지고 협력·배려를 경험하는 사회적 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">peer cooperation and consideration growth</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">또래 협력과 배려 증진</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__one_health_equestrian_industry_law_reform">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#sport_policy"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__one_health_equestrian_industry_law_reform</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">원헬스 승마산업 법제 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">One Health equestrian industry law reform</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">원헬스(One Health) 관점에서 승마 산업을 위한 ‘관련 법’ 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">승마 산업의 지속 가능성을 위해 동물, 인간, 환경의 조화를 추구하는 원헬스 관점에서 관련 법을 탐색하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v52 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:has_policy_domain rdf:resource="#policy_domain__sport_policy"/>
    <isp:uses_policy_instrument rdf:resource="#policy_instrument__law_regulation"/>
    <isp:has_policy_goal rdf:resource="#policy_goal__accessibility_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">One Health equestrian industry law reform</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing One Health equestrian industry law reform in the policy dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">One Health equestrian industry law reform</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">원헬스 승마산업 법제 개선</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
