  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__middle_aged_men_obesity_metabolic_health">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__middle_aged_men_obesity_metabolic_health</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 여부별 중년기 남성</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">middle-aged men by obesity status</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 여부에 따라 대사적 건강상태와 신체활동 및 식생활평가지수 비교가 필요한 40~64세 중년 남성 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중년기 남성의 비만여부에 따른 대사적 건강상태와 신체활동 및 식생활평가지수 차이 분석: 국민건강영양조사(2016-2018년도)자료를 이용하여</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">제7기 국민건강영양조사 40~64세 중년 남성 3,275명을 분석하여 비만군의 대사증후군 위험과 상대악력 수준 차이를 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">middle-aged men by obesity status</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">비만 여부에 따라 대사적 건강상태와 신체활동 및 식생활평가지수 비교가 필요한 40~64세 중년 남성 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">middle-aged men by obesity status</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">비만 여부별 중년기 남성</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__obese_women_energy_expenditure_exercise_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">에너지소비 운동 지원이 필요한 비만 여성</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Obese women requiring energy expenditure exercise support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유산소운동과 유압저항운동을 결합한 운동 방식의 에너지소비 효과와 연결되는 비만 여성 대상 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Acute Energy Expenditure to Concurrent Aerobic and Hydraulic Resistance Exercise in Obese Women</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Exercise Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2010</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">199-203</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Nine healthy obese women completed a maximal exercise test and performed submaximal programmed accommodating circuit exercise and stationary cycling. PACE training evoked greater energy expenditure than stationary cycling during submaximal intensity exercise in obese individuals.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__obese_women_energy_expenditure_exercise_support</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Obese women requiring energy expenditure exercise support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">유산소운동과 유압저항운동을 결합한 운동 방식의 에너지소비 효과와 연결되는 비만 여성 대상 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Obese women requiring energy expenditure exercise support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">에너지소비 운동 지원이 필요한 비만 여성</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
