  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__international_sport_federation_good_governance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#sport_policy"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__international_sport_federation_good_governance</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국제스포츠연맹 굿 거버넌스 정책</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">International sport federation good governance policy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국제스포츠연맹의 투명성, 무결성, 민주성, 윤리성, 공정성을 관리하기 위한 스포츠 거버넌스 정책</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ASOIF 굿 거버넌스 보고서 평가지표 내용분석을 통한 WT 성과 및 개선방향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Taekwondo Journal of Kukkiwon</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">99-107</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The study analyzed World Taekwondo governance using ASOIF good governance indicators. It reported that World Taekwondo improved from grade C in 2016 to A2, complied with transparency indicators, strengthened ethical standards and gender equality, maintained systematic election procedures and relations with national associations, and operated an independent ethics committee.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <isp:has_policy_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__sport_governance_transparency_integrity_improvement"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__asoif_good_governance_evaluation_indicators"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">International sport federation good governance policy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국제스포츠연맹의 투명성, 무결성, 민주성, 윤리성, 공정성을 관리하기 위한 스포츠 거버넌스 정책</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">International sport federation good governance policy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">국제스포츠연맹 굿 거버넌스 정책</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__cultural_diversity_understanding_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_integration_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__cultural_diversity_understanding_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">문화다양성 이해 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improved cultural diversity understanding</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국 민속무용 경험을 통해 타문화 이해와 문화다양성 인식이 향상되는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">미국 초등학생의 한국 민속무용 학습경험에 관한 의미 찾기</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improved cultural diversity understanding</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">한국 민속무용 경험을 통해 타문화 이해와 문화다양성 인식이 향상되는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">improved cultural diversity understanding</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">문화다양성 이해 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__team_identification_enhancement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#community_belonging_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__team_identification_enhancement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">팀 동일시 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Team identification enhancement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">리그 승격과 경기장 신축에 따른 소비자행동 차이: 대구FC 2015, 2019 시즌 비교</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">literature_curated_instance</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">리그 승격과 경기장 신축에 따른 소비자행동 차이: 대구FC 2015, 2019 시즌 비교</isp:source_identifier>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019년 집단이 팀동일시와 팀충성도에서 2015년 집단보다 높은 평균을 보였다고 보고함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated v33 instance from uploaded paper</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Team identification enhancement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Team identification enhancement in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Team identification enhancement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">팀 동일시 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__pe_teacher_class_diary_reflection">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__pe_teacher_class_diary_reflection</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 수업일기 반성자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PE teacher class diary reflection resource</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사의 수업 반성과 교수전문성 개발을 위한 수업일기 기반 정보자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 체육 교사의 수업 일기를 통해서 바라 본 반성적 티칭 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2012</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자료는 반성적 체육교수 과정에서 작성된 교사의 수업일기를 중심으로 수집되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PE teacher class diary reflection resource</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육교사의 수업 반성과 교수전문성 개발을 위한 수업일기 기반 정보자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">PE teacher class diary reflection resource</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육교사 수업일기 반성자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
