  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__state_led_elite_sport_doping_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#policy_exposure_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__state_led_elite_sport_doping_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국가주도 엘리트스포츠 도핑 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation context  state led elite sport doping context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성 해방과 도핑 - 동독스포츠 성장의 명암 -</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2008</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">동독 여성스포츠와 도핑을 역사적으로 분석하여 국가주도 엘리트스포츠 체계에서 여성선수의 도핑 노출, 인권침해, 건강 피해를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">participation context  state led elite sport doping context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing participation context  state led elite sport doping context in the participation_context dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">participation context  state led elite sport doping context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">국가주도 엘리트스포츠 도핑 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__taekwondo_doping_intention_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#equity_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__taekwondo_doping_intention_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도 선수 도핑의도 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Taekwondo athlete doping intention reduction</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도 선수가 도핑을 선택하려는 의도를 낮추는 반도핑 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도 선수들이 지각하는 자율성지지와 기본심리욕구, 자기조절동기 및 도핑의도의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자율성지지와 기본심리욕구 일부 요인이 도핑의도에 부적 영향을 미침.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v68_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Taekwondo athlete doping intention reduction</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">태권도 선수가 도핑을 선택하려는 의도를 낮추는 반도핑 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Taekwondo athlete doping intention reduction</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">태권도 선수 도핑의도 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__school_backpack_load_guideline">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교 가방 하중 관리 지침</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">School backpack load management guideline</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생의 체중 대비 가방 무게와 착용 방식을 관리하여 근골격계 부담을 줄이기 위한 지침 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analytical parameters to check association between load carriage system and bag packs-influenced musculoskeletal complications among school going students: a scoping review</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">review_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">20-26</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The scoping review found that backpack load and load-carriage systems among school-going students were associated with lower back, shoulder, and neck pain and postural abnormalities, and recommended broader evaluation and preventive approaches.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__school_backpack_load_guideline</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">School backpack load management guideline</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학생의 체중 대비 가방 무게와 착용 방식을 관리하여 근골격계 부담을 줄이기 위한 지침 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">School backpack load management guideline</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학교 가방 하중 관리 지침</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__sport_club_exercise_continuation_intention_increase">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_continuity"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__sport_club_exercise_continuation_intention_increase</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">생활체육동호회 운동지속의도 증가</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Increased exercise continuation intention in sport clubs</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회적 가치지향과 팀 몰입을 통해 운동지속의도 하위요인이 향상되는 참여 지속 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">생활체육동호회의 사회적 가치지향이 팀 몰입 및 운동지속의도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Increased exercise continuation intention in sport clubs</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사회적 가치지향과 팀 몰입을 통해 운동지속의도 하위요인이 향상되는 참여 지속 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Increased exercise continuation intention in sport clubs</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">생활체육동호회 운동지속의도 증가</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
