    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">상지근력, 하지근력, 평형성, 심폐지구력 등 여성노인의 건강체력이 향상되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역사회 여성노인을 위한 건강교실 운동프로그램 효과검증</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">건강교실 이후 상지근력, 하지근력, 평형성 및 심폐지구력 등 체력요소가 유의하게 향상되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">health fitness improvement among elderly women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">상지근력, 하지근력, 평형성, 심폐지구력 등 여성노인의 건강체력이 향상되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">health fitness improvement among elderly women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">여성노인 건강체력 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__creative_dance_monologue_school_dance_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_linked_program"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__creative_dance_monologue_school_dance_learning</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">창작무용 고해 학교무용 교수학습 활용</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">creative dance Monologue for school dance learning</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프리다칼로의 사랑 이야기를 모티브로 한 무용창작작품 고해에 관한 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">창작무용작품 고해의 창작안무기법이 학교무용 교수학습지도에서 공감각, 유연성, 리듬감각, 정서, 창의성, 사회성 형성에 긍정적 영향을 줄 것으로 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__school_dance_learners_creative_choreography"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__school_dance_creative_expression_learning_context"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__creative_dance_monologue"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__school_dance_creativity_sociality_development"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__school_dance_rhythm_flexibility_development"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">creative dance Monologue for school dance learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing creative dance Monologue for school dance learning in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">creative dance Monologue for school dance learning</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">창작무용 고해 학교무용 교수학습 활용</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__school_dance_learners_creative_choreography"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__international_sport_governance_setting">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#public_institution"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__international_sport_governance_setting</isp:entity_id>
