    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__tai_chi_chair_stand_physical_function_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__tai_chi_gait_training_for_sarcopenic_elderly_women</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tai Chi gait training program for sarcopenic elderly women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">근감소증 여성노인을 대상으로 12주간 주 5회, 회당 60분 수행된 태극권 운동 프로그램임</rdfs:comment>
