    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">reflective PE teaching practice</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사가 수업일기와 반성을 통해 수업목표, 방법, 환경을 개선하는 전문성 개발 실천</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 체육 교사의 수업 일기를 통해서 바라 본 반성적 티칭 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2012</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수업일기와 반성적 체육교수의 실천을 통해 체육수업과 교사에게 변화가 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__reflective_middle_school_pe_teacher"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__pe_teacher_class_diary_reflection"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__pe_class_goal_method_environment_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__pe_teacher_self_reflection_growth"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">reflective PE teaching practice</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육교사가 수업일기와 반성을 통해 수업목표, 방법, 환경을 개선하는 전문성 개발 실천</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">reflective PE teaching practice</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">반성적 체육교수 실천</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__reflective_middle_school_pe_teacher"/>
  </rdf:Description>
