    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Composite index model of sports welfare</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Constructing a Composite Index of Sports Welfare: Application to the 17 Major Provinces and Cities in South Korea</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">International Journal of Applied Sports Sciences</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">델파이와 AHP를 통해 5개 핵심요인과 13개 하위요인을 구성한 스포츠복지 지수 모델이 제시됨</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠복지 수준을 계량적으로 비교하기 위한 지표 기반 정보자원임</isp:definition_text>
