  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__preservice_physical_education_teachers">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__preservice_physical_education_teachers</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">예비 체육교사</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">pre-service physical education teachers</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사로 진입하기 전 직전교사교육 단계에 있는 학습자 및 예비 지도자 집단.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">키워드 네트워크 분석을 통한 예비체육교사 연구동향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">예비체육교사 관련 연구의 핵심 주제와 교육실습, 체육수업 경험 등을 분석함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v68_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">pre-service physical education teachers</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육교사로 진입하기 전 직전교사교육 단계에 있는 학습자 및 예비 지도자 집단.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">pre-service physical education teachers</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">예비 체육교사</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
