    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__elderly_health_belief_sport_attitude_guidance"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__elderly_positive_sport_attitude_increase"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__elderly_sleep_disorder_alleviation_via_sport_attitude"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Elderly life-sports health-belief support program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">생활체육 참여 노인의 건강신념을 바탕으로 긍정적 스포츠태도와 수면건강을 지원하는 노인 생활체육 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Elderly life-sports health-belief support program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">노인 생활체육 건강신념 지원 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_life_sports_club_participants"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__intellectual_disability_referee_classification_workshop">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__intellectual_disability_referee_classification_workshop</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지적장애인스포츠 심판·등급분류 강습회</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">referee and classification workshop for intellectual disability sport</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지적장애인스포츠 심판, 등급분류 인력 및 전문인력 양성을 위한 교육 자원.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지적장애스포츠 조직의 변천 및 발전방향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">심판강습회, 등급분류강습회 등 전문 인력을 양성해야 한다고 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">referee and classification workshop for intellectual disability sport</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지적장애인스포츠 심판, 등급분류 인력 및 전문인력 양성을 위한 교육 자원.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">referee and classification workshop for intellectual disability sport</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">지적장애인스포츠 심판·등급분류 강습회</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__wrestler_performance_confidence_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#self_efficacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__wrestler_performance_confidence_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">레슬링 선수 경기 자신감 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Wrestler performance confidence improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">레슬링 선수가 인식하는 진정성 리더십이 운동 몰입과 경기력에 미치는 영향: 그레코로만형 종목을 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">literature_curated_instance</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">레슬링 선수가 인식하는 진정성 리더십이 운동 몰입과 경기력에 미치는 영향: 그레코로만형 종목을 중심으로</isp:source_identifier>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">진정성 리더십 요인이 경기 자신감과 경기 운영능력에 영향을 미친다고 보고함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated v33 instance from uploaded paper</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Wrestler performance confidence improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Wrestler performance confidence improvement in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Wrestler performance confidence improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">레슬링 선수 경기 자신감 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#school_facility">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#facility_resource"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">School Facility</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A facility resource class representing school facility as a resource for sport participation.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A facility resource class representing school facility as a resource for sport participation.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__elderly_with_metabolic_syndrome_pa_nutrition_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체활동·영양 지원이 필요한 대사증후군 노인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Older adults with metabolic syndrome requiring physical activity and nutrition support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대사증후군 보유와 낮은 신체활동 및 에너지 섭취가 함께 확인된 노인 대상 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analysis of energy intakes, physical activities and metabolic syndrome according to the income level in Korean elderly people: Korean National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey 2016-2018</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">28-35</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data from 2,139 elderly individuals aged over 65 years from KNHANES 2016-2018 showed that older adults with metabolic syndrome and older adults with low income had lower energy intake and physical activity; the study suggested balanced nutrient intake, increased physical activity, education, and program development to prevent metabolic syndrome in the elderly.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__elderly_with_metabolic_syndrome_pa_nutrition_support</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Older adults with metabolic syndrome requiring physical activity and nutrition support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대사증후군 보유와 낮은 신체활동 및 에너지 섭취가 함께 확인된 노인 대상 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Older adults with metabolic syndrome requiring physical activity and nutrition support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">신체활동·영양 지원이 필요한 대사증후군 노인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__pyeongchang_paralympic_accessible_transport">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#transportation_support"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__pyeongchang_paralympic_accessible_transport</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">평창동계패럴림픽 접근성 수송 지원</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PyeongChang Paralympic accessible transportation support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">평창동계패럴림픽 운영에서 강조된 수송 및 접근성 극대화 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2018 평창동계패럴림픽 레거시 및 결산 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국특수체육학회지</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2018 평창동계패럴림픽의 레거시를 스포츠, 사회, 환경, 도시, 경제에 더해 문화, ICT, 평화 레거시로 고찰하고, 홍보, 예산, 참가자, 관람객, 자원봉사자, 등급분류 제로정책, 체육시설 활용, 수송 및 접근성 극대화, 도핑테스트, 방송·취재 환경, 첨단 ICT 패럴림픽 운영을 결산하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:supports_program rdf:resource="#program__pyeongchang_paralympic_accessibility_support"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PyeongChang Paralympic accessible transportation support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">평창동계패럴림픽 운영에서 강조된 수송 및 접근성 극대화 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">PyeongChang Paralympic accessible transportation support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">평창동계패럴림픽 접근성 수송 지원</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__free_semester_pe_curriculum_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__free_semester_pe_curriculum_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자유학기제 체육활동 교육과정 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curricular context of free semester PE</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 자유학기제 교육과정 안에서 체육활동이 운영되는 학교 기반 참여 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 자유학기제 체육활동에 대한 학생 인식 및 만족도 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자유학기제 체육활동은 진로탐색과 체험활동이 가능한 유연한 교육과정에서 운영된다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">curricular context of free semester PE</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">중학교 자유학기제 교육과정 안에서 체육활동이 운영되는 학교 기반 참여 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">curricular context of free semester PE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">자유학기제 체육활동 교육과정 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
