  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__elementary_deviant_behavior_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#discrimination_experience_reduction"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__elementary_deviant_behavior_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생 일탈행동 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">elementary deviant behavior reduction</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생의 스포츠참여와 자아탄력성 증진을 통해 일탈행동 가능성을 낮추는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생의 스포츠참여에 따른 자아탄력성이 일탈행동에 미치는 영향: 학업스트레스의 매개효과를 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자아탄력성과 일탈행동은 부적인 상관관계를 나타냄.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v67_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">elementary deviant behavior reduction</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">초등학생의 스포츠참여와 자아탄력성 증진을 통해 일탈행동 가능성을 낮추는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">elementary deviant behavior reduction</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">초등학생 일탈행동 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__elderly_women_balance_exercise_training">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__elderly_women_balance_exercise_training</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성노인 균형 운동 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">balance exercise training for elderly women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성노인의 균형능력과 낙상 관련 체력을 향상시키기 위한 균형 운동 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">탄력밴드를 이용한 저항성 운동과 균형 운동이 여성 노인의 신체구성과 일상생활체력에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">정적 및 동적 균형운동을 저항성 운동과 동일한 시간과 빈도로 실시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v68_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_women_community_exercise_participants"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__daily_living_fitness_improvement_elderly_women"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__elderly_balance_ability_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">balance exercise training for elderly women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">여성노인의 균형능력과 낙상 관련 체력을 향상시키기 위한 균형 운동 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">balance exercise training for elderly women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">여성노인 균형 운동 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_women_community_exercise_participants"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__covid_remote_middle_school_pe_class">
