  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__six_week_regular_relaxation_sessions">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#regular_participation"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__six_week_regular_relaxation_sessions</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">6주 정기 이완운동 참여</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Six-week regular relaxation sessions</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">6주 동안 주 3회, 회당 60분씩 지속되는 정기 참여 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">6주간의 이완프로그램이 여성노인의 수면장애, 정신적 스트레스 및 염증 지표에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">65세 이상 여성노인을 운동군과 대조군으로 나누고, 운동군은 6주 동안 주 3회, 회당 60분씩 이완프로그램을 실시하였다. 운동군에서 수면장애와 TNF-α가 유의하게 개선되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:operating_period_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">6 weeks; 3 sessions per week; 60 minutes per session</isp:operating_period_text>
    <isp:reflects_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__older_women_with_sleep_disorder_65plus"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Six-week regular relaxation sessions</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">6주 동안 주 3회, 회당 60분씩 지속되는 정기 참여 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Six-week regular relaxation sessions</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">6주 정기 이완운동 참여</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__older_women_with_sleep_disorder_65plus"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__sport_team_crisis_strategy_acceptance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#service_delivery_efficiency"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__sport_team_crisis_strategy_acceptance</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 구단 위기전략 수용성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport team crisis strategy acceptance improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">위기대응 커뮤니케이션 전략에 대한 공중의 수용성이 높아지는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 선수의 스캔들에 대한 스포츠 구단의 위기 커뮤니케이션 전략</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2011</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">언론과학연구</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">선수 스캔들 상황에서 스포츠 구단의 방어적·수용적 위기 커뮤니케이션 전략을 SCCT 관점에서 분석하고, 공중의 전략 수용성과 부정적 구전의지를 검토하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sport team crisis strategy acceptance improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">위기대응 커뮤니케이션 전략에 대한 공중의 수용성이 높아지는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">sport team crisis strategy acceptance improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠 구단 위기전략 수용성 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__male_adolescents_metabolic_risk">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#adolescent"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__male_adolescents_metabolic_risk</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대사증후군 위험 남자 청소년</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Male adolescents at metabolic syndrome risk</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대사증후군 예방이 필요한 12~18세 남자 청소년 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">남자 청소년의 상대 악력과 대사증후군과의 관련성 연구: 제6-7기 국민건강영양조사 자료를 이용하여</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-15</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Male adolescents at metabolic syndrome risk</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대사증후군 예방이 필요한 12~18세 남자 청소년 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Male adolescents at metabolic syndrome risk</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">대사증후군 위험 남자 청소년</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__older_adults_gait_adaptability_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">보행 적응성 지원이 필요한 노인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Older adults requiring gait adaptability support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">환경 변화와 장애물에 대응하는 보행 적응성 과제 및 낙상 예방 지원과 연결되는 노인 대상 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A scoping review of voluntary gait adaptability tasks requiring cognitive demands in older adults</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_url rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.20463/pan.2023.0004</isp:source_url>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">30-31</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Older adults often suffer from walking problems including reduced adaptability to environmental changes and hazards, which can increase fall risk. The review identified voluntary gait adaptability tasks requiring cognitive demands while walking.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__older_adults_gait_adaptability_support</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Older adults requiring gait adaptability support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">환경 변화와 장애물에 대응하는 보행 적응성 과제 및 낙상 예방 지원과 연결되는 노인 대상 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Older adults requiring gait adaptability support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">보행 적응성 지원이 필요한 노인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__pe_assessment_policy_awareness">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#policy_effectiveness_improvement"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육 평가정책 현장 인식 제고</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improvement of field awareness of PE assessment policy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교과 3등급제 평가기록 방법에 대한 체육교사들의 인식</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">현장 체육교사들이 3등급제의 기대효과를 체감하지 못하고 평가 범위 축소를 인식했다고 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__pe_assessment_policy_awareness</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improvement of field awareness of PE assessment policy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing improvement of field awareness of PE assessment policy in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">improvement of field awareness of PE assessment policy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육 평가정책 현장 인식 제고</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__elderly_cognitive_exergame_intervention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__elderly_cognitive_exergame_intervention</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인 인지기능 개선 엑서게임 중재</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">exergame intervention for elderly cognitive function</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인의 인지기능 개선을 위해 전신운동 기반 게임 콘텐츠를 적용하는 운동중재</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엑서게임(exergame)이 노인의 인지기능에 미치는 효과: 체계적 문헌고찰 및 메타분석적 접근</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무작위통제실험 연구를 메타분석한 결과, 중강도 이상, 회당 30분 이상, 주 3회, 8주 이상 엑서게임 참여가 노인의 인지기능 개선에 효율적이었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_exergame_cognitive_health"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__dance_type_exergame"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__exergame_device_and_content"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__elderly_cognitive_function_improvement_exergame"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">exergame intervention for elderly cognitive function</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">노인의 인지기능 개선을 위해 전신운동 기반 게임 콘텐츠를 적용하는 운동중재</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">exergame intervention for elderly cognitive function</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">노인 인지기능 개선 엑서게임 중재</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_exergame_cognitive_health"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__lda_topic_modeling_adapted_pe_evidence">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__lda_topic_modeling_adapted_pe_evidence</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">발달장애 특수체육 토픽모델링 근거자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">topic modeling evidence for adapted physical education</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">발달장애 대상 특수체육 연구 동향을 LDA 토픽모델링으로 분석한 정보 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">발달장애 대상 특수체육 연구 트랜드 탐색: LDA 기반 토픽모델링의 활용</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">topic modeling evidence for adapted physical education</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">발달장애 대상 특수체육 연구 동향을 LDA 토픽모델링으로 분석한 정보 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">topic modeling evidence for adapted physical education</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">발달장애 특수체육 토픽모델링 근거자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__student_athlete_stress_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#mental_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__student_athlete_stress_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생선수 스트레스 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">student-athlete stress reduction</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고등학교 야구선수의 인성과 자아존중감 및 스트레스의 구조적 관계 검증</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고등학교 야구선수 1,585명을 대상으로 인성, 자아존중감, 스트레스의 구조적 관계를 분석하고 인성교육 프로그램 필요성을 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">student-athlete stress reduction</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing student-athlete stress reduction in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">student-athlete stress reduction</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학생선수 스트레스 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__obese_women_concurrent_exercise_energy_expenditure_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#medical_welfare_linked_program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 여성 복합운동 에너지소비 지원 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Concurrent exercise energy expenditure support program for obese women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 여성을 대상으로 유산소운동과 유압저항운동을 결합하여 에너지소비 증가를 지원하는 건강 연계 운동 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Acute Energy Expenditure to Concurrent Aerobic and Hydraulic Resistance Exercise in Obese Women</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Exercise Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2010</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">199-203</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Nine healthy obese women completed a maximal exercise test and performed submaximal programmed accommodating circuit exercise and stationary cycling. PACE training evoked greater energy expenditure than stationary cycling during submaximal intensity exercise in obese individuals.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__obese_women_energy_expenditure_exercise_support"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__concurrent_aerobic_hydraulic_resistance_exercise"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__obese_women_submaximal_circuit_exercise_context"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__obese_women_exercise_energy_expenditure_increase"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__obese_women_concurrent_exercise_energy_expenditure_support</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Concurrent exercise energy expenditure support program for obese women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">비만 여성을 대상으로 유산소운동과 유압저항운동을 결합하여 에너지소비 증가를 지원하는 건강 연계 운동 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Concurrent exercise energy expenditure support program for obese women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">비만 여성 복합운동 에너지소비 지원 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__obese_women_energy_expenditure_exercise_support"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__knhanes_elderly_pa_nutrition_surveillance_data">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#program_information"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인 신체활동·영양 국민건강영양조사 자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">KNHANES elderly physical activity and nutrition surveillance data</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인의 소득 수준, 대사증후군, 에너지 섭취, 신체활동 수준을 분석할 수 있는 국가조사 기반 정보 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analysis of energy intakes, physical activities and metabolic syndrome according to the income level in Korean elderly people: Korean National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey 2016-2018</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">28-35</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data from 2,139 elderly individuals aged over 65 years from KNHANES 2016-2018 showed that older adults with metabolic syndrome and older adults with low income had lower energy intake and physical activity; the study suggested balanced nutrient intake, increased physical activity, education, and program development to prevent metabolic syndrome in the elderly.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__knhanes_elderly_pa_nutrition_surveillance_data</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">KNHANES elderly physical activity and nutrition surveillance data</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">노인의 소득 수준, 대사증후군, 에너지 섭취, 신체활동 수준을 분석할 수 있는 국가조사 기반 정보 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">KNHANES elderly physical activity and nutrition surveillance data</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">노인 신체활동·영양 국민건강영양조사 자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__adolescent_school_pe_aerobic_fitness">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#adolescent"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__adolescent_school_pe_aerobic_fitness</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유산소 체력 향상 대상 청소년</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Adolescents targeted for aerobic fitness improvement in PE</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Effect of 4 weeks of Fun Game-Based and Structured Interval Training Physical Education Lessons on Aerobic Fitness in Adolescents</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">15세 남학생 58명을 게임 기반 수업과 인터벌 트레이닝 체육수업에 배정함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교체육을 통해 유산소 체력 향상이 필요한 청소년 집단임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Adolescents targeted for aerobic fitness improvement in PE</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학교체육을 통해 유산소 체력 향상이 필요한 청소년 집단임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Adolescents targeted for aerobic fitness improvement in PE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">유산소 체력 향상 대상 청소년</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__stage_matched_physical_activity_support_for_girls">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_linked_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__stage_matched_physical_activity_support_for_girls</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여학생 운동행동단계 맞춤형 신체활동 지원</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program  stage matched physical activity support for girls</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여자 고등학생의 운동행동변화단계에 따른 운동제약요인 및 운동자기효능감과 회복탄력성 비교</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여자 고등학생 330명을 대상으로 운동행동변화단계별 운동제약요인, 운동자기효능감, 회복탄력성 차이를 분석하고 단계별 체육교육 전략 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__female_high_school_students_exercise_behavior_change"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__exercise_constraint_self_efficacy_resilience_assessment"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__girls_exercise_self_efficacy_resilience_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">program  stage matched physical activity support for girls</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing program  stage matched physical activity support for girls in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">program  stage matched physical activity support for girls</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">여학생 운동행동단계 맞춤형 신체활동 지원</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__female_high_school_students_exercise_behavior_change"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__adolescent_male">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#adolescent"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__adolescent_male</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Adolescent Male</isp:pref_label_en>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Adolescent Male</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Adolescent Male in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Adolescent Male</skos:prefLabel>
