    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">reduced competitive state anxiety in middle school soccer players</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">과제지향적 목표와 숙련분위기를 통해 중학교 축구선수의 경쟁상태불안이 낮아지는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 축구선수의 성취목표성향, 훈련동기분위기 및 경쟁상태불안의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">과제지향적 성취목표성향과 숙련분위기를 통해 경쟁상태불안을 낮출 수 있다고 제시되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">reduced competitive state anxiety in middle school soccer players</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">과제지향적 목표와 숙련분위기를 통해 중학교 축구선수의 경쟁상태불안이 낮아지는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">reduced competitive state anxiety in middle school soccer players</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">중학교 축구선수 경쟁상태불안 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
