    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">positive peer interaction for drug prevention</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing positive peer interaction for drug prevention in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
