  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__older_women_12_week_circuit_exercise_frequency_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__older_women_12_week_circuit_exercise_frequency_program</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고령 여성 12주 순환운동 빈도 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12-week circuit exercise frequency program for older women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고령 여성의 순환운동빈도에 따른 Estradiol, Cortisol 및 체력 수준에 미치는 효과</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">65세 이상 고령 여성에게 12주간 순환운동을 적용하고 운동빈도에 따른 estradiol, cortisol, 체력 변화를 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__older_women_circuit_exercise_participants"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__circuit_exercise_for_older_women"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__three_to_five_times_weekly_circuit_exercise"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__older_women_estradiol_increase"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__older_women_cortisol_decrease"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__older_women_physical_fitness_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">12-week circuit exercise frequency program for older women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing 12-week circuit exercise frequency program for older women in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">12-week circuit exercise frequency program for older women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">고령 여성 12주 순환운동 빈도 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__older_women_circuit_exercise_participants"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__autonomy_supportive_anti_doping_coaching">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__autonomy_supportive_anti_doping_coaching</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자율성지지 반도핑 코칭 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">autonomy-supportive anti-doping coaching program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">선수의 심리적 욕구만족과 정신력을 높이고 도핑 의도를 낮추기 위한 자율성지지 코칭 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자의 코칭방식, 선수들의 심리적 욕구만족, 욕구좌절, 정신력과 도핑 의도와의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자의 자율성지지 방식은 욕구만족을 예측하고, 욕구만족은 정신력을 예측하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__controlling_coaching_doping_risk_context"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__coach_interpersonal_style_guidance"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__athlete_psychological_need_satisfaction"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__doping_intention_reduction_by_mental_toughness"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">autonomy-supportive anti-doping coaching program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선수의 심리적 욕구만족과 정신력을 높이고 도핑 의도를 낮추기 위한 자율성지지 코칭 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">autonomy-supportive anti-doping coaching program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">자율성지지 반도핑 코칭 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
