    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인 스포츠지도자 및 예비 지도자의 영양지식 및 영양교육 요구도</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인스포츠지도자들이 영양교육 필요성과 참여 의지를 높게 보였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v58 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved nutrition guidance capacity of para-sports instructors</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Improved nutrition guidance capacity of para-sports instructors in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved nutrition guidance capacity of para-sports instructors</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애인스포츠지도자 영양지도 역량 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__student_athlete_career_planning_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생선수 진로설계 지원</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Student-athlete career planning support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생선수가 운동 지속, 은퇴 이후, 체육 및 비체육 분야 진로를 탐색하고 계획하는 역량을 높이는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학생 학생선수용 체육진로흥미검사지 개발 및 타당화 검증</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육진로흥미검사를 토대로 대학생 학생선수 진로교육 활용 방안을 논의하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__student_athlete_career_planning_support</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Student-athlete career planning support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학생선수가 운동 지속, 은퇴 이후, 체육 및 비체육 분야 진로를 탐색하고 계획하는 역량을 높이는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Student-athlete career planning support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학생선수 진로설계 지원</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__low_income_elderly_metabolic_syndrome_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대사증후군 예방 지원이 필요한 저소득 노인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Low-income older adults requiring metabolic syndrome prevention support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">소득 수준, 영양섭취 부족, 낮은 신체활동 수준이 대사증후군 예방 지원 필요성과 연결되는 노인 대상 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analysis of energy intakes, physical activities and metabolic syndrome according to the income level in Korean elderly people: Korean National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey 2016-2018</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">28-35</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data from 2,139 elderly individuals aged over 65 years from KNHANES 2016-2018 showed that older adults with metabolic syndrome and older adults with low income had lower energy intake and physical activity; the study suggested balanced nutrient intake, increased physical activity, education, and program development to prevent metabolic syndrome in the elderly.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__low_income_elderly_metabolic_syndrome_support</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Low-income older adults requiring metabolic syndrome prevention support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">소득 수준, 영양섭취 부족, 낮은 신체활동 수준이 대사증후군 예방 지원 필요성과 연결되는 노인 대상 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Low-income older adults requiring metabolic syndrome prevention support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">대사증후군 예방 지원이 필요한 저소득 노인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__anti_doping_workforce_training_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">반도핑 검사 인력 양성 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">anti-doping workforce training program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑검사관과 혈액채취요원 등 반도핑 검사업무 인력을 양성하고 역량을 관리하는 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">임상병리기술학 전공 유사 취업연계 자격 현황</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean Journal of Clinical Laboratory Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">KADA가 대한민국의 반도핑 전담기구로 도핑검사관 운영을 주관한다고 설명되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__doping_control_officer_qualification"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__blood_collection_officer_qualification"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__anti_doping_workforce_capacity_strengthening"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__anti_doping_workforce_training_program</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">anti-doping workforce training program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">도핑검사관과 혈액채취요원 등 반도핑 검사업무 인력을 양성하고 역량을 관리하는 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">anti-doping workforce training program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">반도핑 검사 인력 양성 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__cp_child_gmfm_e_improvement_vr">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#functional_ability_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__cp_child_gmfm_e_improvement_vr</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">뇌성마비 아동 GMFM-E 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">GMFM-E improvement in children with cerebral palsy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">뇌성마비 아동을 위한 가상현실 기반 운동중재의 보행효과에 대한 체계적 문헌고찰 및 효과크기 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대동작 운동기능평가 GMFM-E에 대한 효과크기 분석 결과가 제시되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-15</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">GMFM-E improvement in children with cerebral palsy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing GMFM-E improvement in children with cerebral palsy in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">GMFM-E improvement in children with cerebral palsy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">뇌성마비 아동 GMFM-E 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
