  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__sport_violence_prevention_awareness">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#equity_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__sport_violence_prevention_awareness</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠폭력 예방 인식 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport violence prevention awareness improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">선수와 참여자의 권리와 존엄을 우선하여 스포츠 폭력 예방 인식이 향상되는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠보다 사람이 우선입니다</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠 폭력의 원인을 금메달만 추구하는 운동문화와 사람보다 스포츠를 우선하는 구조에서 찾고, 사람 중심 스포츠로의 전환을 제안하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sport violence prevention awareness improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선수와 참여자의 권리와 존엄을 우선하여 스포츠 폭력 예방 인식이 향상되는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">sport violence prevention awareness improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠폭력 예방 인식 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__elderly_physical_activity_participation_increase">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_rate_increase"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인 신체활동 참여 증가</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Increased physical activity participation among older adults</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대사증후군 예방과 건강관리를 위해 노인의 총 신체활동 및 여가 신체활동 참여를 높이는 참여 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analysis of energy intakes, physical activities and metabolic syndrome according to the income level in Korean elderly people: Korean National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey 2016-2018</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">28-35</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data from 2,139 elderly individuals aged over 65 years from KNHANES 2016-2018 showed that older adults with metabolic syndrome and older adults with low income had lower energy intake and physical activity; the study suggested balanced nutrient intake, increased physical activity, education, and program development to prevent metabolic syndrome in the elderly.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__elderly_physical_activity_participation_increase</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Increased physical activity participation among older adults</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대사증후군 예방과 건강관리를 위해 노인의 총 신체활동 및 여가 신체활동 참여를 높이는 참여 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Increased physical activity participation among older adults</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">노인 신체활동 참여 증가</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__soccer_decision_accuracy_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__soccer_decision_accuracy_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">축구 의사결정 정확성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improvement in soccer decision-making accuracy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">축구 경기 상황에서 적절한 의사결정의 정확성이 향상되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지각기술훈련이 유소년 축구선수의 의사결정능력에 미치는 효과 검증</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지각기술훈련 집단의 의사결정 정확성은 통제집단보다 향상되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improvement in soccer decision-making accuracy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">축구 경기 상황에서 적절한 의사결정의 정확성이 향상되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
