  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__new_poomsae_competition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#development_program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">새 품새 경기대회</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">New Poomsae competition</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도 품새의 경기적 가능성 확대를 위해 도입된 새 품새 경기 활동.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중국 태권도선수의 시각에서 바라본 새 품새 경기대회의 특징과 발전방향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중국 태권도 선수 4명을 대상으로 새 품새 경기대회의 특징과 발전방향을 분석함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">확실하게 문헌 내용에서 확인 가능한 요소만 제한 반영함.</isp:note>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__new_poomsae_spectator_interest"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__new_poomsae_competition</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">New Poomsae competition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">태권도 품새의 경기적 가능성 확대를 위해 도입된 새 품새 경기 활동.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">New Poomsae competition</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">새 품새 경기대회</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__middle_school_pe_happiness_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#well_being_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__middle_school_pe_happiness_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학생 체육수업 행복감 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improved happiness in middle school PE</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">친구·교사 상호작용, 신체활동 혜택, 심리적 혜택을 통해 체육수업 행복감이 높아지는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 학교유형에 따른 체육수업에 대한 행복감과 수업태도의 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교유형에 따라 친구와의 상호작용, 신체활동 혜택, 교사와의 상호작용, 심리적 혜택에 차이가 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improved happiness in middle school PE</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">친구·교사 상호작용, 신체활동 혜택, 심리적 혜택을 통해 체육수업 행복감이 높아지는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">improved happiness in middle school PE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">중학생 체육수업 행복감 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__sports_csr_teeball_program_for_developmental_disabilities">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#disabled_person_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__sports_csr_teeball_program_for_developmental_disabilities</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">발달장애 청소년 스포츠 CSR 티볼 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sports CSR tee-ball program for adolescents with developmental disabilities</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">기업 사회공헌활동의 일환으로 발달장애 청소년에게 제공된 티볼 중심 신체활동 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠를 통한 CSR 프로그램이 발달장애 청소년의 신체능력 및 사회성에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">발달장애 학생 104명이 기업 CSR 신체활동 프로그램에 참여한 후 건강체력, 운동수행력, 사회성 및 자기결정성에서 변화가 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__adolescents_with_developmental_disabilities"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__adapted_teeball_for_developmental_disabilities"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__special_school_and_special_class_setting"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__corporate_social_responsibility_sport_support"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__developmental_disability_fitness_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__developmental_disability_social_skill_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sports CSR tee-ball program for adolescents with developmental disabilities</rdfs:label>
