  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__pe_major_collaboration_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_integration_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__pe_major_collaboration_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육 전공생 협력능력 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">physical education major collaboration improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">팀 역할 수행을 통해 체육 전공 대학생의 협력능력이 향상되는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠교육모형 적용 체육 수업이 체육 전공 대학생 학습자에게 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육 전공 대학생 16명이 스포츠교육모형 수업에서 역할 수행을 경험하며 자기주도 학습태도, 책임감, 협력능력, 리더십 발달을 경험한 것으로 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">physical education major collaboration improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">팀 역할 수행을 통해 체육 전공 대학생의 협력능력이 향상되는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">physical education major collaboration improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육 전공생 협력능력 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__adapted_physical_activity_ethics_sensitivity">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#psychological_outcome"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__adapted_physical_activity_ethics_sensitivity</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특수체육 윤리적 민감성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ethical sensitivity improvement in adapted physical activity</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특수체육 지도자가 장애인 체육지도 상황에서 윤리적 문제를 인식하고 판단하는 역량 향상 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특수체육실천영역에 관한 윤리학적 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">윤리적 판단이 특수체육지도자에게 요구되는 중요한 자질이라고 설명하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ethical sensitivity improvement in adapted physical activity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">특수체육 지도자가 장애인 체육지도 상황에서 윤리적 문제를 인식하고 판단하는 역량 향상 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ethical sensitivity improvement in adapted physical activity</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">특수체육 윤리적 민감성 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__swimming_ethics_education_for_business_teams">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__swimming_ethics_education_for_business_teams</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">실업팀 수영 윤리교육 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">swimming ethics education for business teams</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수영선수의 윤리의식 개선과 실업팀 활성화를 위해 표준절차, 규정교육, 학교 및 연맹교육을 포함하는 역량강화 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수영선수의 윤리의식 실태분석을 통한 실업팀 활성화방안 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">표준화 절차와 규정 교육, 학교교육, 연맹 교육 등이 개선방안으로 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__business_swimming_team_athletes"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__swimming_ethics_rule_education_resource"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__swimming_ethics_awareness_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__business_swimming_team_revitalization"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">swimming ethics education for business teams</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">수영선수의 윤리의식 개선과 실업팀 활성화를 위해 표준절차, 규정교육, 학교 및 연맹교육을 포함하는 역량강화 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">swimming ethics education for business teams</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">실업팀 수영 윤리교육 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__business_swimming_team_athletes"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__learning_fatigue_reduction_curriculum_design">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__learning_fatigue_reduction_curriculum_design</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학습피로 완화 교육과정 설계지침</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support resource  learning fatigue reduction curriculum design</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트스포츠 영역의 법정의무교육 현황 및 개선방향: 스포츠지도자의 학습피로를 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">현직 스포츠지도자 12명 심층면담을 통해 스포츠윤리, 인권, 성폭력예방, 반도핑 법정의무교육의 학습피로 문제가 확인되고 내용·시간·방법 개선 필요가 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">support resource  learning fatigue reduction curriculum design</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing support resource  learning fatigue reduction curriculum design in the support_resource dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">support resource  learning fatigue reduction curriculum design</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학습피로 완화 교육과정 설계지침</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__older_adult_physical_fitness_nafld_prevention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__older_adult_physical_fitness_nafld_prevention</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인 체력 기반 지방간 예방 지원 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Older adult physical fitness-based NAFLD prevention support program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">정상 체중과 체력 증진을 통해 비알코올성 지방간 관련 위험 관리를 지원하는 노인 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Association of hand-grip strength and non-alcoholic fatty liver disease index in older adults</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Exercise Nutrition and Biochemistry</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_url rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.20463/jenb.2018.0031</isp:source_url>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">62-63</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This cross-sectional study of 538 older adults found linear decreases in NAFLD indices across incremental hand-grip strength levels and suggested lifestyle intervention with normal weight and physical fitness as prevention against NAFLD.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__older_adults_nafld_physical_fitness_risk"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__handgrip_strength_nafld_screening"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__nafld_risk_management_through_fitness"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Older adult physical fitness-based NAFLD prevention support program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">정상 체중과 체력 증진을 통해 비알코올성 지방간 관련 위험 관리를 지원하는 노인 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Older adult physical fitness-based NAFLD prevention support program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">노인 체력 기반 지방간 예방 지원 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__older_adults_nafld_physical_fitness_risk"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__technology_doping_ethics_education">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
