    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자의 자율성지지와 자기조절동기를 활용하여 도핑의도를 낮추는 교육·중재 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">맥락전이모델(Trans-Contextual Model: TCM)을 적용한 엘리트 선수들의 도핑의도 예측</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__elite_athletes_tcm_doping_study"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__trans_contextual_doping_intention_model"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__doping_intention_reduction"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__elite_sport_doping_risk_context"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">autonomy-support based anti-doping intervention</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지도자의 자율성지지와 자기조절동기를 활용하여 도핑의도를 낮추는 교육·중재 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">autonomy-support based anti-doping intervention</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">자율성지지 기반 반도핑 중재</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elite_athletes_tcm_doping_study"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__equestrian_animal_welfare_risk_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#institutional_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__equestrian_animal_welfare_risk_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">승마 동물복지 위험 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Equestrian animal welfare risk context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">승마 종목이 동물 학대 논란과 동물복지 요구에 직면하는 제도적·사회적 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">승마에서의 동물 학대에 관한 쟁점과 과제</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">동물 학대 논란으로 근대5종에서 승마가 제외되고 승마 종목 폐지 요구까지 제기됨</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Equestrian animal welfare risk context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">승마 종목이 동물 학대 논란과 동물복지 요구에 직면하는 제도적·사회적 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Equestrian animal welfare risk context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">승마 동물복지 위험 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__allergy_self_management_literacy_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__allergy_self_management_literacy_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">알레르기 자기관리 문해력 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">allergy self-management literacy improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">알레르기 청소년이 식이, 위생, 운동, 체중관리 등의 관리 수칙을 이해하고 실천하도록 돕는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년의 알레르기 진단 경험에 따른 영양, 위생 교육 경험의 차이 검정</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">식이와 흡연, 운동, 체중 조절, 손씻기가 알레르기 질환 관리에 중요하다고 설명하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">allergy self-management literacy improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">알레르기 청소년이 식이, 위생, 운동, 체중관리 등의 관리 수칙을 이해하고 실천하도록 돕는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">allergy self-management literacy improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">알레르기 자기관리 문해력 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy_instrument">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#policy"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Policy Instrument</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A policy classification that identifies the tool, mechanism, or governing means through which a policy is implemented.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A policy classification that identifies the tool, mechanism, or governing means through which a policy is implemented.</skos:definition>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Abstract organizing class retained to group more specific subclasses; no direct individual assignment is expected in the current curation policy.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">Curated in step 6 as abstract/non-leaf empty class. Direct instances should normally be assigned to its leaf subclasses rather than to policy_instrument.</skos:editorialNote>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__child_youth_pa_guideline_policy_alignment">
