    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">족구 클럽 스포츠</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Foot volleyball club sport</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역 클럽과 리그를 기반으로 이루어지는 생활체육 족구 활동.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">족구 동호인의 계획행동, 참여동기, 운동지속의도의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">족구는 등록 클럽과 리그를 중심으로 다수 동호인이 참여하는 생활스포츠로 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">확실하게 문헌 내용에서 확인 가능한 요소만 제한 반영함.</isp:note>
    <isp:reflects_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__foot_volleyball_club_members"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__foot_volleyball_club_sport</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Foot volleyball club sport</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지역 클럽과 리그를 기반으로 이루어지는 생활체육 족구 활동.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Foot volleyball club sport</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">족구 클럽 스포츠</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__foot_volleyball_club_members"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__oda_disability_sport_participants">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_disability"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__oda_disability_sport_participants</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인체육 ODA 대상 장애인 참여자</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국 장애인체육 ODA 정책의 협력 및 집행 구조 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인체육 ODA는 개발협력 맥락에서 장애인의 참여와 권리 보장을 다루었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ODA Disability Sport Participants</isp:pref_label_en>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ODA Disability Sport Participants</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing ODA Disability Sport Participants in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ODA Disability Sport Participants</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애인체육 ODA 대상 장애인 참여자</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__case_based_sport_ethics_education">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사례기반 스포츠윤리 교육프로그램</rdfs:label>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사례기반 스포츠윤리 교육프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">case-based sport ethics education program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중·고등학교 학생선수의 윤리적 민감성과 판단력 증진을 위해 개발된 사례기반 교육프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠윤리 교육프로그램 개발</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중·고등학교 학생선수를 위한 사례기반 스포츠윤리 교육프로그램을 개발하고, 적용 후 스포츠윤리성 점수 향상을 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary_evidence</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_high_student_athletes_ethics"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__sport_ethics_case_learning_materials"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__sport_ethics_video_clip_worksheets"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__school_athlete_ethics_class"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__sport_ethics_awareness_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__ethical_sensitivity_judgment_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__case_based_sport_ethics_education</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">중·고등학교 학생선수의 윤리적 민감성과 판단력 증진을 위해 개발된 사례기반 교육프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">case-based sport ethics education program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">사례기반 스포츠윤리 교육프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_high_student_athletes_ethics"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__school_pe_based_health_education_teacher_training">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__school_pe_based_health_education_teacher_training</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교체육 기반 건강교육 교수역량 강화 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PE-based health education teacher training program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">예비 체육교사의 학교체육 기반 건강교육 요구도 분석: Borich 요구도와 LF 모델 활용</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">예비 체육교사의 정신건강관리, 사회적 건강관리, 운동처방 관련 건강교육 교수역량을 높이는 프로그램임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">예비 체육교사의 정신건강관리, 사회적 건강관리, 운동처방 관련 건강교육 교수역량을 높이는 프로그램임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__pre_service_physical_education_teachers_digital"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__borich_lf_health_education_needs_assessment"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__pe_health_curriculum_content_resource"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__pe_health_education_teaching_capacity_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__adolescent_integrated_health_management_support"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PE-based health education teacher training program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">예비 체육교사의 정신건강관리, 사회적 건강관리, 운동처방 관련 건강교육 교수역량을 높이는 프로그램임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">PE-based health education teacher training program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학교체육 기반 건강교육 교수역량 강화 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__pre_service_physical_education_teachers_digital"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__elite_badminton_athletes_sport_ethics">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠윤리 인식 배드민턴 선수</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Badminton athletes with sport ethics perceptions</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대한배드민턴협회 등록 선수 중 스포츠윤리에 대한 주관적 인식 유형을 보이는 선수 집단.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">배드민턴 선수의 스포츠 윤리에 대한 주관적 인식 유형과 특성</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국체육학회지</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대한배드민턴협회 등록 선수 80명을 대상으로 스포츠윤리 주관적 인식을 분석함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__elite_badminton_athletes_sport_ethics</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Badminton athletes with sport ethics perceptions</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대한배드민턴협회 등록 선수 중 스포츠윤리에 대한 주관적 인식 유형을 보이는 선수 집단.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Badminton athletes with sport ethics perceptions</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠윤리 인식 배드민턴 선수</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__metabolic_cardiovascular_risk_improvement_low_income">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__metabolic_cardiovascular_risk_improvement_low_income</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저소득층 대사·심혈관 건강위험 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">metabolic and cardiovascular risk improvement for low-income residents</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">인슐린저항성, 심박수, 심근부담률, 대사증후군 구성요소, Framingham 위험지수가 개선되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역사회 저소득 취약계층 주민을 위한 1년간의 운동프로그램이 대사 및 심혈관 건강 위험요인에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">공복 인슐린, HOMA-IR, 안정시 심박수, 심근부담률, 대사증후군 구성요소와 Framingham 위험지수가 개선되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">metabolic and cardiovascular risk improvement for low-income residents</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">인슐린저항성, 심박수, 심근부담률, 대사증후군 구성요소, Framingham 위험지수가 개선되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">metabolic and cardiovascular risk improvement for low-income residents</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">저소득층 대사·심혈관 건강위험 개선</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__public_doping_discourse_monitoring">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#policy_effectiveness_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__public_doping_discourse_monitoring</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">공중 도핑 담론 모니터링</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">public doping discourse monitoring</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유튜브 댓글의 도핑 담론에 대한 의미연결망 및 토픽모델링 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">특정 선수 도핑 논란, 스포츠윤리, 국가별 도핑 문제, 도핑방법과 기술 등이 주요 토픽으로 도출됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">public doping discourse monitoring</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing public doping discourse monitoring in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">public doping discourse monitoring</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">공중 도핑 담론 모니터링</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
