  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__group_meal_nutrition_hygiene_guideline">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">집단급식 영양·위생 관리 지침</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Group meal nutrition and hygiene guideline</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국가 비만관리 정책에서 집단급식 영양과 위생 관리를 강화하기 위해 필요한 지침 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analysis of public perception of national obesity management policy</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">27-35</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A national online survey of citizens aged 15-69 identified lifestyle improvement for obesity prevention, child and adolescent obesity prevention and management, community-based obesity and exercise clinics, and an integrated information platform for nutrition, diet, and physical activity as important national obesity policy tasks.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__group_meal_nutrition_hygiene_guideline</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Group meal nutrition and hygiene guideline</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국가 비만관리 정책에서 집단급식 영양과 위생 관리를 강화하기 위해 필요한 지침 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Group meal nutrition and hygiene guideline</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">집단급식 영양·위생 관리 지침</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__cognitive_impairment_progression_delay">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__cognitive_impairment_progression_delay</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">인지장애 진행 지연</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">delay of cognitive impairment progression</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인들을 대상으로 시행한 운동 중재 효과 크기 검증을 통한 운동프로그램 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동프로그램은 8~16주, 주 2~3회, 회당 50~60분으로 구성되었고, 유산소와 저항성 운동을 함께 사용하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">delay of cognitive impairment progression</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing delay of cognitive impairment progression in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">delay of cognitive impairment progression</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">인지장애 진행 지연</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__visual_perception_coordination_activity_developmental_disability">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#disabled_person_program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">발달장애 아동 시지각 협응 활동 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Visual perception coordination activity program for children with developmental disabilities</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">시지각 협응 활동 프로그램이 발달장애 아동의 조작운동 기술능력에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">intervention_study</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">16주간 주 2회, 1회 80분간 시지각 협응 활동 프로그램을 진행함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">v45 추가 인스턴스</isp:note>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">v45_batch</isp:source_identifier>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__developmental_disability_children_object_control"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__visual_perception_object_control_adapted_activity"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__special_school_developmental_disability_physical_activity"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__parent_interview_program_adaptation"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__developmental_disability_object_control_skill_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__visual_perception_coordination_activity_developmental_disability</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Visual perception coordination activity program for children with developmental disabilities</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Visual perception coordination activity program for children with developmental disabilities in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Visual perception coordination activity program for children with developmental disabilities</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">발달장애 아동 시지각 협응 활동 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__developmental_disability_children_object_control"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__high_school_athlete_doping_education">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__high_school_athlete_doping_education</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고교 엘리트 선수 도핑교육 자료</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">doping education resource for high school elite athletes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">교교 엘리트 선수들의 경기력 향상을 위한 운동영향보조물 섭취형태와 도핑의식</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2008</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">일반고와 체육고 엘리트 선수 338명을 대상으로 경기력 향상을 위한 운동영양 보조물 섭취형태와 도핑의식을 조사하였고, 전체 섭취 경험은 60.9%, 체육고 선수의 도핑교육 경험은 74.6%, 일반고 선수의 도핑교육 경험은 14.9%로 나타났다고 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Korea Sport Research</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고교 엘리트 선수와 주변인을 대상으로 보조물 섭취와 도핑 위험을 설명하는 교육 자원임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">doping education resource for high school elite athletes</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">고교 엘리트 선수와 주변인을 대상으로 보조물 섭취와 도핑 위험을 설명하는 교육 자원임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">doping education resource for high school elite athletes</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">고교 엘리트 선수 도핑교육 자료</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
