    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">운동중재 메타분석에서 다룬 요통·관절통 등 근골격 통증을 경험하는 환자 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">musculoskeletal pain patients</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">근골격 통증 환자</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__golf_field_lesson_growth_mindset_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#self_efficacy_improvement"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__golf_field_lesson_growth_mindset_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">골프 필드레슨 성장마인드 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">growth mindset improvement in golf field lessons</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">필드레슨 참여자의 그릿이 마인드셋과 운동지속에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">필드레슨 참가자의 노력지속은 성장마인드에 정적 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_result_of_program rdf:resource="#program__golf_field_lesson_mindset_support"/>
    <isp:reflects_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__golf_field_lesson_participants"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">growth mindset improvement in golf field lessons</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing growth mindset improvement in golf field lessons in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">growth mindset improvement in golf field lessons</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">골프 필드레슨 성장마인드 향상</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__golf_field_lesson_participants"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__school_athlete_ethics_class">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_institution"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">학교운동부 스포츠윤리 수업 맥락</rdfs:label>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교운동부 스포츠윤리 수업 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">school athlete sport ethics class context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생선수 대상 스포츠윤리 교육이 학교 및 운동부 환경에서 실행되는 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠윤리 교육프로그램 개발</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중·고등학교 학생선수를 위한 사례기반 스포츠윤리 교육프로그램을 개발하고, 적용 후 스포츠윤리성 점수 향상을 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary_evidence</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__school_athlete_ethics_class</isp:entity_id>
