  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__preschool_children_basic_fitness_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_competence_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__preschool_children_basic_fitness_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유아 기초체력 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Basic physical fitness improvement in preschool children</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간 복합운동 프로그램 참여 후 유아의 근지구력, 유연성, 순발력, 민첩성, 평형성 등 기초체력이 향상된 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간 복합운동 프로그램이 유아의 기초체력에 미치는 효과</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2008</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Exercise Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유아 230명을 대상으로 실험집단과 통제집단으로 구분하여 12주간 복합운동 프로그램을 적용하였다. 사전·사후 측정 결과, 근지구력, 유연성, 순발력, 민첩성, 평형성 등 기초체력과 운동기능에서 긍정적 향상이 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_significant</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:outcome_indicator_name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">muscle endurance; flexibility; power; agility; balance</isp:outcome_indicator_name>
    <isp:measurement_timepoint rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">pre-post</isp:measurement_timepoint>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Basic physical fitness improvement in preschool children</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">12주간 복합운동 프로그램 참여 후 유아의 근지구력, 유연성, 순발력, 민첩성, 평형성 등 기초체력이 향상된 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Basic physical fitness improvement in preschool children</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">유아 기초체력 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__future_goal_formation_after_martial_arts">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#self_efficacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">미래 목표 형성</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">future goal formation after martial arts</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무도 수련을 통해 대학진학, 지도자 희망 등 구체적 미래 목표를 갖게 되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">일탈청소년들의 무도 수련을 통한 변화 경험에 관한 사례 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학진학의 꿈, 지도자가 되고 싶은 나라는 구체적인 목표가 생겼다고 제시되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__future_goal_formation_after_martial_arts</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">future goal formation after martial arts</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">무도 수련을 통해 대학진학, 지도자 희망 등 구체적 미래 목표를 갖게 되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">future goal formation after martial arts</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">미래 목표 형성</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__ai_dance_evaluation_tms">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#digital_device"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__ai_dance_evaluation_tms</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AI 평가 연동 교육훈련관리시스템</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AI evaluation-linked test management system</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생 영상을 실시간 평가하도록 설계된 AI 평가 및 TMS 연동 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">에듀테크 기반 비대면 K-Dance 수업 프로그램 개발 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">온라인 실습 기반 체육수업에서 AI 평가와 TMS 연동, 백워드 설계, 마이크로러닝 콘텐츠를 활용한 비대면 K-Dance 수업 프로그램을 개발하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">AI evaluation-linked test management system</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학생 영상을 실시간 평가하도록 설계된 AI 평가 및 TMS 연동 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">AI evaluation-linked test management system</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">AI 평가 연동 교육훈련관리시스템</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__elementary_korean_folk_dance_expression">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elementary_school_sport"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__elementary_korean_folk_dance_expression</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등 한국 민속무용 표현활동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Elementary Korean folk dance expression activity</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Bennett의 상호문화적 감수성 발달모델을 통한 초등 민속표현 제고 방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">우리나라 민속무용에 담긴 가치관과 민족성을 살펴보는 방안을 제시함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등 체육 표현영역의 한국 민속표현 활동으로 직접 제시됨</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:is_delivered_by_program rdf:resource="#program__elementary_intercultural_folk_expression_program"/>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__intercultural_sensitivity_improvement_folk_expression"/>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__cultural_difference_acceptance_improvement"/>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__multicultural_open_attitude_improvement"/>
