  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__gene_doping_ethics_education">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#ethics_education_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__gene_doping_ethics_education</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유전자 도핑 윤리교육</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유전자 도핑 윤리교육 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">gene doping ethics education</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gene doping ethics education program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유전자 도핑(Gene Doping)의 윤리적 쟁점과 대응방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유전자조작 기술과 스포츠윤리 쟁점 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유전자 도핑의 이익과 윤리문제를 세밀히 검토하고 통제를 위한 윤리적 근거가 필요함을 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">치료와 강화의 경계, 건강위험, 공정성, 롤모델 문제를 교육내용으로 다룰 수 있음.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__gene_doping_fairness_coercion_dignity_autonomy_case_material"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__gene_doping_detection_research_agenda"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__gene_doping_ethics_awareness_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__gene_doping_risk_awareness"/>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">gene doping ethics education</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing gene doping ethics education in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">gene doping ethics education</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">유전자 도핑 윤리교육</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__daily_living_fitness_improvement_elderly_women">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#functional_ability_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__daily_living_fitness_improvement_elderly_women</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성노인 일상생활체력 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">daily living fitness improvement in elderly women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성노인이 일상생활 수행에 필요한 근력, 유연성, 이동성을 개선하는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">탄력밴드를 이용한 저항성 운동과 균형 운동이 여성 노인의 신체구성과 일상생활체력에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">의자앉아일어서기, 2.44m 반환점되돌아앉기, 10m 보행 등이 향상됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v68_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">daily living fitness improvement in elderly women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">여성노인이 일상생활 수행에 필요한 근력, 유연성, 이동성을 개선하는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">daily living fitness improvement in elderly women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">여성노인 일상생활체력 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
