  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__fair_sport_trust_restoration">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#equity_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__fair_sport_trust_restoration</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">공정한 스포츠 신뢰 회복</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">restoration of trust in fair sport</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠의 페어플레이와 공정성에 대한 사회적 신뢰를 회복하는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자와 심판 비리 근절을 위한 법제도적 개선 방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비리행위는 스포츠에 대한 신뢰도를 추락시키고 근간을 흔든다고 지적하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">restoration of trust in fair sport</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">스포츠의 페어플레이와 공정성에 대한 사회적 신뢰를 회복하는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">restoration of trust in fair sport</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">공정한 스포츠 신뢰 회복</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__gene_doping_ethics_guideline">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#sport_policy"/>
