  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__korean_adult_sedentary_behavior_public_health_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#integrated_policy_context"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국 성인 좌식행동 공중보건 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean adult sedentary behavior public health context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국 성인의 신체활동 부족과 좌식행동 감소가 공중보건 정책 및 개입과 연결되는 참여 맥락</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Accelerometer-derived physical activity and sedentary behavior patterns among Korean adults</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_url rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.20463/pan.2023.0015</isp:source_url>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">25-26</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The study used 2014-2017 Korea National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey data with accelerometers to measure physical activity and sedentary behavior among 2,260 Korean adults. It highlights the need to promote physical activity and reduce sedentary behavior through public health policies and interventions.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:reflects_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__korean_adults_low_mvpa_high_sedentary_behavior"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__korean_adult_sedentary_behavior_public_health_context</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Korean adult sedentary behavior public health context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">한국 성인의 신체활동 부족과 좌식행동 감소가 공중보건 정책 및 개입과 연결되는 참여 맥락</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Korean adult sedentary behavior public health context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">한국 성인 좌식행동 공중보건 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__korean_adults_low_mvpa_high_sedentary_behavior"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__secondary_task_based_online_pe_class">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#online_remote_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__secondary_task_based_online_pe_class</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중등학교 과제수행 중심 온라인 체육수업</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">secondary task-based online physical education class</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성취기준 기반 과제를 제시하고 학생 업로드와 교사 피드백으로 운영되는 온라인 체육수업 유형.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">코로나 19 펜데믹 상황에서 중등학교 온라인 체육수업 사례 및 과제 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">과제 수행 중심 체육수업은 성취기준을 중심으로 과제를 제시하고 피드백을 제공함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v67_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__online_pe_feedback_task_structure"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__online_pe_value_realization"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">secondary task-based online physical education class</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">성취기준 기반 과제를 제시하고 학생 업로드와 교사 피드백으로 운영되는 온라인 체육수업 유형.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">secondary task-based online physical education class</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">중등학교 과제수행 중심 온라인 체육수업</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__online_antidoping_learning_platform">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_platform"/>
