  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__lifelong_sport_pedagogy_based_policy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#sport_policy"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__lifelong_sport_pedagogy_based_policy</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">평생체육 교육학 기반 정책</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">lifelong sport pedagogy-based policy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">생활체육을 평생체육교육으로 보고 학습자, 지도자, 교육과정을 체계화하는 정책 방향.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">평생체육 활성화를 위한 스포츠 교육학의 기여와 한계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">생활체육 정책에서 스포츠교육학의 학문적 노력이 필요하다고 강조하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">lifelong sport pedagogy-based policy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">생활체육을 평생체육교육으로 보고 학습자, 지도자, 교육과정을 체계화하는 정책 방향.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">lifelong sport pedagogy-based policy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">평생체육 교육학 기반 정책</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__disabled_esports_participation_expansion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__disabled_esports_participation_expansion</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인 e스포츠 참여 확대</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Expanded esports participation for people with disabilities</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인 e스포츠 활성화 방안 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">e스포츠가 장애인의 여가활동 제약을 완화하고 참여 기회를 제공할 수 있다고 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v58 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Expanded esports participation for people with disabilities</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Expanded esports participation for people with disabilities in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Expanded esports participation for people with disabilities</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애인 e스포츠 참여 확대</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__doping_reflexive_risk_discourse">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#sport_policy"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 성찰적 위험 담론</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Doping reflexive risk discourse</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑을 과학기술의 예기치 않은 결과와 위험의 관점에서 해석하는 스포츠윤리 정책 담론.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑(Doping)의 재해석: 울리히 벡의 성찰적 근대성을 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국시큐리티융합경영학회지</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 문제를 윤리적 의도보다 과학기술의 예기치 않은 결과와 성찰적 근대성의 위험으로 해석함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__doping_reflexive_risk_discourse</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:has_policy_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__doping_risk_reflexive_understanding"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Doping reflexive risk discourse</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">도핑을 과학기술의 예기치 않은 결과와 위험의 관점에서 해석하는 스포츠윤리 정책 담론.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Doping reflexive risk discourse</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">도핑 성찰적 위험 담론</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
