  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__obese_men_20s_resistance_training">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#young_adult"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__obese_men_20s_resistance_training</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">20대 비만 남성</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Obese men in their 20s</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저항성 운동 트레이닝이 20대 비만 남성의 신체구성, 아디포넥틴, C-반응성 단백질 및 호모시스테인에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">20대 비만 남성이 저항성 운동 트레이닝 집단과 통제 집단으로 구분되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Obese men in their 20s</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Obese men in their 20s in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Obese men in their 20s</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">20대 비만 남성</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__young_adult_quality_of_life_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#quality_of_life_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__young_adult_quality_of_life_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청년 삶의 질 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Quality of life improvement in young adults</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">동기적, 행동적 패턴이 사회적 고립감과 삶의 질에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">literature_curated_instance</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">동기적, 행동적 패턴이 사회적 고립감과 삶의 질에 미치는 영향</isp:source_identifier>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자율성, 수면 노력, 성별, 연령, BMI, 학력 등이 삶의 질과 관련됨을 보고함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated v33 instance from uploaded paper</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Quality of life improvement in young adults</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Quality of life improvement in young adults in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Quality of life improvement in young adults</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">청년 삶의 질 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__pediatric_insulin_sensitivity_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__pediatric_insulin_sensitivity_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">소아청소년 인슐린 감수성 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Improved insulin sensitivity in children and adolescents</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동 및 신체활동이 소아청소년 비알콜성 지방간 질환에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">소아청소년 NAFLD의 위험요인과 운동·신체활동의 예방 및 관리 효과를 검토하여 유산소, 저항성, 복합운동과 맞춤형 운동 프로토콜 개발 필요를 제시함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">소아청소년 NAFLD의 위험요인과 운동·신체활동의 예방 및 관리 효과를 검토하여 유산소, 저항성, 복합운동과 맞춤형 운동 프로토콜 개발 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved insulin sensitivity in children and adolescents</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">소아청소년 NAFLD의 위험요인과 운동·신체활동의 예방 및 관리 효과를 검토하여 유산소, 저항성, 복합운동과 맞춤형 운동 프로토콜 개발 필요를 제시함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved insulin sensitivity in children and adolescents</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">소아청소년 인슐린 감수성 개선</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__business_swimming_team_revitalization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__business_swimming_team_revitalization</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">실업팀 수영 활성화</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">business swimming team revitalization</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수영 실업팀 운영과 참여 기반이 활성화되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수영선수의 윤리의식 실태분석을 통한 실업팀 활성화방안 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수영선수 윤리의식 분석을 통해 실업팀 활성화방안을 제안함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">business swimming team revitalization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">수영 실업팀 운영과 참여 기반이 활성화되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">business swimming team revitalization</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">실업팀 수영 활성화</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
