  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__doping_intention_reduction_peer_climate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__doping_intention_reduction_peer_climate</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">또래 동기 분위기 기반 도핑의도 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  doping intention reduction peer climate</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 축구 선수가 인식하는 또래 동기 분위기와 스포츠 경쟁 성향 그리고 도핑 의도 간의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">남자 엘리트 축구선수 368명 연구에서 자아 중심 동기 분위기는 도핑 의도를 높이고, 협력 성향은 도핑 의도를 낮추는 보호 요인으로 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outcome  doping intention reduction peer climate</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing outcome  doping intention reduction peer climate in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outcome  doping intention reduction peer climate</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">또래 동기 분위기 기반 도핑의도 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__aquatic_exercise_knee_osteoarthritis">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#therapeutic_exercise"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__aquatic_exercise_knee_osteoarthritis</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">퇴행성관절염 수중운동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Aquatic exercise for knee osteoarthritis</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">퇴행성관절염 환자의 보행과 무릎 안정성 향상을 위해 적용된 수중운동 활동</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간의 수중운동프로그램이 퇴행성 관절염 환자의 보행에 미치는 영향: 사례연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무릎 퇴행성관절염을 가진 66세 여성 노인 1명이 12주간 주 3회, 회당 60분 수중운동 프로그램에 참여하였다. 프로그램 후 보행 능력과 무릎 안정성에 긍정적 변화가 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Aquatic exercise for knee osteoarthritis</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">퇴행성관절염 환자의 보행과 무릎 안정성 향상을 위해 적용된 수중운동 활동</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Aquatic exercise for knee osteoarthritis</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">퇴행성관절염 수중운동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__mci_multicomponent_exercise_intervention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__mci_multicomponent_exercise_intervention</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인 복합운동 중재 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">multicomponent exercise intervention for elderly with MCI</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인들을 대상으로 시행한 운동 중재 효과 크기 검증을 통한 운동프로그램 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동프로그램은 8~16주, 주 2~3회, 회당 50~60분으로 구성되었고, 유산소와 저항성 운동을 함께 사용하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_with_mild_cognitive_impairment"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__aerobic_resistance_combined_exercise_for_mci"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__structured_mci_exercise_session"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__mci_exercise_intensity_protocol"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__cognitive_impairment_progression_delay"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__mci_symptom_alleviation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">multicomponent exercise intervention for elderly with MCI</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing multicomponent exercise intervention for elderly with MCI in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">multicomponent exercise intervention for elderly with MCI</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">경도인지장애 노인 복합운동 중재 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_with_mild_cognitive_impairment"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__youth_winter_sport_program_satisfaction_improvement">
