  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__older_women_with_sleep_disorder_65plus">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#young_old"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__older_women_with_sleep_disorder_65plus</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수면장애를 경험하는 65세 이상 여성노인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Older women aged 65+ with sleep disorder</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">65세 이상 여성노인 중 수면장애와 정신적 스트레스 관련 중재의 대상이 되는 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">6주간의 이완프로그램이 여성노인의 수면장애, 정신적 스트레스 및 염증 지표에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">65세 이상 여성노인을 운동군과 대조군으로 나누고, 운동군은 6주 동안 주 3회, 회당 60분씩 이완프로그램을 실시하였다. 운동군에서 수면장애와 TNF-α가 유의하게 개선되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:applies_to_age_range rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">65 years or older</isp:applies_to_age_range>
    <isp:applies_to_gender rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">female</isp:applies_to_gender>
    <isp:applies_to_health_condition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sleep disorder; mental stress</isp:applies_to_health_condition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Older women aged 65+ with sleep disorder</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">65세 이상 여성노인 중 수면장애와 정신적 스트레스 관련 중재의 대상이 되는 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Older women aged 65+ with sleep disorder</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">수면장애를 경험하는 65세 이상 여성노인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__movement_expression_competence_v75">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_competence_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__movement_expression_competence_v75</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">움직임 표현 역량 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국춤에서 호흡의 의미와 움직임의 미</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2014</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">domestic_academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">호흡이 움직임과 내면 표현의 완성에 기여함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Movement Expression Competence</isp:pref_label_en>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Movement Expression Competence</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Movement Expression Competence in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Movement Expression Competence</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">움직임 표현 역량 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__school_type_sensitive_girls_pe_class_design">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_linked_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__school_type_sensitive_girls_pe_class_design</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교유형 반영 여학생 체육수업 설계</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program  school type sensitive girls pe class design</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여자 고등학생의 체육수업에 대한 재미거리와 걱정거리 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여자 고등학생 560명을 대상으로 학교 유형별 체육수업 재미거리와 걱정거리를 분석하고 여학생 수준에 맞춘 체육수업 설계 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__female_high_school_students_pe_fun_worry"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__girls_pe_fun_enhancement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__girls_pe_worry_reduction"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">program  school type sensitive girls pe class design</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing program  school type sensitive girls pe class design in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">program  school type sensitive girls pe class design</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학교유형 반영 여학생 체육수업 설계</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__female_high_school_students_pe_fun_worry"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__children_adolescents_obesity_prevention_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#child"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 예방·관리 지원이 필요한 아동·청소년</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Children and adolescents requiring obesity prevention and management support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국가 비만관리 정책에서 예방과 관리 강화가 우선 과제로 제시된 아동·청소년 대상 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analysis of public perception of national obesity management policy</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">27-35</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A national online survey of citizens aged 15-69 identified lifestyle improvement for obesity prevention, child and adolescent obesity prevention and management, community-based obesity and exercise clinics, and an integrated information platform for nutrition, diet, and physical activity as important national obesity policy tasks.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__children_adolescents_obesity_prevention_support</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Children and adolescents requiring obesity prevention and management support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국가 비만관리 정책에서 예방과 관리 강화가 우선 과제로 제시된 아동·청소년 대상 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Children and adolescents requiring obesity prevention and management support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">비만 예방·관리 지원이 필요한 아동·청소년</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__athletic_director_leadership_competency_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">애슬레틱 디렉터 리더십 역량 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Improved athletic director leadership competency</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Identifying Key Competencies of Superior Athletic Directors at Division Level: A Behavioral Event Interview Approach</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠조직 관리자가 성취지향성, 대인이해, 팀 리더십 등 핵심역량을 향상시키는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠조직 관리자가 성취지향성, 대인이해, 팀 리더십 등 핵심역량을 향상시키는 성과임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__athletic_director_leadership_competency_improvement</isp:entity_id>
