  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__middle_school_girls_pe_interest_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__middle_school_girls_pe_interest_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여중생 체육수업 관심·흥미 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improved PE interest and enthusiasm among middle school girls</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사의 긍정적 리더십을 통해 여중생의 체육수업 관심도와 흥미도가 향상되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육 교사의 리더십 유형이 여중생의 수업 참여도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">긍정적 보상형 리더십이 관심도, 흥미도에 긍정적 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improved PE interest and enthusiasm among middle school girls</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육교사의 긍정적 리더십을 통해 여중생의 체육수업 관심도와 흥미도가 향상되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">improved PE interest and enthusiasm among middle school girls</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">여중생 체육수업 관심·흥미 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__squat_deadlift_resistance_training">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#fitness_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__squat_deadlift_resistance_training</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스쿼트·데드리프트 저항운동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">squat and deadlift resistance training</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">하체, 엉덩이, 몸통 근육을 동시에 활용하는 대표적 웨이트 트레이닝 활동</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스쿼트와 데드리프트 연구 동향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2010~2020년 국내외 스쿼트·데드리프트 자세 관련 연구 25편을 수집하여 신체 변화, 기능 개선, 성장력, 미래지향적 기술개발 유형으로 연구동향을 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:has_activity_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__safe_resistance_training_practice_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">squat and deadlift resistance training</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">하체, 엉덩이, 몸통 근육을 동시에 활용하는 대표적 웨이트 트레이닝 활동</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">squat and deadlift resistance training</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스쿼트·데드리프트 저항운동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
