  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__athletes_vaccination_guideline">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__athletes_vaccination_guideline</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">예방접종 관리 대상 운동선수</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Athletes targeted by vaccination guidance</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수들을 위한 예방접종 근거와 추천</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수와 지도자, 팀닥터, 가족의 건강을 고려한 예방접종 필요성과 국제대회·훈련 환경에 따른 백신 가이드라인 수립 필요를 제시함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수와 지도자, 팀닥터, 가족의 건강을 고려한 예방접종 필요성과 국제대회·훈련 환경에 따른 백신 가이드라인 수립 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Sports Medicine</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Athletes targeted by vaccination guidance</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">운동선수와 지도자, 팀닥터, 가족의 건강을 고려한 예방접종 필요성과 국제대회·훈련 환경에 따른 백신 가이드라인 수립 필요를 제시함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Athletes targeted by vaccination guidance</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">예방접종 관리 대상 운동선수</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__fan_based_esg_evaluation_indicators">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#evaluation_tool"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#support_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__fan_based_esg_evaluation_indicators</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">팬 인식 기반 ESG 평가지표</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">fan-perception-based ESG evaluation indicators</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프로스포츠 구단의 환경, 사회, 지배구조 실천을 팬 관점에서 평가하는 지표 자원.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">팬 인식기반 프로스포츠 구단 ESG 평가 지표 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">환경 4개, 사회 6개, 지배구조 4개로 구성된 ESG 평가지표를 확정하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">fan-perception-based ESG evaluation indicators</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">프로스포츠 구단의 환경, 사회, 지배구조 실천을 팬 관점에서 평가하는 지표 자원.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">fan-perception-based ESG evaluation indicators</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">팬 인식 기반 ESG 평가지표</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__preschool_children_complex_exercise">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#preschool_child"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__preschool_children_complex_exercise</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">복합운동 참여 유아</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Preschool children participating in complex exercise</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간 복합운동 프로그램에 참여한 유아 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간 복합운동 프로그램이 유아의 기초체력에 미치는 효과</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2008</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Exercise Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유아 230명을 대상으로 실험집단과 통제집단으로 구분하여 12주간 복합운동 프로그램을 적용하였다. 사전·사후 측정 결과, 근지구력, 유연성, 순발력, 민첩성, 평형성 등 기초체력과 운동기능에서 긍정적 향상이 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:applies_to_age_range rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">preschool child</isp:applies_to_age_range>
    <isp:sample_size rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">230</isp:sample_size>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Preschool children participating in complex exercise</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">12주간 복합운동 프로그램에 참여한 유아 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Preschool children participating in complex exercise</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">복합운동 참여 유아</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__dance_policy_arts_education_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#community_based_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__dance_policy_arts_education_program</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무용 기반 문화예술교육 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">dance-based culture and arts education program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무용이 학교 문화예술교육과 삶 속 건전한 여가문화를 위한 문화예술교육 기능을 수행함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">토픽 모델링을 활용한 무용의 정책적 기능 및 현황 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무용이 학교 문화예술교육과 삶 속 건전한 여가문화를 위한 문화예술교육 기능을 수행함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v69_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">dance-based culture and arts education program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">무용이 학교 문화예술교육과 삶 속 건전한 여가문화를 위한 문화예술교육 기능을 수행함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">dance-based culture and arts education program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">무용 기반 문화예술교육 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__elementary_step_count_pa_promotion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_linked_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__elementary_step_count_pa_promotion</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생 걸음수 기반 신체활동 증진 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Elementary step count-based physical activity promotion program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생의 걸음수와 신체활동 수준을 점검하고 일상적 이동활동을 늘리도록 지원하는 학교 연계 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Association between daily step counts and physical activity level among Korean elementary schoolchildren</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Exercise Nutrition and Biochemistry</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">51-55</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Children aged 9 to 12 years from two urban Korean elementary schools were measured for total energy expenditure with doubly labeled water and step counts with accelerometers. Steps per day were positively associated with physical activity level among all subjects and in boys, and the authors concluded that locomotor activity contributed to physical activity level differences among elementary school boys.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__korean_elementary_schoolchildren_pa_monitoring"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__elementary_daily_step_locomotor_activity"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__urban_elementary_free_living_pa_context"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__accelerometer_step_count_monitoring"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__elementary_physical_activity_level_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Elementary step count-based physical activity promotion program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">초등학생의 걸음수와 신체활동 수준을 점검하고 일상적 이동활동을 늘리도록 지원하는 학교 연계 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Elementary step count-based physical activity promotion program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">초등학생 걸음수 기반 신체활동 증진 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__korean_elementary_schoolchildren_pa_monitoring"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__disability_sport_empowerment">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_integration_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__disability_sport_empowerment</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인스포츠 임파워먼트</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Empowerment through disability sport</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인스포츠의 주요 관점과 가치 논제에 대한 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2012</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">임파워먼트 원리는 장애인스포츠의 주요 가치 관점 중 하나로 검토되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v58 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Empowerment through disability sport</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Empowerment through disability sport in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Empowerment through disability sport</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애인스포츠 임파워먼트</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__girls_exercise_self_efficacy_resilience_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#self_efficacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__girls_exercise_self_efficacy_resilience_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여학생 운동자기효능감과 회복탄력성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  girls exercise self efficacy resilience improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여자 고등학생의 운동행동변화단계에 따른 운동제약요인 및 운동자기효능감과 회복탄력성 비교</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여자 고등학생 330명을 대상으로 운동행동변화단계별 운동제약요인, 운동자기효능감, 회복탄력성 차이를 분석하고 단계별 체육교육 전략 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outcome  girls exercise self efficacy resilience improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing outcome  girls exercise self efficacy resilience improvement in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outcome  girls exercise self efficacy resilience improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">여학생 운동자기효능감과 회복탄력성 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__aid_fall_frequency_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__aid_fall_frequency_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지적장애인 낙상 빈도 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">reduced fall frequency in aging intellectual disability</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고령화된 지적장애인의 성공적 노화를 위한 운동 중재의 체계적 문헌 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013~2023년 고령화된 지적장애인 운동중재 연구를 PICO 방식으로 고찰하였고, 심리운동, 승마운동, 낙상예방 복합운동, 보행운동, 건강행동 증진 프로그램에서 심리사회, 체력, 보행, 낙상, 균형, 이동성, 신체활동 수준의 긍정적 변화를 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고령화된 지적장애인에게 낙상예방 운동중재가 적용될 때 낙상 위험 또는 빈도 감소와 연결되는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">reduced fall frequency in aging intellectual disability</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">고령화된 지적장애인에게 낙상예방 운동중재가 적용될 때 낙상 위험 또는 빈도 감소와 연결되는 성과임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">reduced fall frequency in aging intellectual disability</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">지적장애인 낙상 빈도 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__youth_jogging_stress_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#mental_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__youth_jogging_stress_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 조깅 스트레스 완화</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Stress reduction through youth jogging</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">공원 조깅 경험을 통해 청소년의 부정적 사고와 스트레스가 완화되는 정신건강 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An Empirical Phenomenological Study of Youths’ Experiences Jogging in Singapore Parks</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1-16</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Six youth joggers aged 17-19 discussed experiences of jogging in Singapore parks; park jogging elicited positive experiences, reduced negative thoughts and stress, promoted well-being, sense of belonging, personal growth, and academic performance.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <isp:reflects_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__singapore_youth_park_joggers"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Stress reduction through youth jogging</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">공원 조깅 경험을 통해 청소년의 부정적 사고와 스트레스가 완화되는 정신건강 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Stress reduction through youth jogging</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">청소년 조깅 스트레스 완화</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__singapore_youth_park_joggers"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__sport_university_anti_doping_education_v75">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#safety_risk_management_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__sport_university_anti_doping_education_v75</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육대학 반도핑 교육 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국체육대학교 학생들의 도핑에 대한 지식, 믿음 및 성향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">domestic_academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육대학교 학생들의 도핑 지식, 믿음, 성향을 분석하여 반도핑 교육 자료로 제시함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__sport_university_students_v75"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__peas_korean_doping_attitude_survey_v75"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__anti_doping_knowledge_improvement_v75"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#context__sport_university_doping_awareness_v75"/>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sport University Anti Doping Education</isp:pref_label_en>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sport University Anti Doping Education</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Sport University Anti Doping Education in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Sport University Anti Doping Education</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육대학 반도핑 교육 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__sport_university_students_v75"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__adolescent_health_risk_behavior_cluster">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__adolescent_health_risk_behavior_cluster</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 건강위험행동 군집 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">adolescent clustered health-risk behavior context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">약물사용, 음주, 흡연, 식습관, 스트레스, 불안 등 건강위험행동이 복합적으로 나타나는 맥락.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년의 약물사용 경험과 신체 활동 및 건강 관련 행태와의 관련성 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">약물사용 경험이 있는 청소년은 음주 및 흡연 경험이 높고 스트레스를 많이 느끼며 범불안장애 위험이 높았다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">adolescent clustered health-risk behavior context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">약물사용, 음주, 흡연, 식습관, 스트레스, 불안 등 건강위험행동이 복합적으로 나타나는 맥락.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">adolescent clustered health-risk behavior context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">청소년 건강위험행동 군집 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
