  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__lifestyle_improvement_for_obesity_prevention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 예방을 위한 생활습관 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lifestyle improvement for obesity prevention</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 예방을 위해 신체활동, 식생활, 건강행동을 개선하는 신체건강 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analysis of public perception of national obesity management policy</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">27-35</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A national online survey of citizens aged 15-69 identified lifestyle improvement for obesity prevention, child and adolescent obesity prevention and management, community-based obesity and exercise clinics, and an integrated information platform for nutrition, diet, and physical activity as important national obesity policy tasks.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__lifestyle_improvement_for_obesity_prevention</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Lifestyle improvement for obesity prevention</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">비만 예방을 위해 신체활동, 식생활, 건강행동을 개선하는 신체건강 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Lifestyle improvement for obesity prevention</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">비만 예방을 위한 생활습관 개선</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__children_adolescents_nafld">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#adolescent"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__children_adolescents_nafld</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비알코올성 지방간 위험 소아청소년</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Children and adolescents at risk of NAFLD</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동 및 신체활동이 소아청소년 비알콜성 지방간 질환에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">소아청소년 NAFLD의 위험요인과 운동·신체활동의 예방 및 관리 효과를 검토하여 유산소, 저항성, 복합운동과 맞춤형 운동 프로토콜 개발 필요를 제시함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">소아청소년 NAFLD의 위험요인과 운동·신체활동의 예방 및 관리 효과를 검토하여 유산소, 저항성, 복합운동과 맞춤형 운동 프로토콜 개발 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Children and adolescents at risk of NAFLD</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">소아청소년 NAFLD의 위험요인과 운동·신체활동의 예방 및 관리 효과를 검토하여 유산소, 저항성, 복합운동과 맞춤형 운동 프로토콜 개발 필요를 제시함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Children and adolescents at risk of NAFLD</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">비알코올성 지방간 위험 소아청소년</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__udl_inclusive_pe_guidance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UDL 기반 통합체육 지도지침</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UDL-based inclusive PE guidance</isp:pref_label_en>
