  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__obese_men_body_composition_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__obese_men_body_composition_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 남성 신체구성 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Body composition improvement among obese men</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저항성 운동 트레이닝이 20대 비만 남성의 신체구성, 아디포넥틴, C-반응성 단백질 및 호모시스테인에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">13주 저항성 운동이 20대 비만 남성의 신체구성 개선에 긍정적 영향을 미친 것으로 결론지었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:reflects_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__obese_men_20s_resistance_training"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Body composition improvement among obese men</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Body composition improvement among obese men in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Body composition improvement among obese men</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">비만 남성 신체구성 개선</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__obese_men_20s_resistance_training"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__baseball_club_communication_activation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#continuity_retention_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__baseball_club_communication_activation</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">야구동호회 커뮤니케이션 활성화 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">baseball club communication activation program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회인 야구동호회의 건강한 운영과 지속 발전을 위해 다양한 커뮤니케이션 채널을 활용하는 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">야구동호회의 커뮤니케이션이 응집력 및 팀 만족도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회인 야구동호회 회원 331명을 조사한 결과, 사회적 커뮤니케이션은 팀 응집력에, 환경적 커뮤니케이션은 팀 만족도에 긍정적 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__baseball_club_members_communication"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__baseball_club_communication_channels"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__baseball_club_team_cohesion_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__baseball_club_team_satisfaction_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">baseball club communication activation program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사회인 야구동호회의 건강한 운영과 지속 발전을 위해 다양한 커뮤니케이션 채널을 활용하는 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">baseball club communication activation program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">야구동호회 커뮤니케이션 활성화 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__baseball_club_members_communication"/>
  </rdf:Description>
