  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__adult_taekwondo_participants">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__adult_taekwondo_participants</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성인 태권도 참여자</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">adult taekwondo participants</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성인부 태권도 프로그램의 주요 참여 대상이 되는 성인 수련자 집단.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지도자가 인식하는 성인부 태권도 운영 활성화 방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성인 태권도 운영 지도자들이 성인부 활성화 방안을 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">adult taekwondo participants</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">성인부 태권도 프로그램의 주요 참여 대상이 되는 성인 수련자 집단.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">adult taekwondo participants</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">성인 태권도 참여자</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__breast_cancer_shoulder_rehabilitation_protocol">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__breast_cancer_shoulder_rehabilitation_protocol</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유방암 수술 후 어깨재활 지침</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">breast cancer postoperative shoulder rehabilitation protocol</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유방암 환자의 수술 후 어깨 재활 운동 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">어깨관절 기능운동 후 근력강화운동을 시행하는 운동프로그램 순서를 제안함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">breast cancer postoperative shoulder rehabilitation protocol</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing breast cancer postoperative shoulder rehabilitation protocol in the support_resource dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">breast cancer postoperative shoulder rehabilitation protocol</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">유방암 수술 후 어깨재활 지침</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__sport_major_career_decision_attitude_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육계열 진로결정태도 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improvement of career decision attitude in sport-related majors</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육계열 대학생들의 학업적 자기효능감과 전공만족도 및 진로결정태도의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">전공만족도는 진로결정태도에 유의한 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__sport_major_career_decision_attitude_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improvement of career decision attitude in sport-related majors</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing improvement of career decision attitude in sport-related majors in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
