  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__athlete_positive_psychological_capital_framework">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#information_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__athlete_positive_psychological_capital_framework</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수 긍정심리자본 구성요인 프레임워크</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Construct framework of positive psychological capital in athletes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수 긍정심리자본 구성개념 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수 18명의 포커스그룹 인터뷰를 통해 자기효능감, 낙관주의, 희망, 탄력성, 정신력, 심리기술 등 운동선수 긍정심리자본 구성요인을 도출함.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수 18명의 포커스그룹 인터뷰를 통해 자기효능감, 낙관주의, 희망, 탄력성, 정신력, 심리기술 등 운동선수 긍정심리자본 구성요인을 도출함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Construct framework of positive psychological capital in athletes</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">운동선수 18명의 포커스그룹 인터뷰를 통해 자기효능감, 낙관주의, 희망, 탄력성, 정신력, 심리기술 등 운동선수 긍정심리자본 구성요인을 도출함.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Construct framework of positive psychological capital in athletes</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">운동선수 긍정심리자본 구성요인 프레임워크</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__post_covid_cardiopulmonary_fitness_assessment">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__post_covid_cardiopulmonary_fitness_assessment</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">코로나 후유증 심폐체력 평가 정확성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improved cardiopulmonary fitness assessment for post-COVID condition</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">코로나 후유증 대상자의 심폐체력 저하와 증상을 검사 프로토콜에 따라 더 적합하게 평가하는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">포스트코로나 시대의 심폐운동검사 프로토콜 제언</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">코로나 후유증 대상자에게 적합한 새로운 심폐운동검사 프로토콜 개발 필요를 제안하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improved cardiopulmonary fitness assessment for post-COVID condition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">코로나 후유증 대상자의 심폐체력 저하와 증상을 검사 프로토콜에 따라 더 적합하게 평가하는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">improved cardiopulmonary fitness assessment for post-COVID condition</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">코로나 후유증 심폐체력 평가 정확성 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
