  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__obese_middle_aged_women_physical_fitness_improvement_combined_exercise_16w">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_competence_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__obese_middle_aged_women_physical_fitness_improvement_combined_exercise_16w</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중년 비만 여성 체력 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical fitness improvement in middle-aged obese women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">16주 복합운동 후 중년 비만 여성의 근력과 심폐지구력이 유의하게 개선된 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">16주간의 복합운동과 체중 감량이 중년 비만 여성의 체력과 전염증성 대식세포에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중년 비만 여성을 네 집단으로 무선할당하고, 운동 집단은 16주간 중강도 저항성운동과 유산소운동을 수행하였다. 운동 집단에서 신체구성, 근력, 심폐지구력, 전염증성 대식세포 지표가 유의하게 개선되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Physical fitness improvement in middle-aged obese women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">16주 복합운동 후 중년 비만 여성의 근력과 심폐지구력이 유의하게 개선된 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Physical fitness improvement in middle-aged obese women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">중년 비만 여성 체력 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__tchoukball_school_pe">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_sport"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__tchoukball_school_pe</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교체육 츄크볼</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Tchoukball in school physical education</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">위드코로나 이후 재개된 학교체육수업에서 츄크볼이 과체중 아동의 신체구성, 혈압, 조직의 산소포화도 및 체력에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교 체육수업에서 6주간 주 3회 45분 츄크볼 운동을 실시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v52 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tchoukball in school physical education</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Tchoukball in school physical education in the sport_activity dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Tchoukball in school physical education</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학교체육 츄크볼</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
