  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__pe_teacher_and_sport_instructor">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사와 스포츠강사</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">physical education teachers and sport instructors</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사와 스포츠강사의 업무시간과 효능감에 따른 직무탈진 경험</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 74명과 스포츠강사 55명을 대상으로 직무탈진과 효능감을 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__pe_teacher_and_sport_instructor</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">physical education teachers and sport instructors</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing physical education teachers and sport instructors in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">physical education teachers and sport instructors</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육교사와 스포츠강사</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__elderly_cognitive_function_improvement_exergame">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#mental_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__elderly_cognitive_function_improvement_exergame</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인 인지기능 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">elderly cognitive function improvement through exergame</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엑서게임 중재를 통해 노인의 인지기능이 개선되는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엑서게임(exergame)이 노인의 인지기능에 미치는 효과: 체계적 문헌고찰 및 메타분석적 접근</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무작위통제실험 연구를 메타분석한 결과, 중강도 이상, 회당 30분 이상, 주 3회, 8주 이상 엑서게임 참여가 노인의 인지기능 개선에 효율적이었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">elderly cognitive function improvement through exergame</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">엑서게임 중재를 통해 노인의 인지기능이 개선되는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">elderly cognitive function improvement through exergame</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">노인 인지기능 개선</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="N86fe1ab464a94626abbe6051b531b3b5"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="N2fbf0fb70fa14f3ebf2af5a308bb490a"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="N646cc04f9b2f4011ad9ea59973748cdf"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="Nee34d8f5360a489faa6d2cfb26b83b51"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#ontology_entity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Participation Context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A situational, institutional, spatial, temporal, access, or participation-mode condition in which sport participation occurs.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A situational, institutional, spatial, temporal, access, or participation-mode condition in which sport participation occurs.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__structured_mci_exercise_session">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_frequency_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__structured_mci_exercise_session</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인 구조화 운동 세션</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">structured MCI exercise session</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인들을 대상으로 시행한 운동 중재 효과 크기 검증을 통한 운동프로그램 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동프로그램은 8~16주, 주 2~3회, 회당 50~60분으로 구성되었고, 유산소와 저항성 운동을 함께 사용하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">structured MCI exercise session</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing structured MCI exercise session in the participation_context dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">structured MCI exercise session</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">경도인지장애 노인 구조화 운동 세션</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__professional_sport_club_esg_management">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#sport_policy"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__professional_sport_club_esg_management</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프로스포츠 구단 ESG 경영 정책</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">professional sport club ESG management policy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프로스포츠 구단의 환경, 사회, 지배구조 책임을 팬 인식 기반 지표로 평가하고 관리하는 정책.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">팬 인식기반 프로스포츠 구단 ESG 평가 지표 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프로스포츠 구단 ESG 경영을 팬 관점에서 측정할 수 있는 14개 지표를 도출하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">professional sport club ESG management policy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">프로스포츠 구단의 환경, 사회, 지배구조 책임을 팬 인식 기반 지표로 평가하고 관리하는 정책.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">professional sport club ESG management policy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">프로스포츠 구단 ESG 경영 정책</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__mixed_martial_arts_club_members">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">종합격투기 동호인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Mixed martial arts club members</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">생활체육 형태로 종합격투기에 참여하는 동호인 집단.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">종합격투기 동호인들의 참여경험에 관한 내러티브 탐구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">종합격투기에 참여하는 6명의 동호인을 대상으로 참여경험을 내러티브로 분석함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">확실하게 문헌 내용에서 확인 가능한 요소만 제한 반영함.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__mixed_martial_arts_club_members</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Mixed martial arts club members</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">생활체육 형태로 종합격투기에 참여하는 동호인 집단.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Mixed martial arts club members</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">종합격투기 동호인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__sand_surface_exercise_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#spatial_context"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__sand_surface_exercise_context</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">모래지면 운동 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sand surface exercise context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">일반 지면보다 충격 흡수와 고유수용성 자극을 제공하는 모래지면 운동 환경</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">모래지면 운동프로그램이 여성노인의 균형능력, 근활성도 및 염증인자에 미치는 효과</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">sand surface exercise context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">일반 지면보다 충격 흡수와 고유수용성 자극을 제공하는 모래지면 운동 환경</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">sand surface exercise context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">모래지면 운동 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
