  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__infection_risk_management_in_sport_facility">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__infection_risk_management_in_sport_facility</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠시설 감염위험 관리</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">infection risk management in sport facility</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠시설 운영에서 감염위험을 낮추고 안전한 참여환경을 유지하는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">코로나-19 확산 방지를 위한 태권도장 방역지침 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">태권도장의 코로나19 대응을 위한 실효성 있는 방역지침 마련 필요를 제시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v68_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">infection risk management in sport facility</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">스포츠시설 운영에서 감염위험을 낮추고 안전한 참여환경을 유지하는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">infection risk management in sport facility</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠시설 감염위험 관리</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__anti_doping_awareness_reinforcement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__anti_doping_awareness_reinforcement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">반도핑 인식 강화</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Anti-doping awareness reinforcement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수의 도핑방지에 관한 엘리트스포츠 지도자의 제어전략</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑에 대한 강한 개념과 지도신념을 통해 선수의 도핑 인식을 강화할 필요가 제시되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
