  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__sport_specific_doping_management_manual">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__sport_specific_doping_management_manual</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">종목별 도핑관리 매뉴얼</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support resource  sport specific doping management manual</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트선수의 인식을 통해 살펴본 도핑관리시스템의 문제</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 선수 인식 연구에서 대표선수 중심 도핑관리, 형식적 교육, 행정적 한계가 지적되었고 학생선수 중심 예방교육, 종목별 매뉴얼, 전담인력, 협력 거버넌스가 대안으로 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">support resource  sport specific doping management manual</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing support resource  sport specific doping management manual in the support_resource dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">support resource  sport specific doping management manual</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">종목별 도핑관리 매뉴얼</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__career_maturity_improvement_school_sport_competition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__career_maturity_improvement_school_sport_competition</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교스포츠클럽 대회 진로성숙도 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">career maturity improvement through school sports club competitions</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교스포츠클럽 대회 참여를 통해 진로에 대한 태도와 준비행동이 향상되는 역량 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학생의 학교스포츠클럽 대회 참여가 진로성숙도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교스포츠클럽 대회 참여 집단과 미참여 집단은 진로성숙도 하위요인에서 유의미한 차이를 나타냈다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">career maturity improvement through school sports club competitions</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학교스포츠클럽 대회 참여를 통해 진로에 대한 태도와 준비행동이 향상되는 역량 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">career maturity improvement through school sports club competitions</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학교스포츠클럽 대회 진로성숙도 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
