    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저소득층 폐경기 여성의 비만에 따른 대사적 건강상태와 신체활동 및 좌식행동과의 관련성</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사회경제적 조건이 취약한 폐경기 여성의 신체활동과 좌식행동, 건강상태 관련성이 분석되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Health equity context for low-income women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Health equity context for low-income women in the participation_context dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Health equity context for low-income women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">저소득층 여성 건강형평성 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
