  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__youth_physical_activity_nutrition_improvement_need_identification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#system_level_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__youth_physical_activity_nutrition_improvement_need_identification</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 신체활동·영양 개선 필요 식별</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Identification of youth physical activity and nutrition improvement needs</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fitness Index on Physical Fitness, Obesity and Dietary Intake of Youths in Singapore</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년이 더 많은 신체활동과 운동에 참여하고 영양섭취를 개선해야 한다고 제언함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">청소년 건강증진을 위한 신체활동 및 식이 지원 필요가 정책·교육 차원에서 확인되는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Identification of youth physical activity and nutrition improvement needs</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">청소년 건강증진을 위한 신체활동 및 식이 지원 필요가 정책·교육 차원에서 확인되는 성과임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Identification of youth physical activity and nutrition improvement needs</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">청소년 신체활동·영양 개선 필요 식별</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__athletic_ability_belief_psychological_skill_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__athletic_ability_belief_psychological_skill_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동능력믿음 기반 심리지원 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program  athletic ability belief psychological skill support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 운동선수들의 운동능력믿음이 승부근성과 선수만족에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 선수 447명 연구에서 운동능력믿음이 승부근성과 선수만족에 유의한 영향을 미치고, 승부근성도 선수만족에 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타남.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__tenacity_strengthening_elite_athletes"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__athlete_satisfaction_improvement_ability_belief"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">program  athletic ability belief psychological skill support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing program  athletic ability belief psychological skill support in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">program  athletic ability belief psychological skill support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">운동능력믿음 기반 심리지원 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#fall_prevention_exercise">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#elderly_sport"/>
