    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Improved physical competence of local child center students in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved physical competence of local child center students</skos:prefLabel>
