  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__cognitive_gait_adaptability_task_protocol">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#guideline_manual"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">인지 요구 보행 적응성 과제 프로토콜</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cognitive gait adaptability task protocol</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인의 자발적 보행 적응성을 측정하기 위해 사용되는 장애물 회피, 측방 보행 조정, 스테핑 과제 등의 평가 절차 자료</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A scoping review of voluntary gait adaptability tasks requiring cognitive demands in older adults</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_url rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.20463/pan.2023.0004</isp:source_url>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">30-31</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Older adults often suffer from walking problems including reduced adaptability to environmental changes and hazards, which can increase fall risk. The review identified voluntary gait adaptability tasks requiring cognitive demands while walking.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__cognitive_gait_adaptability_task_protocol</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cognitive gait adaptability task protocol</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">노인의 자발적 보행 적응성을 측정하기 위해 사용되는 장애물 회피, 측방 보행 조정, 스테핑 과제 등의 평가 절차 자료</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Cognitive gait adaptability task protocol</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">인지 요구 보행 적응성 과제 프로토콜</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__online_practice_based_pe_assessment_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#service_delivery_efficiency"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__online_practice_based_pe_assessment_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">온라인 실기체육 평가 효율성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improved assessment efficiency in online practice-based PE</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AI 평가 기반 온라인 실기 수업에서 평가와 학습관리의 효율성이 개선되는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">에듀테크 기반 비대면 K-Dance 수업 프로그램 개발 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">온라인 실습 기반 체육수업에서 AI 평가와 TMS 연동, 백워드 설계, 마이크로러닝 콘텐츠를 활용한 비대면 K-Dance 수업 프로그램을 개발하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improved assessment efficiency in online practice-based PE</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">AI 평가 기반 온라인 실기 수업에서 평가와 학습관리의 효율성이 개선되는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">improved assessment efficiency in online practice-based PE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">온라인 실기체육 평가 효율성 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
