  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__child_youth_pa_health_benefit_awareness">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__child_youth_pa_health_benefit_awareness</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">어린이·청소년 신체활동 건강유익성 인식 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Improved awareness of health benefits of physical activity for children and adolescents</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A Global Perspective on COVID-19 and Decreased Physical Activity in Children and Adolescents</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체활동의 신체적·심리정서적 건강 유익성에 대한 이해를 높여야 한다고 제시함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">어린이·청소년과 정책 관계자의 신체활동 건강유익성 인식이 향상되는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved awareness of health benefits of physical activity for children and adolescents</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">어린이·청소년과 정책 관계자의 신체활동 건강유익성 인식이 향상되는 성과임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved awareness of health benefits of physical activity for children and adolescents</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">어린이·청소년 신체활동 건강유익성 인식 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__doping_management_system_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#policy_effectiveness_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__doping_management_system_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑관리시스템 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  doping management system improvement</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트선수의 인식을 통해 살펴본 도핑관리시스템의 문제</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2017</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 선수 인식 연구에서 대표선수 중심 도핑관리, 형식적 교육, 행정적 한계가 지적되었고 학생선수 중심 예방교육, 종목별 매뉴얼, 전담인력, 협력 거버넌스가 대안으로 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outcome  doping management system improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing outcome  doping management system improvement in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outcome  doping management system improvement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">도핑관리시스템 개선</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__athlete_supplement_safety_policy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#sport_policy"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">선수 영양보충제 안전 정책</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Athlete supplement safety policy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Nutritional Supplement for Athletic Performance: Based on Australian Institute of Sport Sports Supplement Framework</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Exercise Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">영양보충제의 과학적 근거, 안전성, 합법성, 도핑 위험을 고려하여 선수의 보충제 사용을 관리하는 스포츠정책 인스턴스임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">영양보충제의 과학적 근거, 안전성, 합법성, 도핑 위험을 고려하여 선수의 보충제 사용을 관리하는 스포츠정책 인스턴스임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
