    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스마트폰 영상 피드백 앱</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__middle_school_pe_positive_class_attitude_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__middle_school_pe_positive_class_attitude_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학생 체육수업 태도 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improved middle school PE class attitude</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">행복감이 건강과 체력, 긍정적 정서, 능동적 참여와 수행, 대인관계 태도에 영향을 주는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 학교유형에 따른 체육수업에 대한 행복감과 수업태도의 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육수업에서 행복감이 수업태도 모든 하위요인에 영향력을 미치는 것으로 밝혀졌다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improved middle school PE class attitude</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">행복감이 건강과 체력, 긍정적 정서, 능동적 참여와 수행, 대인관계 태도에 영향을 주는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">improved middle school PE class attitude</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">중학생 체육수업 태도 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__school_student_neck_back_pain_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생 목·어깨·허리 통증 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reduced neck, shoulder, and back pain among students</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">가방 하중과 관련된 근골격계 통증을 줄이는 신체건강 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analytical parameters to check association between load carriage system and bag packs-influenced musculoskeletal complications among school going students: a scoping review</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">review_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">20-26</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The scoping review found that backpack load and load-carriage systems among school-going students were associated with lower back, shoulder, and neck pain and postural abnormalities, and recommended broader evaluation and preventive approaches.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__school_student_neck_back_pain_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Reduced neck, shoulder, and back pain among students</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">가방 하중과 관련된 근골격계 통증을 줄이는 신체건강 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Reduced neck, shoulder, and back pain among students</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학생 목·어깨·허리 통증 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__middle_school_pe_backward_class_context">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_institution"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 백워드 체육수업 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Middle school backward-model PE context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 체육수업 안에서 백워드 교육모형이 적용되는 학교 기반 참여 맥락.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">백워드 교육모형을 적용한 체육 수업이 중학생들의 체육수업만족도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중학교 학생을 대상으로 성별·학년·집단별 체육수업만족도를 비교함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__middle_school_pe_backward_class_context</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Middle school backward-model PE context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">중학교 체육수업 안에서 백워드 교육모형이 적용되는 학교 기반 참여 맥락.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Middle school backward-model PE context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">중학교 백워드 체육수업 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__korean_adult_men_abdominal_obesity_pa_management">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__korean_adult_men_abdominal_obesity_pa_management</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체활동 관리가 필요한 한국 성인 남성 복부비만 집단</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean adult men with abdominal obesity requiring physical activity management</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Changes in physical activity and energy intake according to abdominal obesity in Korean adult men before and after COVID-19: Data from 2019 and 2020 Korea National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (KNHANES)</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학술논문</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019년과 2020년 KNHANES 성인 남성 자료를 분석함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국 성인 남성의 복부비만과 신체활동 관리 필요성이 직접 제시됨</isp:definition_text>
