  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__positive_reinforcement_pe_teacher_leadership">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#support_resource"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__positive_reinforcement_pe_teacher_leadership</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">긍정적 보상형 체육교사 리더십</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">positive reinforcement PE teacher leadership</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여중생의 체육수업 관심도, 흥미도, 수업태도를 높이는 체육교사 리더십 자원.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육 교사의 리더십 유형이 여중생의 수업 참여도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">긍정적 보상형 리더십이 여중생의 관심도, 흥미도, 수업태도에 긍정적 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">positive reinforcement PE teacher leadership</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">여중생의 체육수업 관심도, 흥미도, 수업태도를 높이는 체육교사 리더십 자원.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">positive reinforcement PE teacher leadership</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">긍정적 보상형 체육교사 리더십</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__college_pe_exercise_maintenance_increase">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_continuity"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__college_pe_exercise_maintenance_increase</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">college PE exercise maintenance increase</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">교양체육 운동지속 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">교양체육 지도자 전문성이 긍정적 감정, 스포츠태도, 운동지속 및 수업추천에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">교수자 전문성의 모든 요인이 운동지속에 영향을 미침</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated v27 instance from uploaded paper</isp:note>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">literature_curated_instance</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">교양체육 지도자 전문성이 긍정적 감정, 스포츠태도, 운동지속 및 수업추천에 미치는 영향</isp:source_identifier>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">college PE exercise maintenance increase</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing college PE exercise maintenance increase in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">college PE exercise maintenance increase</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">교양체육 운동지속 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__accelerometer_step_count_monitoring">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#digital_device"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__accelerometer_step_count_monitoring</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">가속도계 기반 걸음수 모니터링</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Accelerometer-based step count monitoring</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학생의 일일 걸음수와 신체활동 수준을 객관적으로 측정하기 위한 착용형 디지털 측정 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Association between daily step counts and physical activity level among Korean elementary schoolchildren</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Exercise Nutrition and Biochemistry</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">51-55</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Children aged 9 to 12 years from two urban Korean elementary schools were measured for total energy expenditure with doubly labeled water and step counts with accelerometers. Steps per day were positively associated with physical activity level among all subjects and in boys, and the authors concluded that locomotor activity contributed to physical activity level differences among elementary school boys.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Accelerometer-based step count monitoring</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">초등학생의 일일 걸음수와 신체활동 수준을 객관적으로 측정하기 위한 착용형 디지털 측정 자원</rdfs:comment>
