    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지역 스포츠시설을 이용하며 시설 개선에 따른 이용 패턴 분석 대상이 되는 지역주민 집단임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__community_sport_hub_users</isp:entity_id>
