  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__aid_psychomotor_exercise">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#adapted_physical_activity"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__aid_psychomotor_exercise</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지적장애인 심리운동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">psychomotor exercise for people with intellectual disability</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고령화된 지적장애인의 성공적 노화를 위한 운동 중재의 체계적 문헌 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013~2023년 고령화된 지적장애인 운동중재 연구를 PICO 방식으로 고찰하였고, 심리운동, 승마운동, 낙상예방 복합운동, 보행운동, 건강행동 증진 프로그램에서 심리사회, 체력, 보행, 낙상, 균형, 이동성, 신체활동 수준의 긍정적 변화를 보고하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">고령화된 지적장애인 운동중재 유형 중 심리사회적 변화를 함께 다루는 적응형 신체활동임</isp:definition_text>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">psychomotor exercise for people with intellectual disability</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">고령화된 지적장애인 운동중재 유형 중 심리사회적 변화를 함께 다루는 적응형 신체활동임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">psychomotor exercise for people with intellectual disability</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">지적장애인 심리운동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__pe_health_education_teaching_capacity_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__pe_health_education_teaching_capacity_improvement</isp:entity_id>
