    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Transport Access Resource</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A support resource that addresses mobility, distance, time, or transportation barriers to sport participation.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A support resource that addresses mobility, distance, time, or transportation barriers to sport participation.</skos:definition>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Abstract organizing class retained to group more specific subclasses; no direct individual assignment is expected in the current curation policy.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">Curated in step 6 as abstract/non-leaf empty class. Direct instances should normally be assigned to its leaf subclasses rather than to transport_access_resource.</skos:editorialNote>
  </rdf:Description>
