  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__soccer_career_anxiety_support_need_identification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#mental_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__soccer_career_anxiety_support_need_identification</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">축구선수 진로불안 지원 필요 식별</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">identification of career anxiety support needs for soccer players</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중·고 축구선수의 진로불안과 심리적 성숙 지원 필요를 식별하는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">중ㆍ고 축구선수의 진로불안이 권력거리신념과 경기수행능력에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">진로불안은 경기수행능력의 하위요인과 관련되는 것으로 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">identification of career anxiety support needs for soccer players</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">중·고 축구선수의 진로불안과 심리적 성숙 지원 필요를 식별하는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">identification of career anxiety support needs for soccer players</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">축구선수 진로불안 지원 필요 식별</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__theraband_resistance_senior_fitness">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#senior_fitness"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__theraband_resistance_senior_fitness</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">탄력밴드 기반 노인 저항운동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Theraband-based senior resistance exercise</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">노인의 주요 근육군에 조절 가능한 저항을 제공하는 탄력밴드 기반 신체활동</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Associations Between Skeletal Muscle Mass, Grip Strength, and Physical and Cognitive Functions in Elderly Women: Effect of Exercise with Resistive Theraband</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Exercise Nutrition and Biochemistry</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_url rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.20463/jenb.2019.0023</isp:source_url>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">50-51</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Twenty-eight elderly women participated; 15 underwent elastic band exercise for 1 hour per day, twice per week for 8 weeks. Theraband exercise significantly improved gait speed and physical function.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Theraband-based senior resistance exercise</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">노인의 주요 근육군에 조절 가능한 저항을 제공하는 탄력밴드 기반 신체활동</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Theraband-based senior resistance exercise</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">탄력밴드 기반 노인 저항운동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__elite_sport_human_centered_character_development">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#well_being_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__elite_sport_human_centered_character_development</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">선수 인격 중심 전문체육 문화 형성</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Human-centered character development in elite sport</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">전문체육의 비정상의 정상화</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">몸 닦달이 아니라 몸 닦기의 인성교육이 정상화 방안으로 제시되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Human-centered character development in elite sport</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Human-centered character development in elite sport in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Human-centered character development in elite sport</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">선수 인격 중심 전문체육 문화 형성</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__people_with_disabilities_exercise_participants">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#disabled_person"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__people_with_disabilities_exercise_participants</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인 운동참여자</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Exercise participants with disabilities</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인의 운동 참여 실태와 정신건강 및 주관적 건강인지와의 연관성</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지체, 뇌병변, 청각, 시각, 지적장애인을 분석 대상으로 설정하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v58 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Exercise participants with disabilities</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Exercise participants with disabilities in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Exercise participants with disabilities</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애인 운동참여자</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__physical_education_teacher_training">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#program_information"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">support_resource__physical_education_teacher_training</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 교육과정 이해 연수</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Teacher training for physical education curriculum understanding</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사가 개정 체육과 교육과정을 세밀하게 이해하고 현장에 적용하기 위해 요구된 체계적 연수 정보 자원</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2015 개정 체육과 교육과정에 대한 체육 교사 인식 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육교사 5명을 대상으로 심층면담을 실시하여 2015 개정 체육과 교육과정의 학교 현장 적용 인식을 분석하였다. 교사들은 지역 스포츠 클러스터를 활용한 정과·정과외 수업 연계, 체육수업 내 인문적 활동과 간접체험을 시도하고 있었으며, 간접체험 수업 가이드라인과 체계적 교사 연수의 필요성을 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_qualitative</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:supports_program rdf:resource="#program__regular_extracurricular_pe_linkage_class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Teacher training for physical education curriculum understanding</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체육교사가 개정 체육과 교육과정을 세밀하게 이해하고 현장에 적용하기 위해 요구된 체계적 연수 정보 자원</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Teacher training for physical education curriculum understanding</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육교사 교육과정 이해 연수</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
