    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A target group class representing migrant worker as a population addressed by sport participation policy or programs.</skos:definition>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Abstract organizing class retained to group more specific subclasses; no direct individual assignment is expected in the current curation policy.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">Curated in step 6 as abstract/non-leaf empty class. Direct instances should normally be assigned to its leaf subclasses rather than to migrant_worker.</skos:editorialNote>
  </rdf:Description>
