  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__school_pe_defeat_character_education">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_based_program"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__school_pe_defeat_character_education</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교체육 패배 인성교육 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">school PE defeat-based character education program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학교체육에서 패배 경험을 존중, 배려, 인내, 준비의 학습 경험으로 전환하는 교육 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패배의 재해석: 인성교육적 함의</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패배를 통해 존중과 배려, 패배 인식과 준비, 인내와 기다림을 배울 수 있다고 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__defeat_reinterpretation_character_education_material"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__respect_consideration_through_defeat"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">school PE defeat-based character education program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학교체육에서 패배 경험을 존중, 배려, 인내, 준비의 학습 경험으로 전환하는 교육 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">school PE defeat-based character education program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학교체육 패배 인성교육 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__paralympic_inclusion_research_agenda_identification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#system_level_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__paralympic_inclusion_research_agenda_identification</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패럴림픽 포용 연구의제 식별</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">identification of Paralympic inclusion research agenda</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패럴림픽 연구에서 시각장애, 사회성, 보충제, 포함 등 새로운 의제가 식별되는 성과.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">지식 네트워크 분석을 활용한 패럴림픽 관련 국제 연구의 동향 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">시계열 분석에서 visual-impairment, social, supplement, inclusion 키워드로 지식체계의 변화가 확인되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">identification of Paralympic inclusion research agenda</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">패럴림픽 연구에서 시각장애, 사회성, 보충제, 포함 등 새로운 의제가 식별되는 성과.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">identification of Paralympic inclusion research agenda</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">패럴림픽 포용 연구의제 식별</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__smartphone_video_feedback_futsal_class">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_linked_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__smartphone_video_feedback_futsal_class</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스마트폰 영상 피드백 풋살 수업</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">smartphone video feedback futsal class</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스마트폰 앱을 활용하여 풋살 수행 영상을 제공하고 내적동기와 패스 정확도를 높이는 학교연계 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스마트폰 앱을 활용한 영상 피드백 제공이 학교스포츠클럽 풋살 참여 중학생의 내적 동기와 패스 정확도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">영상 피드백을 받은 집단에서 유능감과 패스 정확도 향상, 긴장 감소가 나타남.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_school_futsal_sports_club_students"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__school_sports_club_futsal"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__smartphone_video_feedback_app"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__futsal_competence_motivation_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__futsal_pass_accuracy_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__futsal_tension_reduction"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">smartphone video feedback futsal class</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">스마트폰 앱을 활용하여 풋살 수행 영상을 제공하고 내적동기와 패스 정확도를 높이는 학교연계 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">smartphone video feedback futsal class</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스마트폰 영상 피드백 풋살 수업</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__middle_school_futsal_sports_club_students"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#support_resource__teacher_self_efficacy_measure">
