  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__golf_field_lesson">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#leisure_sport"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__golf_field_lesson</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">골프 필드레슨</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">golf field lesson</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">필드레슨 참여자의 그릿이 마인드셋과 운동지속에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">골프장에서 이루어지는 필드레슨 참여자를 대상으로 연구하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_delivered_by_program rdf:resource="#program__golf_field_lesson_mindset_support"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">golf field lesson</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing golf field lesson in the sport_activity dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">golf field lesson</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">골프 필드레슨</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__controlled_motivation_athletes">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__controlled_motivation_athletes</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">통제동기를 지각하는 운동선수</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Athletes perceiving controlled motivation</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수들이 지각하는 통제동기가 도핑 의도에 미치는 영향: 자율성의 조절효과 검증</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수 450명을 대상으로 통제동기, 자율성, 도핑 의도의 관계를 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v52 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Athletes perceiving controlled motivation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Athletes perceiving controlled motivation in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Athletes perceiving controlled motivation</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">통제동기를 지각하는 운동선수</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__vr_tball_confidence_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#self_efficacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">VR 티볼 수업 자신감 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Improved confidence through VR T-ball</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">가상현실(VR) 스포츠실을 활용한 초등학교 티볼 수업이 신체활동 즐거움에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">VR 티볼 수업 참여 후 학생의 자신감 요인이 향상되는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">VR 티볼 수업 참여 후 학생의 자신감 요인이 향상되는 성과임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__vr_tball_confidence_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved confidence through VR T-ball</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">VR 티볼 수업 참여 후 학생의 자신감 요인이 향상되는 성과임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved confidence through VR T-ball</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">VR 티볼 수업 자신감 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__adolescents_martial_arts_mental_health_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#adolescent"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__adolescents_martial_arts_mental_health_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무술훈련 기반 정신건강 지원이 필요한 청소년</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Adolescents requiring martial arts-based mental health support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">무술훈련 참여 여부와 정신건강 지표의 차이가 분석된 청소년 대상 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An Empirical Analysis on the Relation between Martial Arts Training and Adolescent Mental Health</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">31-43</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Adolescents who participated in martial arts training showed significantly lower depression, anxiety, and hostility than non-participants; training for more than 1.5 hours per session and over 3 years was associated with better mental health indicators.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Adolescents requiring martial arts-based mental health support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">무술훈련 참여 여부와 정신건강 지표의 차이가 분석된 청소년 대상 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Adolescents requiring martial arts-based mental health support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">무술훈련 기반 정신건강 지원이 필요한 청소년</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#equipment_resource">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#support_resource"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Equipment Resource</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A support resource consisting of devices, equipment, or assistive materials used for sport participation.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A support resource consisting of devices, equipment, or assistive materials used for sport participation.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__elite_athletes_doping_test_psychological_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#target_group"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__elite_athletes_doping_test_psychological_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑검사 심리지원 대상 엘리트 선수</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target group  elite athletes doping test psychological support</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 선수의 도핑검사에 대한 심리적 경험</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">K대학 엘리트 선수 150명의 개방형 설문과 의미연결망 분석에서 도핑검사는 걱정, 불안, 수치심 등 부정적 심리 경험이면서도 선수 윤리와 실력 증명의 도구로 인식됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">target group  elite athletes doping test psychological support</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing target group  elite athletes doping test psychological support in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">target group  elite athletes doping test psychological support</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">도핑검사 심리지원 대상 엘리트 선수</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__low_income_menopause_women_health_education">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__low_income_menopause_women_health_education</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저소득층 폐경기 여성 맞춤형 건강교육</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Tailored health education for low-income menopausal women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저소득층 폐경기 여성의 비만에 따른 대사적 건강상태와 신체활동 및 좌식행동과의 관련성</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">저소득층 폐경기 여성과 같은 건강취약계층을 위한 맞춤형 건강교육과 정책 지원이 필요하다고 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__low_income_menopause_women"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__walking_for_menopause_health"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__low_income_women_health_equity_context"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__menopause_women_abdominal_obesity_risk_reduction"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__menopause_women_quality_of_life_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__menopause_women_metabolic_risk_management"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tailored health education for low-income menopausal women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Tailored health education for low-income menopausal women in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Tailored health education for low-income menopausal women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">저소득층 폐경기 여성 맞춤형 건강교육</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__low_income_menopause_women"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__athlete_satisfaction_improvement_ability_belief">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#life_satisfaction_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__athlete_satisfaction_improvement_ability_belief</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동능력믿음 기반 선수만족 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  athlete satisfaction improvement ability belief</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 운동선수들의 운동능력믿음이 승부근성과 선수만족에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2020</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 선수 447명 연구에서 운동능력믿음이 승부근성과 선수만족에 유의한 영향을 미치고, 승부근성도 선수만족에 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타남.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outcome  athlete satisfaction improvement ability belief</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing outcome  athlete satisfaction improvement ability belief in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outcome  athlete satisfaction improvement ability belief</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">운동능력믿음 기반 선수만족 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__obesity_policy_public_demand_alignment">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#policy_effectiveness_improvement"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만관리 정책의 국민 요구 정합성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Improved alignment of obesity policy with public demand</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">국민 인식과 요구를 반영하여 향후 국가 비만관리 정책의 효과성을 높이는 시스템 수준 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Analysis of public perception of national obesity management policy</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Activity and Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">27-35</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A national online survey of citizens aged 15-69 identified lifestyle improvement for obesity prevention, child and adolescent obesity prevention and management, community-based obesity and exercise clinics, and an integrated information platform for nutrition, diet, and physical activity as important national obesity policy tasks.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__obesity_policy_public_demand_alignment</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved alignment of obesity policy with public demand</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국민 인식과 요구를 반영하여 향후 국가 비만관리 정책의 효과성을 높이는 시스템 수준 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved alignment of obesity policy with public demand</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">비만관리 정책의 국민 요구 정합성 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#lower_grade_taekwondo_training_program">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_linked_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">lower_grade_taekwondo_training_program</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등 저학년 태권도 수련 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Taekwondo training program for lower-grade elementary students</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학교 저학년의 태권도 수련이 사회성에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">초등학교 1~3학년 태권도 수련생과 비참여 학생의 사회성을 비교함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v66_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#lower_grade_taekwondo_participants"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#sociality_development_taekwondo_lower_grade"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#school_life_attitude_improvement_taekwondo"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Taekwondo training program for lower-grade elementary students</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Taekwondo training program for lower-grade elementary students in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Taekwondo training program for lower-grade elementary students</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">초등 저학년 태권도 수련 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#lower_grade_taekwondo_participants"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy_instrument__pyeongchang_paralympic_legacy_plan_strategy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#plan_strategy"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy_instrument__pyeongchang_paralympic_legacy_plan_strategy</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">평창동계패럴림픽 레거시 관리 전략</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PyeongChang Paralympic legacy management strategy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">패럴림픽 시설 활용, 접근성, ICT, 자원봉사, 운영 경험을 후속 장애인체육 발전으로 연결하기 위한 계획 전략</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2018 평창동계패럴림픽 레거시 및 결산 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">한국특수체육학회지</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2018 평창동계패럴림픽의 레거시를 스포츠, 사회, 환경, 도시, 경제에 더해 문화, ICT, 평화 레거시로 고찰하고, 홍보, 예산, 참가자, 관람객, 자원봉사자, 등급분류 제로정책, 체육시설 활용, 수송 및 접근성 극대화, 도핑테스트, 방송·취재 환경, 첨단 ICT 패럴림픽 운영을 결산하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct_documentary</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PyeongChang Paralympic legacy management strategy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">패럴림픽 시설 활용, 접근성, ICT, 자원봉사, 운영 경험을 후속 장애인체육 발전으로 연결하기 위한 계획 전략</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">PyeongChang Paralympic legacy management strategy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">평창동계패럴림픽 레거시 관리 전략</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__male_adolescent_metabolic_syndrome_risk_reduction">
