  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__elderly_with_mild_cognitive_impairment">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__elderly_with_mild_cognitive_impairment</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">elderly with mild cognitive impairment</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">경도인지장애 노인들을 대상으로 시행한 운동 중재 효과 크기 검증을 통한 운동프로그램 고찰</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동프로그램은 8~16주, 주 2~3회, 회당 50~60분으로 구성되었고, 유산소와 저항성 운동을 함께 사용하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">elderly with mild cognitive impairment</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing elderly with mild cognitive impairment in the target_group dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">elderly with mild cognitive impairment</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">경도인지장애 노인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__learning_flow_improvement_pe_college">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육계열 학습몰입 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improvement of learning flow in PE college classes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육계열 대학생들이 지각한 교수의 변혁적 리더십이 교수신뢰, 학습몰입 및 강의만족도 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">변혁적 리더십의 모든 하위요인이 학습몰입에 정적인 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__learning_flow_improvement_pe_college</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improvement of learning flow in PE college classes</rdfs:label>
