  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#policy__adapted_physical_activity_research_direction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#disability_policy"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">policy__adapted_physical_activity_research_direction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인스포츠 연구방향 정책</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">adapted physical activity research direction policy</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애보다 능력, 수행 가능성, 참여 조건을 중심으로 장애인스포츠 연구와 지원 방향을 설정하는 정책.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">파랄림픽과 스포츠 과학</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2000</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">향후 특수체육 연구의 이슈와 주제가 장애 자체보다 능력과 수행에 초점을 둘 필요가 있다고 제시하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">adapted physical activity research direction policy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">장애보다 능력, 수행 가능성, 참여 조건을 중심으로 장애인스포츠 연구와 지원 방향을 설정하는 정책.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">adapted physical activity research direction policy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애인스포츠 연구방향 정책</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__youth_cardiorespiratory_fitness_profile_identification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__youth_cardiorespiratory_fitness_profile_identification</isp:entity_id>
