  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__elderly_women_theraband_resistance_training">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#elderly_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__elderly_women_theraband_resistance_training</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성노인 탄력밴드 저항성 운동 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">thera-band resistance exercise program for elderly women</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">여성노인의 일상생활체력 향상을 위해 탄력밴드를 사용하는 저항성 운동 프로그램.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">탄력밴드를 이용한 저항성 운동과 균형 운동이 여성 노인의 신체구성과 일상생활체력에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">세라밴드를 이용한 저항성 운동을 12주간 주 3회, 회당 60분 실시함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">curated_v68_added_from_uploaded_literature</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_women_community_exercise_participants"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__daily_living_fitness_improvement_elderly_women"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__elderly_balance_ability_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">thera-band resistance exercise program for elderly women</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">여성노인의 일상생활체력 향상을 위해 탄력밴드를 사용하는 저항성 운동 프로그램.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">thera-band resistance exercise program for elderly women</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">여성노인 탄력밴드 저항성 운동 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__elderly_women_community_exercise_participants"/>
  </rdf:Description>
