    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">S시 소재 초등학생 30명을 대상으로 12주간 주 3회, 회당 50분씩 서킷 트레이닝과 플라이오메트릭 트레이닝을 실시하였다. 체질량지수 감소, 심폐지구력, 근지구력, 유연성, 순발력 향상이 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:applies_to_age_range rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">elementary school-aged children</isp:applies_to_age_range>
    <isp:target_participant_size rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">30</isp:target_participant_size>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Elementary school students in circuit-plyometric training</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">12주 서킷 및 플라이오메트릭 트레이닝 연구의 대상이 된 초등학생 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Elementary school students in circuit-plyometric training</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">서킷-플라이오메트릭 트레이닝 참여 초등학생</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__college_life_adjustment_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_participation_increase"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">대학생활적응 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">improvement of college life adjustment</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육전공 대학생들의 전공선택동기와 대학생활적응과의 관계에서 전공만족도의 매개효과 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">전공만족도는 대학생활적응에 정적인 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__college_life_adjustment_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">improvement of college life adjustment</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing improvement of college life adjustment in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">improvement of college life adjustment</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">대학생활적응 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
