  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#functional_ability_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#health_outcome"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Functional Ability Improvement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An outcome class representing improvement in functional ability associated with sport participation policies or programs.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An outcome class representing improvement in functional ability associated with sport participation policies or programs.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__asd_children_social_communication_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#social_relationship_expansion"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__asd_children_social_communication_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자폐스펙트럼 아동 사회적 의사소통 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Improved social communication among children with ASD</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">오르프 음악 결합 스포츠게임 참여를 통해 자폐스펙트럼 아동의 사회적 상호작용과 의사소통 능력을 향상시키는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Combined Orff Music And Sports Activity To Enhances Autism Children’s Social Skills: Trials Of Intervention Effectiveness</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022 3rd Asia Sport Science Conference Abstracts</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">conference_abstract</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">107-109</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The conference abstract recruited twenty-two children with ASD and applied a 9-week Orff music combined sports game intervention three times per week. The intervention improved social skills in children with mild to moderate ASD, with better social interaction effects in the experimental group than the sports-game control group.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved social communication among children with ASD</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">오르프 음악 결합 스포츠게임 참여를 통해 자폐스펙트럼 아동의 사회적 상호작용과 의사소통 능력을 향상시키는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved social communication among children with ASD</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">자폐스펙트럼 아동 사회적 의사소통 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__retired_athlete_identity_career_transition_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__retired_athlete_identity_career_transition_support</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">은퇴선수 정체성·진로전환 지원 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">retired athlete identity and career transition support program</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">은퇴선수의 정체성 변화, 직업 재교육, 사회적 관계 재구성을 지원하는 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 리듬체조 선수들의 은퇴 후 삶에 대한 사례 연구</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2025</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">전직 엘리트 리듬체조 선수 7명의 은퇴 후 경험을 분석한 결과, 정체성 변화, 진로 선택, 사회적 관계 변화, 심리적 고립과 공허감이 나타났다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__retired_elite_rhythmic_gymnasts"/>
    <isp:utilizes_support_resource rdf:resource="#support_resource__retired_athlete_psychological_counseling"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__retired_athlete_identity_reconstruction"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__retired_athlete_career_transition_support"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__retired_athlete_social_isolation_reduction"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">retired athlete identity and career transition support program</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">은퇴선수의 정체성 변화, 직업 재교육, 사회적 관계 재구성을 지원하는 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">retired athlete identity and career transition support program</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">은퇴선수 정체성·진로전환 지원 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__retired_elite_rhythmic_gymnasts"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__twelve_week_complex_exercise_program_preschool_children">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#child_program"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__twelve_week_complex_exercise_program_preschool_children</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유아 12주 복합운동 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Twelve-week complex exercise program for preschool children</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유아의 기초체력과 운동기능 향상을 목적으로 12주간 적용된 복합운동 프로그램</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간 복합운동 프로그램이 유아의 기초체력에 미치는 효과</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2008</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Exercise Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">유아 230명을 대상으로 실험집단과 통제집단으로 구분하여 12주간 복합운동 프로그램을 적용하였다. 사전·사후 측정 결과, 근지구력, 유연성, 순발력, 민첩성, 평형성 등 기초체력과 운동기능에서 긍정적 향상이 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:program_duration_weeks rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">12</isp:program_duration_weeks>
    <isp:sample_size rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">230</isp:sample_size>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__preschool_children_complex_exercise"/>
    <isp:delivers_sport_activity rdf:resource="#sport_activity__preschool_complex_exercise"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__twelve_week_preschool_complex_exercise_sessions"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__preschool_children_basic_fitness_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__preschool_children_functional_skill_improvement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Twelve-week complex exercise program for preschool children</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">유아의 기초체력과 운동기능 향상을 목적으로 12주간 적용된 복합운동 프로그램</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Twelve-week complex exercise program for preschool children</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">유아 12주 복합운동 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__preschool_children_complex_exercise"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__pre_service_pe_teacher_field_competency_improvement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#service_delivery_efficiency"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__pre_service_pe_teacher_field_competency_improvement</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">예비 체육교사 학교현장 역량 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Improved field competency among pre-service PE teachers</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">예비 체육교사가 갖추어야 할 현장직무역량 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">역량기반 체육교사교육을 통해 학교현장의 직무 수행능력이 향상되는 성과임</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">역량기반 체육교사교육을 통해 학교현장의 직무 수행능력이 향상되는 성과임</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Instance added from uploaded literature after topic-fit screening for inclusive sport participation policy ontology.</isp:note>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved field competency among pre-service PE teachers</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">역량기반 체육교사교육을 통해 학교현장의 직무 수행능력이 향상되는 성과임</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved field competency among pre-service PE teachers</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">예비 체육교사 학교현장 역량 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__obese_children_body_composition_improvement_aerobic_exercise">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_health_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__obese_children_body_composition_improvement_aerobic_exercise</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만아동 신체구성 개선</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Body composition improvement in obese children</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주 유산소 운동 후 비만아동의 신체구성에 긍정적 변화가 보고된 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">12주간의 유산소 운동에 의한 비만아동의 신체구성 및 혈액성분 변화</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">1997</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Korean Journal of Exercise Nutrition</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">비만 초등학생 20명을 대상으로 12주간 주 4회, 하루 30분, VO2max 60% 강도의 유산소 운동을 실시하였다. 신체구성과 혈액성분의 긍정적 변화가 보고되었다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Body composition improvement in obese children</rdfs:label>
