    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">baseball national team meaning perception survey</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프로야구 팬의 사회공정성, 사회신뢰성, 국가정체성 인식이 야구 국가대표 의미에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2023</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">프로야구 팬 330명을 대상으로 사회공정성, 사회신뢰성, 국가정체성 인식이 야구 국가대표 의미에 미치는 영향을 분석하였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-17</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__professional_baseball_fans_national_team_perception"/>
    <isp:is_delivered_in_context rdf:resource="#participation_context__baseball_national_team_public_fairness_context"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__baseball_national_team_national_value_recognition"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__baseball_national_team_institutional_value_recognition"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">baseball national team meaning perception survey</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing baseball national team meaning perception survey in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">baseball national team meaning perception survey</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">야구 국가대표 의미 인식 조사</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__professional_baseball_fans_national_team_perception"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__judo_antidoping_habitual_ethics_internalization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__judo_antidoping_habitual_ethics_internalization</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">반도핑 습관화와 윤리 내면화</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  judo antidoping habitual ethics internalization</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 유도선수들의 반도핑 경향에 대한 근원적 분석</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2015</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트 유도선수 10명 질적연구에서 도핑 인지 수준, 도핑검사 경험, 체급 특성에 따른 도핑 유혹, 윤리교육의 필요가 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outcome  judo antidoping habitual ethics internalization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing outcome  judo antidoping habitual ethics internalization in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outcome  judo antidoping habitual ethics internalization</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">반도핑 습관화와 윤리 내면화</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
