  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#program__sport_major_academic_self_efficacy_support">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capacity_building_program"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육계열 학업적 자기효능감 지원 프로그램</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic self-efficacy support program for sport majors</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">체육계열 대학생들의 학업적 자기효능감과 전공만족도 및 진로결정태도의 관계</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2018</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uploaded_pdf</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학업적 자기효능감은 전공만족도와 진로결정태도에 유의한 영향을 미쳤다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:targets_target_group rdf:resource="#target_group__sport_related_college_students"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__sport_major_satisfaction_improvement"/>
    <isp:produces_outcome rdf:resource="#outcome__sport_major_career_decision_attitude_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">program__sport_major_academic_self_efficacy_support</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">academic self-efficacy support program for sport majors</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing academic self-efficacy support program for sport majors in the program dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">academic self-efficacy support program for sport majors</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">체육계열 학업적 자기효능감 지원 프로그램</skos:prefLabel>
    <isp:has_target_group_anchor rdf:resource="#target_group__sport_related_college_students"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__korean_elementary_schoolchildren_pa_monitoring">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#school_age_child"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__korean_elementary_schoolchildren_pa_monitoring</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">신체활동 모니터링이 필요한 한국 초등학생</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean elementary schoolchildren requiring physical activity monitoring</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">일일 걸음수와 신체활동 수준을 기준으로 활동량 점검과 신체활동 증진 지원이 필요한 한국 초등학생 집단</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Association between daily step counts and physical activity level among Korean elementary schoolchildren</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Journal of Exercise Nutrition and Biochemistry</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2016</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">journal_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:source_page rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">51-55</isp:source_page>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Children aged 9 to 12 years from two urban Korean elementary schools were measured for total energy expenditure with doubly labeled water and step counts with accelerometers. Steps per day were positively associated with physical activity level among all subjects and in boys, and the authors concluded that locomotor activity contributed to physical activity level differences among elementary school boys.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-14</isp:last_updated>
    <isp:is_currently_active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</isp:is_currently_active>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Korean elementary schoolchildren requiring physical activity monitoring</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">일일 걸음수와 신체활동 수준을 기준으로 활동량 점검과 신체활동 증진 지원이 필요한 한국 초등학생 집단</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Korean elementary schoolchildren requiring physical activity monitoring</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">신체활동 모니터링이 필요한 한국 초등학생</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__student_athlete_sport_career_support_access">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#capability_outcome"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__student_athlete_sport_career_support_access</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생선수 스포츠진로 지원 접근성 향상</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Improved access to sport career support for student-athletes</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">학생선수와 일반학생이 스포츠 진로교육과 상담에 접근할 수 있게 되는 성과</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠진로상담사 양성교육과정 설계방안</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">일반학생과 학생선수의 스포츠진로교육 정책과 프로그램 개발의 근거자료로 활용 가능하다고 제시함</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2019</isp:source_year>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Improved access to sport career support for student-athletes</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">학생선수와 일반학생이 스포츠 진로교육과 상담에 접근할 수 있게 되는 성과</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Improved access to sport career support for student-athletes</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">학생선수 스포츠진로 지원 접근성 향상</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#target_group__adults_with_acquired_brain_lesion_hemiplegia">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#physical_disability"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target_group__adults_with_acquired_brain_lesion_hemiplegia</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">편측사지 중도 뇌병변장애 성인</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">adults with acquired brain lesions in hemiplegia</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">사고나 질병 이후 편측사지 기능 제한을 경험하는 성인 중도 뇌병변장애인 집단.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수중재활운동이 편측사지 중도 뇌병변장애인의 심리적 안정과 정신적 준비기에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성인 편측사지 중도 뇌병변장애인 7명을 대상으로 8개월간 수중운동 프로그램을 적용함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">adults with acquired brain lesions in hemiplegia</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사고나 질병 이후 편측사지 기능 제한을 경험하는 성인 중도 뇌병변장애인 집단.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">adults with acquired brain lesions in hemiplegia</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">편측사지 중도 뇌병변장애 성인</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__disabled_children_tension_pressure_reduction">
