  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__coach_learning_fatigue_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#well_being_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__coach_learning_fatigue_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스포츠지도자 학습피로 완화</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome  coach learning fatigue reduction</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">엘리트스포츠 영역의 법정의무교육 현황 및 개선방향: 스포츠지도자의 학습피로를 중심으로</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2022</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">현직 스포츠지도자 12명 심층면담을 통해 스포츠윤리, 인권, 성폭력예방, 반도핑 법정의무교육의 학습피로 문제가 확인되고 내용·시간·방법 개선 필요가 제시됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outcome  coach learning fatigue reduction</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing outcome  coach learning fatigue reduction in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outcome  coach learning fatigue reduction</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스포츠지도자 학습피로 완화</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#sport_activity__scuba_diving_leisure_activity">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#leisure_sport"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport_activity__scuba_diving_leisure_activity</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스쿠버다이빙 레저활동</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">scuba diving leisure activity</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:definition_text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">수중환경을 탐험하고 관찰하는 도전적 해양레저 스포츠활동.</isp:definition_text>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스쿠버다이버의 선택속성이 재방문의도 및 추천의도에 미치는 영향</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">스쿠버다이빙은 수중세계를 탐험하고 관찰하는 수중레저활동으로 설명됨.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">scuba diving leisure activity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">수중환경을 탐험하고 관찰하는 도전적 해양레저 스포츠활동.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">scuba diving leisure activity</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">스쿠버다이빙 레저활동</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
