  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#participation_context__independent_living_center_welfare_center">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#participation_context"/>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">장애인자립생활센터·복지관 참여 맥락</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">independent living center and welfare center context</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">성인 발달장애인의 변형된 야구 프로그램 참여 경험을 통한 신체적 자기효능감과 자기결정성 변화 탐색</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2024</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_publisher rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Asian Journal of Physical Education and Sport Science</isp:source_publisher>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A장애인자립생활센터와 B복지관의 성인 발달장애인을 대상으로 프로그램을 운영함.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">participation_context__independent_living_center_welfare_center</isp:entity_id>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">independent living center and welfare center context</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing independent living center and welfare center context in the participation_context dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">independent living center and welfare center context</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">장애인자립생활센터·복지관 참여 맥락</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#outcome__controlled_motivation_doping_intention_reduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="#health_literacy_improvement"/>
    <isp:entity_id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">outcome__controlled_motivation_doping_intention_reduction</isp:entity_id>
    <isp:pref_label_ko rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">도핑 의도 감소</isp:pref_label_ko>
    <isp:pref_label_en rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Doping intention reduction</isp:pref_label_en>
    <isp:source_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">운동선수들이 지각하는 통제동기가 도핑 의도에 미치는 영향: 자율성의 조절효과 검증</isp:source_title>
    <isp:source_year rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2021</isp:source_year>
    <isp:source_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">academic_article</isp:source_type>
    <isp:evidence_excerpt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">자율성은 도핑 의도에 부적 영향을 미치며 통제동기와 도핑 의도 관계에서 조절효과를 보였다.</isp:evidence_excerpt>
    <isp:evidence_strength_level rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">direct</isp:evidence_strength_level>
    <isp:note rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Added in v52 from uploaded academic literature; class assignment limited to directly evidenced entities.</isp:note>
    <isp:last_updated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-05-16</isp:last_updated>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Doping intention reduction</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Named individual representing Doping intention reduction in the outcome dimension of the Inclusive Sport Participation Policy Ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Doping intention reduction</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ko">도핑 의도 감소</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
